<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Mwela Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">LUK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani ja Mmbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Shilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Shilongolelo sha Ngani ja Mmbone Malinga pujijandikwe na a Luka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabhu sha Ngani ja Mmbone malinga pushijandikwe na a Luka ni munkumbi gwa itabhu nsheshe ya Malagano Gayambi italashiya malanga gubhatamaga a Yeshu Kilishitu. Kila shimo pushishemwa “Injili.” Lilobhe likwete malombolelo ga “Ngani ja Mmbone.” Yene itabhui puijandikwe bhakaweje a Yeshu, itabhu ya a Mateiei na a Luka na a Yowana. A Luka bhangajandika ga ndagulilo ya ndamo ga a Yeshupe, ikabhe nnepeila bhashijandika ga indu ibhatendilenje bhajiganywa bha a Yeshu, kungai bhakaweje na bhakayusheje. Shene shitabhusho pushishemwa Itendi ya Mitume. Jwakwapi akulimanya lyubha pushijandikwe shitabhu sha Ngani malinga Shijijandikwe na a Luka, wala mmbali ja kushijandikwe. Bhakwetenje lumanyio bhabhagwinji bhakutinji pushijandikwe shaka sha 70 BK.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhaajandika bhakwe pubhaliji a Luka, a dakitali. Ukonjeleyo gwa nkujandika kwabho na shibhashite kugamanya ukoto malobhe ga ibheleketo, inamanyika kuti pubhaliji bhandu bha lumanyio. A Luka bhashinkupinga kujandika matalashiyo gammbone ga ndamo, ga a Yeshu kwa tagulila indu yatendeshe malinga shiyashite koposhela kupinga na bhandunji bhananji bhaimanyanje pushibhashomanjepo (Luka 1:1-3). A Luka bhakaliji Bhayaudi (Wakolosai 4:10-14), bhashinkujandika kwa tenda nabhalabhonji bhalinginji nngabha Bhayaudi bhakamumanyinji. Genega ganamanyika ukoto pubhatalashiya ga ikubho ya Shiyaudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabhu sha Ngani ja Mmbone malinga pujijandikwe na a Luka shinalandana na itabhu ya a Matei na a Maliko pabha yowe inatagulila indu ila peila kwa mitagulilo jilandana. Munkumbi gwa yene itabhu itatui, shitabhu sha a Luka ndio shitagulila ukoto ga ngani ja bhelekwa kwa a Yowana Bhabhatisha. A Luka bhanakomelesheya ga leshelelwa yambi (Luka 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34) na nnepeila ga juga Nnungu (Luka 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-2).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ipali Mwenemo</para>
  <para style="io">1. Luka 1:1-4 A Luka bhanabhalanga shilongolelo sha shitabhu shabho sha Ngani ja Mmbone na bhanatalashiya ligongo lya jandika kwabho.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kungai bhanatalashiya ngani ja bhelekwa kwa a Yeshu na shibhashite bhikwa ukoto kwa liengo (Luka 1:5-4, 13).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Papakulungwa paigalile pa Ngani ja Mmbone (4:14-21:38) a Luka bhanatalashiya maengo gubhatendile a Yeshu na kaje, ga ilapo ibhatendile na ga indu ibhajigenye.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Luka 22-24, a Luka bhanatagulila ga a Yeshu shibhashitewa na yuka kukopoka kubhawilenje.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Shilongolelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinjinji bhashilajililanga kujandika ukoto ngani ja indu yatendekaga munkumbi gwetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Bhashinkujandikanga malinga shitwatagulilwe na bhandunji bhagabhweninji pugatendekaga, kuumila kundandubho na bhalunguyangaga lilobhe lya a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Kwa nneyo, mmakulungwa a Teopili, numbe nne ngakagulileje ukoto yowe kuumila kundandubho, njibhona inapwaa ninnjandishile shiyashite tendeka, <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>nkupinga na mmwe muumanye ukweli gwa yowe innjigenywe ila.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa a Yowana Bhabhatisha Kunalugulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mobha ga upalume gwa a Elode ku Yudea, bhashinkupagwa bhaabhishila bhamo lina lyabho a Shakalia, bha likundi lya a Abhiya. Akongobhabho pubhashemwaga a Lishabheti bha shipinga sha a Aluni, bhakulungwa bhaabhishila. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Bhowe bhanaabhili bhashinkubhanganga bhandunji bha aki kwa a Nnungu, bhalikagulilanga amuli na malajilo ga Bhakulungwa gwangali kugambwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Ikabheje bhakakwetenjeje bhana, pabha a Lishabheti pubhaaliji nannii na bhanaabhili pubhalinginji bhakongopanji kaje.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Lyubha limo lya nnimbu gwa liengo lya bhishila gwa a Shakalia nniekalu, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>malinga shigwaliji nkubho gwabhonji, a Shakalia bhashinkuagulwa kwa shikoma, bhajinjile nniekalu bhakatutumye lubhani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Akuno lugwinjili lowe lwa bhandu pubhalinginji palanga bhalikwaajuganga a Nnungu, malanga ga tutumya lubhani.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Malaika jwa Bhakulungwa akwaakoposhelaga, gwabhajimile nkono nnilo gwa shitala sha tutumishiya lubhani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>A Shakalia bhakammoneje malaika jwa a Nnungu jula gubhatengwishe na jogopa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Malaika jwa a Nnungu jula gwabhalugulile, “A Shakalia, nnajogope pabha kujuga kwenu kupilikenwe, na akongobhenu a Lishabheti, shibhankolele mwana jwannume, na mmwe shimunsheme lina lyakwe a Yowana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>“Mpinga kwiinonyela kwa kaje na bhandu bhabhagwinji bhapinga angalilanga kubhelekwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Shabhe jwankulungwa pa meyo ga Bhakulungwa, akapinjikwa kung'wa togwa wala ukana, apinga gumbaywa Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, kuumila nnutumbo lwa akwabhe. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Shaabhatendebhuyanje bha Ishilaeli bhabhagwinji bhaabhujilanje Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Shaalongolele pa meyo ga Bhakulungwa alikomboywa na mbumu na mashili malinga a Eliya. Apinga lundanya mitima ja ashainamundu na bhana bhabhonji, apinga kwaatendanga bhakakwaakundanga a Nnungu kubha na ng'aniyo ya aki, nkupinga abhaalashiye Bhakulungwa bhandunji shibhabhanganje tayali kwaaposhela.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>A Shakalia gubhammushiye malaika jula, “Yeneyo nne pushiniimanye bhuli? Nne nankongopa na akangu na bhalabho bhakongopele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Malaika jwa a Nnungu gwabhalugulile, “Nne Gabhulieli, ntumishi ngujima pameyo ga a Nnungu, njitumwa kumelekete na mmwe, nintashiye jene ngani ja mmboneji. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Pabha mmangakulupalila gapinga koposhela kwa malanga gakwega, shimme bhubhu, nkakombola kubheleketa mpaka lyubha pushigakoposhele gunimmalanjilega.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Penepo bhandu bhaalindililangaga a Shakalia gubhakanganigwenje kwa nndi bhashikabhiya Nniekalu mula. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Bhakakoposheje palanga bhakakombweleje kubheleketa nabhonji. Gubhamumanyinji kuti ipali ibhaiweni Nniekalu mula. Ikabheje gubhapundile bheleketa nabhonji kwa ilangulo ya makono, pabha bhashinkubha bhubhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Nnimbu gwabho gwa liengo lya bhishila ukamaleje, a Shakaliya gubhabhujile kumui. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Pangakabhika a Lishabheti gubhajukwite shitumbo. Gubhatemi pamui miyei nng'ano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Bhalinkuti, “Nnei ni shibhandendele Bhakulungwa bhakamoneje, bhashinjosheya oni jangu, jinakolaga pa meyo ga bhandunji.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa a Yeshu Kunalondolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mwei gwa shita gwa shitumbo sha a Lishabheti, malaika jwa a Nnungu Gabhulieli ashinkutumwa na a Nnungu ajende ku Nashaleti ja ku Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>kwa a mwali bhaishana bhashemwaga a Malia, ntemela gwa a Yoshepu bha shipinga sha a Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Malaika jula gwabhajendele, nikwaabhalanjila, “Shalamu shenu mmwe a Malia! Nshipegwa nema yaigwinji! Bhakulungwa pubhali na mmwe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>A Malia bhakapilikaneje gene malobhego gubhatengwishe kaje, nikwiibhuya sha muntima, shene shalamushi malombolelo gakwe nndi? <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Malaika jula gwabhalugulile, “Nnajogope a Malia, pabha Bhakulungwa bhashikumpa nema. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Pilikana! Shinnjukute shitumbo, na shinkole mwana jwannume na munsheme lina lyakwe Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Jwenejo apingabha jwankulungwa na shashemwe Mwana jwa bhali Kunani Kaje. Bhakulungwa a Nnungu shibhampe shitengu sha upalume sha anaigwe a Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Kwa nneyo shabhe Nkulungwa jwa shipinga sha a Yakobho pitipiti na upalume gwakwe ukakola mpelo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>A Malia gubhammushiye malaika, “Pushiitendeshe yeneyo bhuli, na nne niibhelele mwali nng'ishana nganabhe kummanya jwannume?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Malaika jula gwajangwile, “Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo shannjiile na mashili ga Bhakulungwa a Nnungu shiganng'unishile mbuti shiwili, kwa nneyo, mwana shabhelekwejo, shashemwe jwa Ukonjelo, Mwana jwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Na mmumanye kuti nkali alongo ajenu a Lishabheti na ukongopa gwabho bhajukwite shitumbo sha mwana jwannume, aguno mwei gwabho gwa nng'ano na gumo kwa bhene bhamanyishe na bhandu kuti anannii. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Pabha shakwa shikaakomboleka kwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>A Malia gubhashite, “Nne nantumwa jwa Bhakulungwa, ibhe malinga shiumalanjile.” Bhai malaika jula gwajabhwile.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Malia Bhanakwaowela a Lishabheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Gakapiteje malanga gashoko, a Malia gubhapite shangu ku shilambo shimo sha kuitumbi ya ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Kweneko gubhajinjile nnyumba ja a Shakalia, nikwaalamushila a Lishabheti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>A Lishabheti bhakapilikaneje lamushilwa na a Malia, shitumbo sha a Lishabheti shikutukulaga nkwiinonyela. Na bhalabho a Lishabheti Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo akwaagumbalaga, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>nigubhabhelekete kwa lilobhe lya utiya, “Nshipegwa mboka kupunda bhanabhakongwe bhowe, na mwana junkupinga kunkolajo ashipegwa mboka. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Kwa bhuli nne njikuywa nnei, nkali anyinamundu bha Bhakulungwa bhangu bhang'owele? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Nnole! Ngapilikanejepe kulamushila kwenu, shitumbo shangu shikutukulaga nkwiinonyela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Mbaya mmwe nkulupalile kuti yene immalanjilwe na Bhakulungwa ila shiitendeshe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Malia Bhanakwainiya a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Na bhalabho a Malia gubhashite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ntima gwangu unakwaakuya Bhakulungwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Na mbumu yangu inakwiinonyela ligongo lya a Nnungu Bhaatapula bhangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Pabha bhashikuubhona ungakola mashili uka ntumishi jwabho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kwa nneyo kuumila nnaino ibheleko yowe shibhanjemanje akwete mboka,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Pabha a Nnungu Bhakwete Mashili, bhashindendela gamakulungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Na lina lyabho ni bha ukonjelo.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Bhenebho bhanakwaabhonelanga shiya bhene bhakwaajogopanga bhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">kuumila lubheleko mpaka lubheleko.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Pabha kwa mashili ga nkono gwabho bhashitenda gamakulungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Bhashikwapwilinganyanga bhakwetenje mbwinya mmitima jabhonji,<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Bhashikwaatuluyanga bhapalume mwitengu yabhonji ya upalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">Nikwaakweyanga bhaitimalikenje.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Bhakwetenje shibhanga bhashikwaatendanga bhajukutanje ya mmbone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">Ikabhe matajili bhashikwaalekanga bhapwilingane gwangali shoshowe.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Bhashikunnjangutila ntumishi jwabho Ishilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">Bhalikumbushila miadi ja kummonela shiya.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Kwa a Bhulaimu na lubheleko lwabho pitipiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Malinga shibhaabhalanjilenje bhanangulungwa bhetu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>A Malia nigubhatemi na a Lishabheti malinga myei jitatu, nigubhabhujile kunngwabho.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa a Yowana Bhabhatisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Mobha ga kwigopola a Lishabheti gakaishileje, gubhaigopwele mwana jwannume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Ashaatami ajabho na ashaalongo ajabho bhakapilikananjeje, kuti Bhakulungwa bhaabhonele shiya sha kaje a Lishabheti, gubhaengelelenje pamo na bhenebho.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Lyubha lya nane gubhaikengenenje kukuntaga mwana unyago, nigubhapinjilenje kumpa lina lya ainagwe, Shakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Ikabheje akwabhe nigubhakanile, bhalinkuti, “Nngabha, ikabhe shashemwe a Yowana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Pakuti jwakwa mundu muulongo gwenu ashemwa lyene linalyo!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Bhai gubhaabhushiyenje ainagwe kwa ilangulo ya makono bhamumanyanje lina lyashi libhapinga kumpa mwanagwabho.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Numbe a Shakalia gubhajujile shibhao sha jandika, gubhajandishe nnei, “Lina lyakwe a Yowana.” Gubhakanganigwenje bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Popo pepo a Shakalia, gubhakombwele kubheleketa kabhili, bhalinkwaakuya a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Ashaatami ajabho bhowe gubhajogopenje, na bhandu bhowe bhatendaga kungulushilanga jene nganijo mmbali yowe ya shilambo sha mwiitumbi ya ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Bhowe bhapilikenenje genego, gubhaganishiyenje mmitima jabhonji nikwiibhuya, “Igala jwene mwanaju apingabha mundu jwashi?” Pabha nkono gwa Bhakulungwa pugwaaliji naka jwenejo.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulondola gwa a Shakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>A Shakalia, ainagwe mwana, gubhagumbeywe naka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, gubhalondwele nnei,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Bhapegwe mboka Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bha Ishilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Pabha bhashikwiya kukwagombolanga bhandu bhabho.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Bhashikutupa Nkutapula jwa makangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">Jwa uukulu gwa a Daudi bhatumishi bhabho.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Bhabhelenje kuumila bhukala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">Kupitila bhaalondola bhabho bha Ukonjelo,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Kuti shibhatutapule mmakono ga ashaamagongo ajetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">Na bhowe bhakutushimanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Pubhashite kuti shibhaabhonelanje shiya bhanangulungwa bhetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">Na shibhakumbushile malagano gabho ga Ukonjelo.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Bhashinkulumbila kwa ambuje a Bhulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73">Kuti shibhatutende uwe<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>Tugombolwe mmakono ga ashaamagongo ajetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Kupinga twatindibhalile gwangali lipamba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Kwa Ukonjelo na aki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">Mobha getu gowe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Na ugwe mwanangu, shushemwe, nkulondola jwa Bhakulungwa a Nnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Shugwaalongolele Bhakulungwa kukwaalashiya mpanda gwabho,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Kwaalungushiyanga bhandu bhabho kuti, shibhatapulwanje</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">Kwa leshelelwa yambi yabhonji.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>A Nnungu bhetu shibhatutendele nneyo kwa ligongo lya potekwa ntima na shiya shabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Na Ntapulo gwabho shiututulushile kukopoka kunnungu malinga nshenje,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Kupinga kwaamulishilanga bhowe bhatemingenenje nnubhindu lwa shiwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">Bhatulongoye ndamo yetu tutame kwa ulele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwana gwakulile na gwapundile kukola mashili muntima. Gwatemi kuanga mpaka lyubha lyailangwile ku bhandu bha Ishilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matei 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Gene mobhago, a Kaishali bhashemwaga a Augushito, bhakulungwa bhakulu bha upalume gwa Shiloma bhashinkulajiya bhalikwaapinganga bhandunji bhowe bhalinginji muupalume gwabho bhakajandikwanje. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Kwene kujandikwako pukwaaliji kutandubha kwene kuumila a Kileniashi pubhaaliji bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Shilia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Bhai bhowe bhapinjikwenje gubhapitengenenje kuujandikwa kila mundu kushilambo shakwe shabhelekwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>A Yoshepu nabhalabho ni gubhajabhwile ku Nashaleti, shilambo sha ku Galilaya, pabha pubhaaliji bha ulongo bha shipinga shimo na bhakulungwa a Daudi, gubhapite ku Bheteleemu shilambo sha ku Yudea kubhabhelekwe bhakulungwa a Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Gubhapite kuujandikwa na bha ntemela gwabho a Malia bhali na shitumbo. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Bhalinginji ku Bheteleemu, lyubha lyabho lya kwiigopola likuishilaga, <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>gubhankwete mwana lielo lyabho, gubhanng'washiye nngubho shinambombe, gubhanngoneshe pa lila ng'ombe, pabha bhakapatilenjeje pa gona nnyumba ja bhajeninji.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhashunga na Ashimalaika bha a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Tome na ku Bheteleemu bhashinkupagwanga bhashunga bhatamanganaga mukonde, shilo bhalinginji muulinda gwa ngondolo yabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Malaika jwa a Nnungu gwabhakoposhelenje na Ukonjelo gwa Bhakulungwa a Nnungu ukwamulishilangaga powe. Gubhatengukenje. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Ikabheje malaika gwabhalugulilenje, “Nnatengukanje! Pabha njikwiya kummalanjilanga ngani ja mmbone, jakwaanonyelanga bhandu bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Lelo nshilambo sha a Daudi ashibhelekwa nkutapula jwenunji, jwenejo ni Kilishitu ali Nkulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Na sheshino shishibhe shilangulo shenunji. Shimunng'imananje nambombe awashiywe nngubho ya shinambombe, agonekwe pa lila ng'ombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Shangupe likundi lyalikulungwa lya ashimalaika bhananji bha kunnungu bhakwiilundangaga pamo naka malaika jula, bhalikwainiyanga a Nnungu bhalinkutinji.<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Bhakuywe a Nnungu kunani kunnunungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">Na pa shilambolyo pabhe na ulele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">ku bhandu bhakwaanonyelanga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Ashimalaika bhala, bhakajabhulanganeje kubhuja kunnungu, bhashunga gubhabhalanjilenenje. “Twendangananje ku Bheteleemu tukalibhone lyene likoposhele libhatubhalanjile Bhakulungwa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Bhai, gubhapitengenenje lubhilo, gubhaimenenje a Malia na a Yoshepu naka nambombe jula agonekwe pa lila ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Bhashunga bhakammonanjeje mwana jula gubhaalungushiyenje bhandu bhowe ngani jakwe jibhapilikenenje jila. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Bhowe bhapilikenenje jene ngani jibhalugulilwangaga na bhashungajo bhala gubhakanganigwenje. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Ikabheje a Malia gubhagabhishile gowe muntima akuno bhaliganishiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Bhashunga bhala gubhabhujengenenje, akuno bhalikwakuyanga na kwaainiya a Nnungu, kwa gowe gubhapilikenenje na kugabhona, gashinkubha malinga shibhalugulilwenje.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Anapegwa Lina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Gakamalileje mobha nane mwana gwatagwile unyago, gubhanshemilenje lina lyakwe Yeshu, lina lyapegwilwe na malaika jwa a Nnungu, akwabhe bhakanabhe jukuta shitumbo.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakamuywa Kubhakulungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Lukapiteje luuko, malinga Shalia ja a Musha shijilajila, a Yoshepu na akongobhabho a Malia gubhampelekenje mwana ku Yelushalemu kukunkamuya ku Bhakulungwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>malinga Shalia ja Bhakulungwa shijishite, “Kila mwana jwa lielo jwannume shaabhe jwa ukonjelo jwa Bhakulungwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Nneila peila gubhashoshiyenje mbepei ya nnjubha ibhili eu mabhunda gabhili ga ngunda, malinga Shalia ja Bhakulungwa shijapingaga.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Gene mobhago ku Yelushalemu bhashinkupagwa bhandu bhamo, pubhaliji bhandu bha aki na bhatendaga kwaatindibhalila a Nnungu, pubhashemwaga a Shimoni. Bhenebho bhatendaga lolela gwa lilaka ntapulo gwa bha Ishilaeli. Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo paaliji pamo na bhenebho alikwaataga ntima. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo ashinkwaibhulila kuti bhakawa bhakanabhe kummona Kilishitu jwa Bhakulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Bhai bhalilongoywa na Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, a Shimoni gubhapite ku Liekalu. A Yoshepu na akongobhabho, gubhampelekenje mwana Yeshu Nniekalu kukuntendela malinga nkubho gwa Shalia ja a Musha shijapingaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>A Shimoni gubhamposhele mwana Yeshu jula mmakono gabho, akuno bhalikwakuya a Nnungu, bhalinkuti.<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Mmakulungwa nnaino malagano genu gamalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">Mpingaga munneshe ntumishi jwenu akapumulile kwa ulele malinga shimwalajile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Pabha meyo gangu gaubhweni ntapulo gwenu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>gummishile tayali ku bhandu bha ilambo yowe,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>sheneshi ni shilangaya shipinga kwaamulishilanga bhandu bhangali kubha Bhayaudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na Ukonjelo ku bhandu bhenu bha Ishilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Ainamundu na akwabhe Yeshu gubhakanganigwenje kwa malobhe gabheleketwe kwa ligongo lika mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>A Shimoni gubhaapelenje mboka, gubhaalugulile a Malia, akwabhe Yeshu, “Aju mwanaju ashibhelekwa kwa ligongo lya kutuluywa na kukuywa kwa bhandu bhabhagwinji nshilambo sha Ishilaeli. Na jweneju shaabhe shilapo shipinga kanwa na bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Kwa nneyo ng'aniyo ya bhandu bhabhagwinji ipinga bhoneka gwangali nng'iyo! Na mmwe mmayene ntima gwenu upinga kumpoteka mbuti nng'omilwe na lipanga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Bhashinkupagwa bhakongwe bhamo bhakongopa, a nkulondola bha a Nnungu lina lyabho a Ana abhiti a Panueli bha shipinga sha a Asheli. Bhashinkulombwa nitama nshilombani yaka shabha ambunjebhabho ni gubhawile. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Gubhatemi nshitenga yaka makumi nane na nsheshe. Mobha gowego mubhatamaga Nniekalu bhalitabha nkwaajuga a Nnungu shilo na mui. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Popo pego, gubhaikopweye mmujo, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu na gubhalungwiye ngani jika jwene mwanajo kubhandu bhowe bhatemingenenje nkulindilila kutapulwa kwa Yelushalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja ku Nashaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Ainamundu na anyinamundu bhakatendanjeje yowe yalajilwe na Shalia ja Bhakulungwa, gubhabhujengene kunngwabhonji ku Nashaleti nshilambo sha ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwana gwakulile, gwapundile kukola mashili, gwagumbele lunda na nema ja a Nnungu pujaaliji naka jwenejo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nshanda Yeshu Nnyumba ja Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Ainamundu na anyinamundu malinga shigwaliji nkubho gwabhonji gwa kwenda ku Yelushalemu kila shaka mobha ga shikukuu ja Shiyaudi jishemwa Pashaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yeshu akaishileje yaka likumi limo na ibhili malinga shigwaliji nkubho gwabhonji bhowe gubhajombokenje kwenda kushikukuu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Shikapiteje shikukuu, gubhatandubhenje mwanja gwa bhuja kunngwabhonji, ikabheje Yeshu gwalepeshe ku Yelushalemu, gwangali ainagwe na akwabhe kumumanyanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Pubhaganishiyangaga kuti mwali munkumbi gwa bhandu, gubhapitengenenje mwanja gwa totolo, kungai gubhatandubhenje kunnoleya kubhaulongo na kwa ashaambwiga ajabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Pabha bhangammonanga, gubhabhujengenenje ku Yelushalemu pita kunnoleya.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Lyubha lya tatu, gubhanng'imenenje ku Liekalu ali atemi munkumbi gwa bhaajiganya bha Shalia alikwaapilikanishiyanga akuno alikwaabhuyanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Bhowe bhapilikenenje malobhe gakwe, bhashinkulapanga kwa ijangulo yakwe na lunda lwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Ainagwe na akwabhe bhashinkukanganigwanga bhakammonanjeje. Akwabhe a Malia gubhammushiye, “Gwe mwanangu, kwa nndi ushikututenda nnei? Nne na ainago tushikuuloleya kwa lipamba.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Jwalakwe gwabhajangwilenje, “Kwa nndi mmanganya kunoleyanga? Nkakumumanyanga kuti nne ngunapinjikwa nnyumba ja Atati?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Ikabheje bhankwetenje bhangagamanyanga malombolelo ga malobhe gabhaalugulilenje gala.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Bhai gubhalongenenajonji kubhuja ku Nashaleti, gwapundile kwaakundanga. Akwabhe gubhagabhishile muntima gene gowego. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Na jwalakwe Yeshu gwapundile kukula kwa shanga na lunda, gwapundile kupingwa na a Nnungu na bhandunji.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Miungu ja a Yoana Bhabhatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matei 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Shaka sha kumi na nng'ano sha tagwala kwabho a Kaishali Tibhelio, a Pontio Pilato pubhaliji bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Yudea. A Elode pubhaliji bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Galilaya, na akulubhabho a Pilipi pubhaliji bhakulungwa bha ilambo ya ku Itulea na ku Tilakoniti. A Lishaniashi pubhaaliji bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Abhilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>a Anashi na a Kayapa pubhalinginji bhakulungwanji bha bhaabhishila. Gene mobhago a Yowana bhanabhabho a Shakalia gulyajiile lilobhe lya a Nnungu kuanga kula. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Bhai a Yowana gubhapite mitala jowe jipikene na lushi lwa Yolodani bhalilunguya kuti, bhandu bhalekanje yambi yabhonji na bhatishwa, nkupinga a Nnungu bhaaleshelelanje yambi yabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Malinga shiishite jandikwa nshitabhu sha a Ishaya a nkulondola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Lilobhe lika mundu linapilikanika kuanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mwaalashiyanje Bhakulungwa mpanda gwabho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Nngoloyanje mushibhapite.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Kila liimbo shilikulilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Kila shitumbi na shikweya shiilinganywe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Papindile shipagoloywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Mipanda jangali ja mmbone jipinga alaywa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na, bhandu bhowe shibhaubhonanje ntapulo gwa a Nnungu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Bhai a Yowana gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandu bhabhagwinji bhaikanganaga kuubhatishwa, kuti “Mmanganya bhana bha lijoka! Gani ammalanjilenje nnjibhutukanje nnjimwa ja a Nnungu jikwiya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Bhai nnanguyanje kwa itendi kuti mwiipetilenje yambi yenunji nikwaabhujila a Nnungu. Nnatandubhanje kwibheleketela kuti ‘Uwe a Bhulaimu ainabhetu!’ Numbe ngunakummalanjilanga, a Nnungu bhanakombola kugayuya magangaga nibha bhana bha a Bhulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Bhai nnaino, libhago libhishilwe mmatepo ga mikongo, kupinga kuushelanya nkongo. Kila nkongo ukaogoya iepo ya mmbone upinga shelwa nileshelwa pa moto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandu lukwaabhuyaga, “Bhai tutende bhuli?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>A Yowana gubhaajangwilenje. “Akwete nngubho ibhili anngabhile jwangali ngubhojo, akwete shalya atende nneyo peyo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Numbe bhakamula koli gubhaikengenenje kupinga kubhatishwa, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Tutende bhuli mmaajiganya?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Numbe a Yowana gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnalonganje koli japunda jimmalanjilwenje.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Numbe ashimanjola na bhalabhonji gubhaabhushiyenje, “Na uwe tutende ndi?” Gubhaajangulenje, “Nnatolanje indu ikamundu jojowe kwa mashili wala nnanshitakiyanje mundu kwa kunnambilila. Ntogolelanje na mishaala jenunji.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Bhandu bhatendaga lolelanga kwiya kwa bhaagombola, bhai gubhatandubhenje kwiibhuyanga mmitima jabhonji, pana a Yowana bha ni a Kilishitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Penepo a Yowana gubhaabhalanjilenje bhowe, “Nne ngunakumbhatishanga na mashi, ikabheje bhanakwiya bhakwete mashili kumbunda nne, numbe nne nangatopela nkali kubha ntumishi jwabho. Bhenebho shibhambhatishanje kwa Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo na kwa moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Bhenebho bhashikamula nkubhato mmakono gabho, bhalipinga kubhata yalya yabho na peta, ngano bhakabhishe munngokwe na maashe gangali shindu nijoka pa moto gwangaimika piti piti.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Bhai kwa genego na miungu jina jamigwinji, a Yowana bhakwaalungushiyangaga bhandunji Ngani ja Mmbone. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Ikabheje a Yowana bhashinkwaakalipila bhakulungwa a Elode, kwa ligongo lya kwaatola shilombani a Elodia, bhaliji akongobhabho akulubhabho na indu ina yangali ya mmbone ibhaitendekanyaga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Kungai a Elode akuno bhalipunda kwitendekanya yangali ya mmbone, nigubhaatabhile a Yowana.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabhatishwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matei 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Bhandu bhowe bhakamalanjeje kubhatishwa, a Yeshu na bhalabho bhakubhatishwaga. Na pubhaaliji bhalijuga kwa a Nnungu, kunnungu kukuugukaga, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Mbumu Jwa Ukonjelo akwaatulushilaga alibhoneka mbuti ngunda. Lilobhe likupilikanikaga kukopoka kunnungu. “Ugwe mwanangu junguupinga, unonyela.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shipinga sha a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:17">Matei 1:17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>A Yeshu pubhatandwibhe liengo lyabho kulugwinjili bhali na yaka malinga makumi gatatu, na bhandunji pubhaganishiyangaga kuti mwana jwa a Yoshepu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">a Yoshepu pubhaliji bhanabho a Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>a Eli pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Matiati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">a Metiati pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Lawi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">a Lawi pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Meliki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">a Meliki pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yanai,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">a Yanai pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yoshepu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>a Yoshepu pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Matatiashi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">a Matatia pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Amoshi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">a Amoshi pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Naumu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">a Naumu pubhaliji bhanabhabho a Eshili,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">bhanabhabho a Nagai,<verse eid="LUK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>a Nagai bhaliji bhanabhabho a Matatiashi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">a Maati bhaliji bhanabhabho a Matatiashi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">a Matatia pubhaliji bhanabhabho a Shemeni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">a Shemeni bhanabhabho a Yosheki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">a Yosheki bhanabhabho a Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>a Yuda bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yowanani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">a Yowanani bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Lesha,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">a Lesha bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shelubhabeli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">a Shelubhabheli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Sheatieli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">a Sheiatieli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Neli,<verse eid="LUK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>a Neli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Meliki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">a Meliki bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Adi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">a Adi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Koshamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">a Koshamu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Elimadamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">a Elimadamu pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Eli,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>a Eli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yoshua,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">a Yoshua bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Eliesheli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">a Eliesheli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yolimu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">a Yolimu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Matiati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">a Matiati bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>a Lawi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shimoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">a Shimoni bhaaliji bhanabhabho</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">a Yuda bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yoshepu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">bhanabhabho a Yonamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">a Yonamu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Liakimu,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>a Liakimu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Melea,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">a Melea bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Mena,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">a Mena bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Matata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">a Matata bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Nashani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">a Nashani bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>a Daudi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yeshe,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">a Yeshe bhanabhabho a Obhedi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">a Obhedi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Boashi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">a Bhoashi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shalomoni</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">a Shelemani bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Nashoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>a Nashoni bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Aminadabhu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">a Aminadabhu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Alamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">a Alamu, bhaaliji bhanabhabho, a Eshiloni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">a Eshiloni bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Peleshi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">a Paleshi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>a Yuda bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yakobho,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">a Yakobho bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Ishaka,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">a Ishaka bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Bhulaimu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">a Bhulaimu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Tela,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">a Tela bhanabhabho a Naoli,<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shelungi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">a Shelungi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Leu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">a Leu bhanabhabho a Pelegi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">a Pelegi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Ebheli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">a Ebheli bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shala,<verse eid="LUK 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>a Shala bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Kenani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">a Kenani bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Alupakishadi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">a Lupakishadi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Shemu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">a Shemu bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Nuu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">a Nuu pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Lameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>a Lameki pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Metushela</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">a Metushela pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Eneko,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">a Eneko pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Yaledi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">a Yaledi pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Maalaleli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">a Maalaleli pubhaaliji bhanabhabho a Kenani,<verse eid="LUK 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>a Kenani bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Enoshi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">a Enoshi bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Sheti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">a Sheti bhaaliji bhanabhabho a Adamu, a Adamu bhaaliji bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kulingwa kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-4">Matei 4:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>A Yeshu gubhabhujile kopoka ku lushi lwa Yolodani, bhali bhagumbelwe Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, gubhalongweywe naka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo mpaka kuanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Kweneko gubhalinjilwe naka Lishetani kwa mobha makumi nsheshe. Gene mobha gowego bhangalya shoshowe, kungai gubhaipilikene shibhanga.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Penepo Lishetani gwabhabhalanjile, “Ibhaga mmwe nni Mwana jwa a Nnungu, nnyuye liganga lino libhe nkate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>A Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Ishijandikwa. ‘Mundu akalamila nkatepe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Kungai Lishetani gwabhakweshiye kunani kaje, akwaalangulaga upalume gwa ilambo yowe gwanakamope. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Lishetani gwashite “Shinimpe ntagwale yene ilambo yowei, na indu yakwe yowe pabha njipegwa yowei, mbingaga kumpa mundu ngunakombola. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Yene yowei shiibhe yenu nndindibhalilaga.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>A Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Ishijandikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">‘Mwaatindibhalile Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">Na kwaakamulila maengo bhenebho jikape.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Lishetani gwabhalongweye kwenda ku Yelushalemu, gwabhakweshiye kunani nnala gwa Liekalu, gwabhalugulile, “Ibhaga mmwe nni Mwana jwa a Nnungu mwigwiye pai, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>pabha ishijandikwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Shibhaamulishanje ashimalaika bha kunnungu, kukumpa ulinda,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Kabhili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">‘Shibhannjigalanje mmakono gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">Nnakwiikubhala lukongono nniganga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Ishijandikwa, ‘Nnaalinje bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Lishetani akabhalinjeje kila muutendelo, gwabhaleshile kwa malanga gashoko.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatandubha Liengo ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matei 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhabhujile ku Galilaya bhalilongoywa kwa mashili ga Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, na ngani jabho gujishumile ku Galilaya na ilambo yowe ya tome. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Bhenebho bhatendaga jiganya bhandu mmashinagogi gabhonji, na bhowe gubhaalumbililenje.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakanwa ku Nashaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matei 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhapite ku Nashaleti, kubhalelelwe, na malinga shibhayobhelele, Lyubha lya Pumulila gubhajinjile Nshinagogi. Gubhajimi kupinga bhashome Majandiko ga Ukonjelo. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Gubhaposhele shitabhu sha a Ishaya ankulondola, gubhashiunukwile gubhapaimene pajandishwe.<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Mbumu jwa Bhakulungwa pali na nne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Pabha bhashing'agula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Naapeleshelanje bhalaga Ngani ja Mmbone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Bhashinduma naalungushiyanje bhatabhilwenje kuleshelelwa kwabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na ashinangalole bhalolanje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na kwaagombolanga bhabhonelwanga,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Na kulunguya shaka sha uguja gwa Bhakulungwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Gubhaunishile shitabhu shila gubhampele ntumishi nigubhatemi, bhandunji bhowe bhalinginji nshinagogi mula gubhaakolondolesheyenje meyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Nigubhatandwibhe kwa kwaabhalanjilanga, “Lelo gene Majandikoga gamalile nnipilikananga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Bhowe gubhalumbililenje na kanganigwa kwa malobhe ga mmbone gubhatayaga a Yeshu, gubhashitenje, “Bhuli jweneju nngabha mwanagwabho a Yoshepu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nimumanyi shimmalanjilanje lutango lwa kuti, ‘Mmitela ilamye gwamwene,’ nakabhili shimmalanjilanje, ‘Yowe itupilikene ishitendeka ku Kapalanaumu ntende na pa shilambo shenu pano.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Gubhapundile kubheleketa bhalinkuti, kweli ngunakummalanjilanga jwakwapi nkulondola akundwa pa shilambo shakwe.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Ikabheje mpilikananje, kweli ngunakummalanjilanga! Yaka ya a Eliya bhashinkupagwanga bhashitenga bhabhagwinji nshilambo sha Ishilaeli. Gene mobhago ula janganya yaka itatu na nushu, gushikoposhele shibhanga sha punda shilambo showe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Nkali nneyo a Eliya bhangatumwa kuka nshitenga jojowe, ikabhe kuka jwankongwe nshitenga jwa ku Sheleputa shilambo sha Shidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Na kabhili, bhapalinji bhamangundula bhabhagwinji yaka ya ankulondola a Elisha nshilambo sha Ishilaeli. Nkali nneyo jwakwapi jojowe alamiywe, ikabhe a Naamani bhandu bha ku Shilia.<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Bhowe bhalinginji nshinagogi mula gubhatumbelenje kwa kaje bhakapilikananjeje genego. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Gubhajimingene, gubhaakukulumyenje a Yeshu nshilambo shabhonji shashenjilwe pantundu shitumbi, gubhaapelekenje mpaka nnushingu nkupinga bhaanokolelanje nnikote. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhapitile pakati jabhonji pepo, nigubhaijabhulile.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu Akwete Lioka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:21-22">Matei 1:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaelele mpaka ku Kapalanaumu shilambo sha ku Galilaya, Lyubha lya Pumulila bhatendaga jiganya bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Gubhakanganigwenje kwa majiganyo gabho pabha bhatendaga bheleketa mbuti mundu akwete ukulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Na Nshinagogi mula ashinkupagwa mundu ashinkushikilwa na lioka jwa nyata gwajobhele alinkuti <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Ntuleshe, tukwete nndi na mmwe a Yeshu Bhanashaleti? Bhuli nshikwiya kutumaliya? Nne nimmanyi mmwe agani. Mmwe ni Mundu jwa ukonjelo jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>A Yeshu gubhankalipile lioka jula bhalinkuti “Pumula! Nsheshe munduju!” Bhai lioka jula akanngwiyeje mundu jula pai bhandu bhowe bhalilolesheyanga, ni gwanshoshile gwangali kumpoteka wala kashoko.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Bhandu bhowe gubhakanganigwenje, gubhabhalanjilenenje. “Genega majiganyo gashi, kwa ukulungwa na mashili bhanakwaabhalanjilanga ashimaoka bhangali bha mmbone bhanshoshekanje mundu, na inatendeka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Ngani ja a Yeshu jikushumaga mmbali yowe.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwalamyanga Bhandu Bhabhagwinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matei 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>A Yeshu gubhakopweshe Nshinagogi, gubhapite kunngwabho a Shimoni. Bhakongwe bhamo akwebhabho a Shimoni bhatendaga sheluka kwa kaje, gubhaajujilenje bhaalamye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>A Yeshu gubhajinjile nikwaakotimila bhalwele bhala, nikushikalipila shilwele shila, gushaashoshile. Shangupe bhakongwe bhala gubhajinwishe, gubhatandwibhe kwaatumishilanga.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Pulyatitimilaga lyubha, bhandu bhowe bhakwetenje bhalwelenji bha ilwele yoyowe ila gubhaapelekenje kwa a Yeshu, nabhalabho gubhaakwashiyenje na makono, gubhaalamienje bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji gugaashoshilenje maoka gangali ga mmbone akuno galijobhela, “Mmwe Bhanabhabho a Nnungu.” Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhagakalipile, bhangagaleka gabhelekete, pabha gaamanyi kuti bhenebho a Kilishitu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalunguya Mmashinagogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Malabhi gakwe lyamba a Yeshu gubhajawile gubhapite kujika. Lugwinjili lwa bhandu lwatendaga kwaloleya. Bhakaaimananjeje, gubhalinjilenje kwaibhilila bhanajabhule. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Ikabheje bhalabho gubhaajangulenje, “Ngunapinjikwa kulunguya Ngani ja Mmbone ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu nneila peila na muilambo ina, pabha njitumwa kwa ligongo lya genego.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Gubhapundile kulunguya mmashinagogi ga ku Galilaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanashema Bhaajiganywa bha Ndandubho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matei 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu bhashinkujima nnyenje litanda lya Geneshaleti na bhandu bhabhagwinji bhalibhaatimbililenje bhalinokolananga nkwabhandishila, kupinga pilikanishiya lilobhe lya a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Gubhajibhweni mitumbwi jibhili nnyenje litanda. Ashaayene bhatanda yamaki bhashinkutulukanga kualaya mau gabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>A Yeshu bhakajinjileje mumashua gumo gwaaliji gwa a Shimoni, gubhaalugulile a Shimoni bhaunokolesheye mmashi ga taliya kashoko na mumpelo litanda. Gubhatemi, gubhajigenye lugwinjili lwa bhandu bhali mmashua.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Bhakamaliyeje kujiganya, gubhaalugulile a Shimoni, “Mpeleshe ntumbwi pa shilindili, nkatejelanje mau genunji ntandanje yamaki.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>A Shimoni gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, tushisheya shilo showeshi nkutanda yamaki ikabheje shakwa shitupatile, ikabheje pabha nkubhalanga mmwe, shindejele mau gano.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Bhakatejelanjeje mau gabhonji, gubhapatilenje yamaki yaigwinji, nkali mau gugatandwibhe kukutuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Gubhaashemilenje ashaajabhonji bhalinginji mmitumbwi jina gubhaikengenenje kukwajangutanga, gubhagumbeyenje yamaki mitumbwi jinaabhili, gujitandwibhe kutitimila mmashi.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>A Shimoni Petili bhakabhoneje nneila, gubhaatindibhalile a Yeshu, gubhashite, “Mwiijabhulile apano Mmakulungwa, pabha nne nankulebha!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>A Shimoni na ashaajabhonji gubhakanganigwenje gaapata yamaki yaigwinji nneila. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Nneila peila a Yakobho na a Yowana bhana bha a Shebhedayo bhalinginji bhatanda yamaki ajabhonji a Shimoni gubhakanganigwenje. A Yeshu gubhaalugulile a Shimoni, “Nnajogope, kutandubhila nnaino nkatanda yamaki, ikabheje liengo lyenu shilibhe lya tanda bhandu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bhai bhakajikwakwatanjeje mitumbwi jila mpaka palanga ja litanda, gubhaleshilenje yowe gubhaakagulenje a Yeshu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaalamya Bhamangundula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matei 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>A Yeshu pubhaliji, kushilambo shimo, jwannume jumo jwa mangundula shiilu showe, gwabhabhweni. Bhai akwiigwiyaga namanguku alikwaajuga a Yeshu alinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, mpingaga, shinndakaye.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>A Yeshu gubhagolweye nkono gubhankwashiye akuno bhalibheleketa, “Ngunipinga, utakate!” Shangupe mangundula gala gakunshokaga. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>A Yeshu gubhannalajile mundu jula bhalinkuti, “Unammalanjile mundu jojowe, ikabhe ukailanguye ku bhakulungwa bhaabhishila, ukashoye mbepei ya takata kwako, malinga shijilugula shalia ja a Musha, ibhe ukong'ondelo kunngwabhonji kuti utekete.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Ikabheje ngani ja a Yeshu jikupundaga kushuma kowe. Makundi ga bhandu gugalopweshe kukwapilikanishiya na kulamywa ilwele yabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu, papagwinji bhatendaga kwenda ku jika kukwaajuga a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Mundu jwa Poloka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matei 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu bhatendagajiganya. Mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha shalia kukoposhela mmbali yowe ya shilambo sha ku Galilaya na ku Yudea na ku Yelushalemu pubhalinginji popo bhatemingene. Na mashili ga Bhakulungwa pugaaliji na a Yeshu nkupinga bhaalamyanje bhalwelenji. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Kashokope gubhaikengene bhandunji bhannjigelenje mmashila mundu jwa poloka, gubhalinjilenje kunnjinjiya nkati bhampelekanje kwa a Yeshu. <figure style="fig" alt="Lowering Man" file="NT-17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:18">Bhandu Bhalikumpeleyanga Nnwele Kupooloka pa Shitubhili</figure>5:18 <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Ikabheje kwa ligongo lya gwinji gwa bhandu, bhangakombolanga kujinjiya nkati. Bhai gubhakwelilenje kushipagala, gubhapenwilenje nigubhantulwiyenje mundu jwa poloka jula na mashila, mpaka pakati pakati ja bhandunji mmujo ja a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>A Yeshu bhakajibhoneje ngulupai jabhonji, gubhannugulile mundu jula, “Ambwiga nneshelelwe yambi yenu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Mapalishayo na bhaajandika bha shalia gubhatandwibhenje kwiibhuyanga, “Bhenebha ni agani bhakwaakupulu a Nnungubha? Jwakwapi mundu akombola kuleshelela yambi ikabhe a Nnungu jikape!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kwa nndi nnakwiibhuyanga genega mmitima jenunji? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Shei shipepeshe, kubheleketa, ‘Uleshelelwe yambi,’ eu ‘Jima ujende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Bhai pungupinga mmumanyanje kuti Mwana juka Mundu ashipegwa mashili ga leshelela bhandu yambi yabhonji pa shilambolyo.” Penepo gubhammalanjile mundu jwa poloka jula, “Jima tola likai lyako guijendele kumui.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Shangupe, mundu jwa poloka jula gwajimi pa meyo gabhonji, gwatolile likai lyakwe, gwapite kumui akuno alikwaakuya a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Bhowe gubhakanganigwenje na shijogopele, gubhaakushiyenje a Nnungu, bhalinkutinji, “Lelo tuibhweni ilapo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaashema a Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matei 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Gakapiteje genego, a Yeshu gubhakopweshe palanga gubhaaweni bhakamula koli bhamo bhashemwaga a Lawi bhatemi nnyumba ja kamulila koli. A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nngagule!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>A Lawi gubhajimi gubhaleshile yowe gubhaakagwile.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>A Lawi gubhaashemele a Yeshu shalya kunngwabho. Na likundi likulungwa lya bhakamula koli na bhandunji bhana pubhalinginji popo bhatemingenenje nkulya. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha shalia bhalinginji nkumbi gumo, bhakwaainginishilangaga bhaajiganywa bha a Yeshu bhalinkutinji. “Kwanndi nnalyanganga na papila na bhakamula koli na bhandunji bhakwetenje yambi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhabhakotonji bhakakunnoleyanga mmitela, ikabheje bhakunnoleyanga mmitela bhalwelenji. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Nangajiya kukwaloleyanga bhanguja, ikabhe bhakwetenje yambi nkupinga bhaipetanje.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Ngani ja Tabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matei 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Bhandunji bhala gubhaalugulilenje a Yeshu, “Bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana Bhabhatisha bhanatabhanga mobhaga na juga, nkali bhaajiganywa bha Mapalishayo pubhatendanga nneyo peyo. Ikabheje bhaajiganywa bhenu mmwe bhanalyanganga na ng'wa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, ashaambwigamundu bhaka nkulomba, bhalipinjikwanga kutabha akuno bhatemingene pamo na nnyene nkulomba? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Shigaishe mobha, nkulomba shibhanshoyanje pa bhandupo, penepo shibhatabhanje.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje aluno lutango luno nkupinga kwaajiganyanga. “Jwakwa mundu apapula shibhamba ngubho ja ambi nitotela munngubho ja bhukala, ibhaga atendaga nneyo shajiangabhanye ja ambijo, na shibhambasho shikatolana na nngubho ja bhukalajo. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Wala jwakwa mundu ataga divai ja ambi mmipatila ja bhukala, pabha divai ja ambijo shijipwengule mipatila ja bhukalajo, mipatila shijipwengushe na divai shijijitishe. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Divai ja ambi pataga mmipatila ja ambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Jwakwa mundu jikunnonyela kung'wa divai ja ambi ang'waga ja bhukala, pabha bhakutinji, ‘Ja bhukala ni ja mmbone kaje.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja Lyubha lya Pumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matei 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Lyubha limo lya Pumulila a Yeshu bhatendagapita mmigunda ja ngano, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhatandwibhenje kutema maashe ga ngano, nipulula nitikita na makono kutauna. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Ikabheje Ashimapalishayo bhana gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pakuti mmanganya nnalekanga shalia ja Lyubha lya Pumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangulenje, “Bhuli mmangashomanga shibhatendile a Daudi na ashaajabhonji pubhakwetenje shibhanga? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Bhenebho bhashinkujinjila nnyumba ja a Nnungu, gubhatolile mikate ja ukonjelo jila, gubhalile nikwaapanganga na ajabhonji. Ikapinjikwaga mundu kulya jene mikatejo ikabhe bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila jikape.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mwana juka Mundu ni Nkulungwa jwa Lyubha lya Pumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwa Poloka Nkono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matei 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Lyubha lina lya Pumulila, a Yeshu gubhajinjile nshinagogi gubhajigenye. Nkati mula ashinkupagwa mundu jumo nkono gwakwe gwa nnilo gwashinkupoloka. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Bhaajiganya bha shalia na Mapalishayo bhatendaga loleyanga shiumilo sha kwaashitakiya a Yeshu, kwa nneyo gwaatemingene nkulolela ibhaga shibhannamye mundu Lyubha lya Pumulila. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhammalanjile jwa poloka nkono jula, “Jinuka, ujime mmujo ja bhandu bhowe.” Mundu jula gwapite jima mmujo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Ngunakummuyanga, shalia jibhalanga bhuli ga Lyubha lya Pumulila, jinakutuleka tutende ya mmbone eu tutende yangali ya mmbone, kutapula gumi guka mundu eu kubhulaga mundu?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Gubhaalolinje bhandu bhowe bhatemingene pepala, gubhammalanjile mundu jula, “Goloya nkono gwako.” Nigwagolweye, na nkono gwakwe guulamile.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Ikabheje gubhatumbelenje kwa kaje, gubhakungulushilenje shibhaatendanje nndi a Yeshu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaagula Bhaajiganywa Likumi Limo na Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matei 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu gubhapite kushitumbi, nisheya nkwaajuga a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Pa lyamba lyakwe gubhaashemilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhaagwile bhandu likumi limo na bhabhili gubhaashemilenje, mitume. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>A Shimoni bhapegwilwe lina na a Yeshu lya Petili na a Ndeleya apwabho na a Yakobho na a Yowana na a Pilipi na a Bhatolomeyo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>A Matei na a Tomashi na a Yakobho bha a Alupayo na a Shimoni bhashemwaga “A Shelote,” Yani nshilambo apwatanila shilambo shakwe, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>na a Yuda bhana bhabho a Yakobho na a Yuda Ishikaliote bhaatendebhwishe a Yeshu kungai.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaajiganya na Lamya Bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matei 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Bhakaeleleje kopoka kushitumbi na ajabhonji, a Yeshu gubhajimi pashibhata. Penepo lyashinkupagwa likundi likulungwa lya bhaajiganywa bhabho na lugwinjili lwa bhandu kukopoka mmbali yowe ja ku Yudea na ku Yelushalemu na mbwani ja ku Tilo na ku Shidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>gubhaikengenenje kukwaapilikanishiya a Yeshu na kuulamiywa ilwele yabhonji. Bhatendaga kwaalamyanga bhowe na bhashikilwangaga na maoka bhatendaga lamywanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Bhandu bhowe bhatendaga lajililanga kwaakwaya, pabha gatendaga kwaakopoka mashili ga lamya bhandu bhowe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mboka na Ole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matei 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>A Yeshu gubhaatendebhushilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhashite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mbaya mmanganya nninginji mmalaganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">pabha Upalume gwa a Nnungu gwenunji.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mbaya mmanganya nkwetenje shibhanga nnaino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Pabha kungai shinnjukutanje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mbaya mmanganya nkugutanga nnaino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Pabha kungai shinng'ekanje.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Mbaya mmanganya bhandunji bhanshimangaga, nikummambalanga na kuntukananga na kumputuyanga kwa ligongo lika Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Genego galikoposhela mmanganya nng'angalanje, pabha, upo yenunji kunnungu shiibhe yaigwinji. Pabha bhanangulungwa bhabhonji bhashinkwatendelanga nneyo peyo ashinkulondola bha Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Ikabheje ole mmanganya nninginji matajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">Pabha tayali mposhilenje.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Ole mmanganya nnjukutnje nnaino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Pabha kungai shintotokanje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Ole mmanganya nkuekanga nnaino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Pabha kungai mpinga kwiigutanjilanga.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Ole mmanganya bhandu bhannumbililangaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">Pabha bhanangulungwa bhabhonji bhashinkwatendelanga nneyo peyo ashinkulondola bha unami.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaapinganje Ashaabhamagongo Ajenunji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matei 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga nkumbilikananga mmwe, mwaapinganje bhamagongo ajenunji, mwaatendelanje ya mmbone bhankunshimanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Mwaajujilanje mboka bhakunnoshanga, na mwaajujilanje kwa Nnungu bhene bhakuntendelanga yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Mundu ankomaga lipapa palitukwa limo muntendebhushiye na lya bhili. Mundu ampokonyolaga likoti lyenu nnanng'ibhililile kutola na lishati. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Jojowe akunnjuga shindu mumpe, na mundu ampokonyolaga indu yenu nnannonje. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Mwaatendelanje bhandu malinga shinkupinganga mmanganya bhantendelanje.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Ibhaga mwaapingangaga bhakumpingangape, igala shimpegwanje upo yashi? Pabha nkali bhakwetenje yambi bhalipingana. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Na ibhaga mwaatendelangaga ya mmbone bhakuntendelanga ya mmbonepe shimpegwanje upo yashi? Nkali bhakwetenje yambi bhalitendanga nneyo peyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Na ibhaga nkwaapolekanga bhandu bhunkukulupalilanga shibhannipanje, shimpegwanje upo yashi? Nkali bhakwetenje yambi bhanakwaapolekanga bhakwetenje yambi ajabhonji nkupinga bhaabhujishiyanje yowe. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Ikabhe mmanganya mwaapinganje ashaamagongo ajenunji, na mwaatendelanje ya mmbone, mwaapolekanje nnalolelanje kubhujishiwa, na upo yenunji shiibhe yaikulungwa, na shimmanganje bhana bha Bhakulungwa a Nnungu. Pabha bhenebho ni bhanguja kwa bhangali bha mmbone na bhakapinganga kutenda eja. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Nkolanje shiya malinga Ainabhenunji shibhali na shiya.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnaaukumulanje Bhananji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matei 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Nnaaukumulanje bhananji, na mmanganya nkaukumulwanga, nnaagambanje bhananji na mmanganya nkagambwanga, mwaaleshelelanje ashaajenunji, na mmanganya shinneshelelwanje. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Mwaapanganje bhananji ibhapinganga, na mmanganya shimpegwanje. Elo, shintabhanje mmapepe genunji shipimilo shigumbele nishinyilwa mpaka pakatika. Pabha shipimilo shosho pesho shinkwaapimilanga bhananji shimpinga pimilwanga na a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>A Yeshu gubhaatanjilenje aluno lutango luno. Bhuli, nangalole kukombola kunnongoya mpanda nangalole mwine? Bhowe bhakatumbushilanga nniimbo? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Nkujiganywa akakwaapunda bhaajiganya bhakwe, ikabheje nkujiganywa amaliyaga kwiijiganya shalandane na bhaajiganya bhakwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Kwa nndi unakushibhona shikoko shili nniyo lika nnjako, ikabheje ukakushibhona shipande shili nniyo lyako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Eu shiukombole bhuli kunnugulila nnjako, Mpwanga linda nikushoye shikoko nniyo lyako, na akuno ukakushibhona shipande shili nniyo lyako? Ugwe nngulumba! Utandubhe kushoya shipande shili nniyo lyako, penepo shulole ukoto, nikombola kushoya shikoko nniyo lika mpwako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo Umanyika kwa Iepo Yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matei 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Nkongo gwa mmbone nngaogoya iepo yangali ya mmbone, na wala nkongo gwangali gwa mmbone nngaogoya iepo ya mmbone. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Nkongo pubhakuumanyanga kwa iepo yakwe. Pabha bhandu bhakaakabhanga tini munkongo gwa mibha, na wala bhakaakabhanga shabhibhu nnitepo lya mbigili. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mundu jwa mmbone shatende ya mmbone ikopoka nshibhiko sha mmbone ili muntima gwakwe. Na mundu jwangali jwa mmbone shatende yangali ya mmbone ikopoka nshibhiko shangali shammbone ili muntima gwakwe. Pabha yaabheleketa mundu inngumbele muntima gwakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhaashenga Nyumba Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matei 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Kwa nndi nnanjemanga ‘Bhakulungwa, Bhakulungwa,’ akuno nkatendanga ingummalanjilanga? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Shininnugulilanje shilanda sha mundu jojowe anyiila nne, nipilikanishiya malobhe gangu nikugakagulila. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Jwenejo analandana naka mundu akwete lunda, ashenjile pa ndandali niola nshingi ukoto mpaka nnindandawe na nyumba nishimilika. Nushi guigumbele mashi nipobhola, ndanje nikwenda koma nyumba jila, ikabheje jangatenganyika, pabha jashinkushengwa pa ndandali. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Ikabheje jojowe apilikana malobhe gangu anatende shindu shoshowe, jwenejo analandana na mundu ashenjile nyumba pa lianji gwangali kuolela ukoto, ndanje jakopoka nnushi jikaisheje, gujikomile nyumba jila, gujibhomweshe jowe nigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Ntumishi jwa Bhakulungwa bha Manjola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matei 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Bhakabheleketeje gubhapinjile bhandu bhapilikananje gala, a Yeshu gubhapite kushilambo sha ku Kapalanaumu. <figure style="fig" alt="Centurion" file="NT-08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:1">Nkulungwa jwa Manjola</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Kweneko bhashinkupagwa bhakulungwa bhamo bha manjola ga Bhaloma, bhenebho bhashinkukola ntumwa jwabho jubhampinjile kaje. Jwene ntumwajo atendaga lwala tome kuwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala bhakapilikaneje nnganya ja a Yeshu, gubhaatumilenje bhanangulungwa bha Bhayaudi bhajendangane bhakaajuganje a Yeshu bhakannamye ntumwa jwabho. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bhakaikanganeje kwa a Yeshu gubhaashondelesheyenje kaje, bhalinkutinji, “Bhenebha inapwaa kwaatendela nneyo, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>pabha bhanakwapinganga bhandu bhetu, na bhashikutushenjela shinagogi jila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhalongene nabhonji, bhandunji bhala. Bhali tome na ika ku likaja lya bhakulungwa bha manjola ga Bhaloma bhala, bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala gubhaatumilenje asha ambwiga ajabhonji kubhaalugulilanje a Yeshu kuti, “Mmakulungwa nnapunde kwiiabhuya, pabha nne nangali malango ga kumposhela mmwe nnyumba jangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Na shiumilo niibhone nangali shanga sha kwiya kunngwenu mmwe. Ikabheje mmelekete lilobhepe na ntumwa jwangu shaalame. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Pabha nkali nne puni pai ja ukulungwa, pai jangu bhapalinji ashimanjola. Na nimmalanjiga linjola jumo, ‘Jenda’ alikwenda, nimmalanjilaga juna, ‘Jiya’ anakwiya, na nimmalanjilaga ntumwa jwangu, ‘Tenda ashi,’ najwalakwe alitenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje genego bhashinkuimonga kaje, gubhatendebhwishe nikululola lugwinjili lwa bhandu bhaakagulangaga bhala, gubhashite, “Nganabhe kummona mundu akwete ngulupai jikulungwa nnei nkali kubhandu bha Ishilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Bhandunji bhala bhakaikanganeje kumui, gubhanng'imenenje ntumwa jula alamile.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnyuya Mwana jwa Bhakongwe bha Shitenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Lyubha lyolyo a Yeshu gubhapite kushilambo shimo shashemwaga ku Naini, bhali bhalongene na bhaajiganywa bhabho na likundi likulungwa lya bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Bhai, bhali tome na nnango gwa lugwani gwa jinjilila nshilambo mula, gubhakoposhelenje bhandunji bhajigelenje maiti gaka nngwendo jumo mwana jwa jikape jwa bhakongwe bha shitenga. Bhandunji bhabhagwinji bha shene shilambo shila pubhalinginji pamo na bhakongwe bha shitenga bhala. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Bhakulungwa a Yeshu bhakaabhoneje bhakongwe bhala gubhaabhonele shiya, gubhaalugulile, “Nnagute.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Kungai gubhapite kushikwaya shinanda shibhajigalilenje maiti shila, na bhajigelenje bhala gubhajimingene. Nigubhashite, “Nngwendo! Ngunakuubhalanjila, jinuka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Nngwendo awile jula, gwajinwishe gwatemi, gwatandwibhe kubheleketa. A Yeshu gubhankamwiye kwa akwabhe.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Bhandu bhowe gubhajogopenje, gubhaainiyenje a Nnungu bhalinkutinji, “Ankulondola bhakulungwa bha a Nnungu bhakoposhele munkumbi gwetu. A Nnungu bhashikwiya kukwaajangutilanga bhandu bhabho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Jene nganijo jikushumaga ku Yudea kowe na ilambo ya tome.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaajiganywa Kopoka kwa a Yowana Bhaabhatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matei 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana gubhaalugulilenje a Yowana yowe yatendekaga ila. Nabhalabho a Yowana gubhaashemilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhabhili, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>gubhaatumilenje ku Bhakulungwa a Yeshu bhakaabhuyanje. “Bhuli, mmwe Bhaatapula bhakwiya bhala eu twaalindilile bhana?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Bhaajiganywa bhala bhakaaimananjeje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, Tushitumwa na a Yowana Bhaabhatisha tummuye kuti, “Bhuli, mmwe Bhaatapula bhakwiya bhala eu twaalindilile bhana?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Popo pepo a Yeshu bhatendaga kwaalamyanga bhandu bhabhagwinji bhalagangaga na ilwele na bhashikilwanga maoka na kwaapanganga kulola ashinangalole bhabhagwinji. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje. “Nnjendangane nkaabhalanjilanje a Yowana yowe impilikenenje na kwiilolela mmashayenenji, ashinangalole bhanalolanga, ashinangwabha bhanakwendangana, bhamangundula bhanalama, ashinangapilikane bhanapilikana, bhawilenje bhanayuywanga, na bhaalaga bhanalungushiywanga Ngani ja Mmbone. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Mbaya jwene mundu ikakunshima kwa ligongo lyangu nne.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana bhakajabhulanganeje penepo, a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kwaalugulilanga bhandu bhagumbelenje bhala nnganya ja a Yowana. “Pumwapitengenenje mukonde kukushibhona nndi? Mwaganishiyanga kukulibhona litete litikinywa na mbungo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ikabhe nneyo, kumwapitengenenje kulola nndi? Kumwapitengenenje kukunnola mundu awalile nngubho ya bhei jikulungwa? Bhaawalanga nngubho ya bhei jikulungwa nitama ndamo ya poka mwaakutamangana mmajumba ga shipalume! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Bhai, mmalanjilanje, mwapitengenenje kulola nndi? Mwapitengenenje kunnola nkulondola? Elo, numbe ngunakummalanjilanga, kupunda nkulondola. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Bhenebha ni a Yowana bhalugwilwe Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Ngunakuntuma muntenga jwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">Anng'alashiye mpanda gwenu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>“Ngunakummalanjilanga, munkumbi gwa bhabhelekwenje jwakwapi ali jwankulungwa kwaapunda a Yowana Bhabhatisha. Ikabheje, jwene ali jwa nshoko kaje mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu, ni ali jwa nkulungwa kupunda bhenebho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Bhandu bhowe bhapilikenenje genego na nkali bhaakamula koli nigubhakundilenje kuti a Nnungu ni bha aki na bhanguja pabha bhashinkubhatishwanga na a Yowana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ikabheje mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha shalia, bhashinkukananga yatumbililwe na a Nnungu, kwa nneyo nigibhakanilenje kubhatishwa na a Yowana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>A Yeshu nigubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai bhandu bha lwene lubhelekolu naalandanyanje na nndi? Paakulandananga na shindu shashi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Bhashilandananga na bhana bhatemingene pa lubhala lwa ushiya indu, bhalishemananga ashayenenji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Twashinkunngombelenga imbeta, ikabheje mwangainanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Twashinkunnjimbilanga nyimbo ya ililo ikabheje mmanganya mwangagutanga!<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Pabha a Yowana bhashinkwiya, bhatendaga tabha na bhakang'waga divai, mmanganya gunshitenje. ‘Bhakwete lioka!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Najwalakwe Mwana juka Mundu ashiika, analya na kung'wa, mmanganya gunshitenje. ‘Munnolanje, jwa doka na kolelwaju, mmbwiga nnjabhonji bhakamula koli na bhakwetenje yambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Nkali nneyo, lunda lwa a Nnungu lumanyishe kuti lwa mmbone na lwa aki kubhandu bhowe bhakundilenje.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Kumui kwa a Shimoni Bhapalishayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Bhapalishayo bhamo bhashinkwaashemela shalya a Yeshu kunngwabho. Nigubhajinjile nnyumba ja a bhapalishayo bhala gubhatemi kulya shalya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Bhai, pene pa shilambo pala, bhashinkupagwa bhakongwe bhamo bhakwete yambi. Bhakapilikaneje kuti a Yeshu mubhali nnyumba ja a Palishayo bhala, gubhatolile shupa sha mauta ga nunjila shieleywe kwa liganga lya alabhashita. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Nigubhajimi tome na makongono ga a Yeshu bhaliguta, na minyoi jabho jilikwaandolishila a Yeshu mmakongono. Bhakongwe bhala gubhaponwele makongono ga a Yeshu kwa umbo yabho. Kungai gubhagalambile makongono gala na gubhaapekeye mauta ga nunjila gala. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Bhapalishayo bhaashemile a Yeshu bhala, bhakagabhoneje genego, gubhaganishiye muntima gwabho, “Abha bhandubha kweli bhaakaliji ankulondola bha a Nnungu, ikaaliji bhamumanyi shibhali abha bhakongwe bhakwaakwayabha kuti bhakwete yambi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile bhapalishayo bhala, “a Shimoni, shipali shindu shingupinga kummalanjila.” Nabhalabho a Shimoni bhakwaalugulilaga, “Elo, mmelekete Mmajiganya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Bhandu bhabhili bhashinkupolekanga ela kubhandu bhamo, bhamo libhalongwaga ligambo lya nshaala gwa shaka shimo na nushu, bhana ligambo lya nshaala gwa mwei gumo na nushu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Bhakalepelanjeje kulipa magambo gabhonji, bhandu bhala gubhaaleshelelenje bhanaabhili. Lelo penepo munkumbi gwa bhene bhabhilibho, bhei shibhapunde kwaapinga bhaaleshelela magambo bhala?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>A Shimoni gubhajangwile, “Penepo imanyishe kuti, bhaleshelelwe ligambo likulungwa shibhapunde kwaapinjiya.” A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Elo penepo nnjangwile ukoto.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Penepo gubhaatendebhushile bhakongwe bhala, nikwaalugulila a Shimoni, “Nnikwaabhona abha bhakongwebha? Nne punyinjile munngwenu muno mwangamba mashi ga nabha mmakongono gangu, ikabheje abha bhakongwebha bhashinyobhya makongono gangu na minyoi jabho nimbonola na umbo yabho. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Mmwe mwanganyambata, ikabheje abha bhakongwebha shijinjilile nne apano bhatendaga nyambata makongono gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Mmwe mwangambakaya mauta muntwe, ikabheje abha bhakongwebha bhashimbakaya mauta mmakongono gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Kwa nneyo ngunakummalanjila kupinjiya kwabho kwapunda kunalanguya kuleshelelwa kwa ilebho yabho yaigwinji. Aleshelelwe ilebho ishoko, kupinga kwakwe kushokope.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile bhakongwebhala, “Nneshelelwele yambi yenu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Penepo bhatemingenenabho pashalya bhala gwaabhuyenenje, “Bhenebha bhandu bhashi, bhaakombola nkali kuleshelela yambi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile bhakongwe bhala, “Ngulupai jenu jintapwile, nnjende kwa ulele.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Bhanabhakongwe Bhalonganangaga na a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Gakapiteje genego a Yeshu bhashinkupita mwilambo na ijiji bhalipita lunguya Ngani ja Mmbone ja Upalume gwa Nnungu. Bhaajiganywa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala gubhalongenenabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Na kabhili bhanabhakongwe bhana bhashoshiywenje maoka na bhalamywenje ilwele na a Yeshu bhatendagalongana nabhonji. Bhene bhanganyabho pubhalinginji, a Malia Magidalena, bhashoshiywe maoka shabha, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>a Yowana akongobhabho a Kusha bhatumishi bhakulu bha nnyumba ja a Elode na a Shushana na bhananji bhowepe, bhene bhanabhakongwebho bhatendaga kwajangutilanga a Yeshu kwa mali gabhonji ashaayene.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nkupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matei 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Likundi likulungwa lya bhandunji lyashinkwaajiila a Yeshu kukoposhela ilambo na ilambo. Nabhalabho gubhaatanjilenje aluno lutango luno.<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Nkupanda ashinkwenda miya mmbeju yakwe. Pamiyaga pala mmbeju ina ikugwilaga mumpanda, bhapita mpanda gwaalibhetenje na ijuni gwiilile. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ina gwiigwilile nnindandawe, ikameleje gwiiwile pabha pakakweteje mashi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Ina gwiigwilile mmibha. Mibha ila ikakuleje guitenjele. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Na ina guigwilile palitaka lya mmbone, guimelile niogoya yaigwinji.” Bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhautiye lilobhe bhalinkuti, “Akwete makutujo apilikane!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ligongo lya Jiganya kwa Ndango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matei 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje malombolelo ga lwene lutangolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Bhalabho gubhajangwile, “Mmanganya nkwetenje shikono sha kwiimanya indu ya nng'iyo ya mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu, ikabhe nngabha bhananjibho, kwa bhanganyabho pungwaabhalanjilanga kwa ndango. Nkupinga bhalolangaga bhanashibhonanje shindu na bhapilikanangaga bhanamumanyanje.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatalashiya Lutango lwa Nkupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matei 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Bhai gegano malombolelo ga lutangolu. Mmbeju lilobhe lya a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Nneyo peyo shikoposhele kwa mmbeju igwilile mumpanda shinalandana na bhandunji bhakulipilikananga lilobhe lila, kungai gwaishe ibhilishi gwalishoshiye mmitima jabhonji, bhanakulupalilanga nitapulwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Nneyo peyo shikoposhele kwa mmbeju igwilile pa lindandawe, shinalandana na bhandunji, bhakupilikananga lilobhe lila bhanakuliposhelanga nikwiinonyela. Ikabheje, namalinga mmbeju ila, bhene bhandunjibho pabha bhangalinji nnjiga, bhanakulupalilanga kashokope na bhalingwangaga bhakaakabhanga kuwa ntima. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Nneyo peyo shikoposhele kwa mmbeju igwilile mmibha shinalandana na bhandunji bhakulipilikananga lilobhe lila, ikabheje bhajabhulanganaga kashokope, bhanaakamulwanga na lipamba, na indu na mboka ya ndamo, bhalabhonji bhakaaogoyanga iepo nikomala. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Nneyo peyo shikoposhele kwa mmbeju igwilile pa litaka lya mmbone, shinalandana na bhandunji bhakulipilikananga lilobhe lila kwa ntima gwa mmbone nikunda. Bhanganyabho bhanakwiikakatimilanga mpaka niogoya iepo.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Kandili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maliko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>Bhandu bhakakoleyanga kandili nikujiunishila eu kujibhika nng'ungu. Ikabheje pabhikwa panani, nkupinga bhandu bhajinjilanga bhashibhonanje shilangaya.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Pabha shoshowe shishiiywe, shipinga undukulwa na yowe ili ya nng'iyo ipinga manyika kulugwinjili.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Kwa nneyo mwiiteiganje na inkupilikanangayo, pabha akwete shindu shajenjesheywe, ikabheje jwangali shindu, nkali shishoko shaaganishiya akwete shila, apinga pokonyolwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anyinabhabho na Ashaapwabho a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matei 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Penepo anyinabhabho na ashaapwabho a Yeshu gubhaikengenenje kukwaalola, ikabheje bhangakombolanga kwaabhandishila kwa ligongo lya lugwinjili lwa bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>A Yeshu gubhabhalanjilwe kuti, anyinabhenu na ashaapwenu pubhalinginji palanga, bhanapinganga kummona.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandu bhowe, “Bhakulipilikanishiyanga na kulikamulila lilobhe lya a Nnungu bhanganyabho ni a mama na ashapwanga nne.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatondobhya Mbungo na Mabhimbili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matei 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu na Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhashinkukwelanga mmashua, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Tujomboshe litanda tuishe kung'ambu.” Bhai, mwanja niguutandwibhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Bhalinginji mmashua, a Yeshu gubhagonile lugono. Mbungo na mabhimbili gamakulumakulu gugatabhile, mashi nigugatandwibhe kupakushila mmashua, nigubhajogopenje kaje, nibha atali.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Bhaajiganywa bhala gubhapite kukwaajumuyanga a Yeshu, bhalinkutinji, “Mmakulungwa, Mmakulungwa, tunawa!” A Yeshu nigubhajumwishe, nigubhajikalipile mbungo na mabhimbili gala, niguitondwebhe, kwa jii. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Penepo nigubhaabhushiyenje, “Jili kwei ngulupai jenunji?” Gubhakanganigwenje na jogopa, akuno bhalibhuyananga, “Igala bhenebha bhandu bhashi, nkali mbungo na mabhimbili bhanakwiamulisha nikwaapilikana?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Mundu Aakwete Maoka Kugelashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matei 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Gubhaikengenenje kushilambo sha Bhagelashi, shilolana na ku Galilaya kung'ambu ja litanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>A Yeshu pubhaulukaga kumbwani, mundu jumo nshilambo jwa shene shilambo shila, akwete maoka, gwabhaishile. Kwa mobha gamagwinji jwene mundujo akawalaga nngubho wala akatamaga nnyumba, ikabhe ndamo jakwe pujaaliji mmashembo ga shishila bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Akaabhoneje a Yeshu, gwajobhele gwaigwishiye pai mmujo jabho akuno alibheleketa kwa utiya, “Mmwe a Yeshu bhanabhabho a Nnungu bhakulu, mmwe nndi na nne? Shonde, ngunajuga nnamboteshe!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Ashinkubheleketa nneyo pabha a Yeshu bhammalanjile lioka jula kuti anshoshe mundu jula. Jwene lioka jwangali jwa mmbone jula akakabhaga kunkamula mundu jula, nkali bhandu bhanng'ugalilanje nnyumba nikuntabha mindondolo ja itale na pingu mmakono na mmakongono, akakabhaga kukutulanya yoweyo, na lioka jula atendaga kumminganjila kuanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhammushiye, “Lina lyako gani?” Gwajangwile, “Lina lyangu, ‘Manjola’ ” Pabha gashinkunjinjila maoka gamagwinji. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Ashimaoka bhala gubhaashondelesheyenje a Yeshu bhanaabhinganjilanje ku Jeanamu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Penepo lyashinkupagwa likundi lya ngulubhe lilipitalya nshitumbi. Bhai ashimaoka bhala gubhaashondelesheyenje a Yeshu bhaaleshelelanje bhakaajinjilanje ashingulubhe bhala. Na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhaaleshelelenje. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Kwa nneyo ashimaoka bhala bhakunshokanganaga mundu jula, gubhaajinjilenje ashingulubhe, gubhaelelenje nnikote shibhutuka, nititimila nnitanda.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Bhalinda bha ngulubhe bhakagabhonanjeje gowe gakoposhele gala, gubhabhutukenje pita shumya nshilambo mula na mmigunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Bhandunji gubhaikengenenje kulola gakoposhele. Gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, gubhammweninji mundu ashoshilwe na maoka jula, atemi pa makongono ga a Yeshu, awete nngubho, ali na lunda lwakwe lwa mmbone, gubhajogopenje. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Bhandu bhagawenenje pugatendekaga, gubhaatalashiyenje bhananji, shaashite lamywa mundu akwete maoka jula. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Bhashilambo bha Kugelashi gwaajogopenje kwa kaje. Kwa nneyo gubhaajujilenje a Yeshu bhashoshe. Bhai a Yeshu gubhakwelile ntumbwi gubhaijabhulile.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mundu ashoshiywe maoka jula, akwaashondelesheyag a Yeshu alonganenabho. Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhannajile bhalinkuti, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Ubhuje kumui ukatalashiye yowe ibhakutendele a Nnungu.” Bhai mundu jula gwajabhwile pita lunguya ibhantendele a Yeshu, mmbali yowe ya shilambo shila.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali Anayuywa na Bhakongwe Bhanalamywa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matei 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>A Yeshu bhakabhujeje, gubhaposhelwe na likundi likulungwa lya bhandu, pabha bhatendaga kwaalindililanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Penepo gubhaishe bhandu bhamo bhashemwaga a Yailo bhakulungwa bha shinagogi, gubhaatindibhalile a Yeshu, gubhaajujile bhajende kunngwabho, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>pabha nabhiti jwabho jwa yaka likumi limo na ibhili, numbe jwa jikape, paliji nnwele tome nawa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">A Yeshu bhali nkwenda, bhandunji bhatendaga nokolananga nkwaabhandishila. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Bhai nnikundi lya bhandu mula bhashinkupagwa bhakongwe bhamo bhalwalaga nsholosholo yaka likumi limo na ibhili, bhashinkumaliya indu yabho yowe ku bhamitela, ikabheje jwakwapi akombwele kwaalamya.<verse eid="LUK 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhaakagwile a Yeshu pa nnyuma, gubhaakwashiye libhiniko lya nngubho jabho. Popo pepo gubhalamile shilwele shila.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>A Yeshu gubhabhushiye, “Gani angwashiye?” Bhowe gwaajangulenje kuti jwakwapi ankwashiye. Na a Petili gubhashite, “Mmaajiganya, lugwinjili lwa bhandu lushikunngumbalila nikuntimbilila ndendende!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhashite, “Apali mundu angwashiye, pabha njikwiipilikana mashili galinjoka.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Bhakongwe bhala bhakabhoneje kuti ikakomboleka kwiiya, gubhailangwiye bhalitetemela kwa jogopa, gubhaatindibhalile a Yeshu. Penepo gubhatalashiye pa bhandu bhowe shiumilo sha kwaakwaya a Yeshu na shibhashite lamywa gwanakamope. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile. “Mwanangu ngulupai jako jikulamiye. Ujende kwa ulele.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>A Yeshu bhakanabhe maliya kubheleketa a Yailo gubhapeleshelwe ntenga kukopoka kungwabho, “Mwali jwenu awile, igala gabhuli kupunda kwaabhuya bhaajiganya?” <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje genego, gubhaabhalanjile a Yailo, “Mmwe nnajogope nkulupalilepe, shalame.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Bhakaisheje kumui bhangapinga kujinjila naka mundu juna ikabhe na a Petili na a Yowana na a Yakobho pamo na bhankwetenje mwana jula. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Bhandu bhowe pubhalinginji nkunngutila ililo. A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Mpumulanje kuguta, pabha mwana jwangawa ashigonape!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Bhalabhonji gubhaeshilenje, pabha bhamumanyinji kuti mwana awile. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhankamwile nkono, nikunshema, “Mwanangu jumuka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Gumi gwakwe ukummujilaga, shangupe gwajumwishe. A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhampanganje shalya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Bhankwetenje gubhakanganigwenje kwa kaje, ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaamulishenje bhanannugulilanje mundu jojowe gene gatendeshe gala.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwatumanga Likumi Limo na Bhabhili Bhala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matei 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>A Yeshu gubhaashemilenje pamo likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, gubhaapelenje mashili na ukulungwa kupunda maoka gowe na kulamya ilwele. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Gubhaatumilenje bhajendangananje kulunguya Upalume gwa a Nnungu na kulamya bhalwelenji. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmwanja gwenunji nnajamulanje shindu shoshowe, wala imbo, wala nkobha, wala shalya, wala mmbiya, wala likoti lya tindiganya. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Na nyumba jojowe jishimposhelwanje, ntamangane penepo mpaka lyubha lishinjabhulangane. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Bhandu bhakamposhelanje, nshokangane shene shilambosho na punkujabhulanga mwikung'undanje litutuli lya mmakongono genunji, ibhe shilangulo kuti, bhashikananga ashaayene ntenga gwa Upalume gwa a Nnungu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Bhai gubhajabhulengenenje pitalunguya Ngani ja Mmbone, shijiji na shijiji na lamya bhalwelenji kila mmbali.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenguka kwa a Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matei 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Numbe bhakulungwa a Elode bhakapilikaneje gowe gatendeshe, gubhatengwishe, pabha bhandu bhananji bhatendaga bheleketanga kuti, “A Yowana bhashiyuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Bhana kuti a Eliya bhashikoposhela, bhana kuti ankulondola bha bhukala bhashiyuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Ikabheje a Elode gubhashite, “Monaga a Yowana bho naainjile, lelo jwene jungupilikana ngani jakwejo gani?” Gubhakwete lilaka lya kummona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhaanaliya Bhandu 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-41">Maliko 6:30-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Mitume bhala bhakabhujanganeje, gubhaatalashiyenje Yeshu yowe ibhatendilenje. A Yeshu gubhaatolilelenje, nigubhapitenabhonji kujika mpaka shilambo sha ku Bhetishaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Ikabheje bhandunjibhala bhakamumanyanjeje kubhapite, gubhaakagulenje. A Yeshu gubhaaposhelenje, gubhajigenye ga ngani ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu, na kwaalamyanga bhandu bhapingangaga kulamywa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Lyubha lilititimila, likumi limo na bhabhili bhala gubhapite kwaalugulilanga, “Mwaalajilanje bhandunji bhajendangane mwilambo na mmigunda ja tome, bhakaloleyanje shalya na mwagona, pabha putuli pano pakonde.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Mmanganya mwaapanganje shalya.” Gubhajangulenje, “Twangali shalya, ikabhe mikate nng'ano na yamaki ibhilipe. Igala tukaume shalya sha bhandu bhowebha!” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Pabha pepala, pubhalinginji bhanabhalume kuishila elupu nng'ano. Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Mwaatamikanje makundi ga bhandu makumi nng'ano nng'ano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Bhaajiganywa gwaatendilenje malinga shibhabhalanjilwenje, gubhaatamikenje bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhatolile mikate nng'ano na yamaki ibhili ila, gwaalolile kunani kunnungu, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu ga mikate na yamaki ila, gubhagebhenye na gubhaapelenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhaapanganje bhandunji. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Gubhalilenje bhandu bhowe, mpaka kujukuta, gubhalokotenyenje ipande ya malepei, nigumbaya ikapu likumi limo na ibhili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakong'ondela Kuti a Yeshu ni a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13">Matei 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maliko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu bhatendaga juga Nnungu jikape, bhaajiganywa bhabho bhalinginji tome popo. Bhai a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Igala bhandunji bhakutinji nne gani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Nigubhaajangwilenje, “Bhananji bhakutinji, mmwe a Yowana Bhabhatisha, na bhananji, bhakutinji mmwe a Eliya, na bhananji bhakutinji, mmwe ankulondola bha bhukala bhashiyuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Na mmanganya nkutinji bhuli, nne gani?” A Petili gubhajangwile, “Mwe a Kilishitu bha a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalondola ga Shiwo na Yuka Kwabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matei 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Maliko 8:30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhaalimbiyenje na kwaalajiyanga bhanammalanjilanje mundu jojowe jene nganijo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>A Yeshu gubhashite. “Mwana juka Mundu shapate mboteko yaigwinji, na shakanwe na bhanangulungwa na bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha shalia, na bhulagwa, ikabheje lyubha lya tatu shayushe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Kungai gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandu bhowe, “Mundu jojowe apinga ngagula nne, anapinjikwa aikane nnyene, ajigale nshalabha gwakwe, angagule. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Pabha mundu apinga kuutapula nnyene gumi gwakwe, shaaguobhye, ikabheje apinga kuguobhya gumi gwakwe kwa ligongo lya ngu nne, shaagutapule. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Bhuli shiimpwae nndi mundu, kupata indu yowe ya pa shilambolyo kwa obhya gumi gwakwe, eu kwiititimiya nnyene? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Pabha mundu jojowe amonela oni nne ga majiganyo gangu, Mwana juka Mundu shammonele oni jwenejo, lyubha lya shajiye muukonjelo gwakwe, na gwa Atati na shilangaya sha ukonjelo gwa ashimalaika bha kunnungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga kweli, pano pepano bhapalinji bhananji bhakawanganga mpaka bhaubhonanje Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapindikuka Lubhombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matei 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maliko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Gakaishileje mobha nane, bhakabheleketeje genego a Yeshu gubhaatolilenje a Petili, a Yowana na a Yakobho, gubhalongenenabhonji kushitumbi kukwaajuga a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Pubhaaliji nkwaajuga a Nnungu, nigubhapindikwishe kumeyo, nngubho yabho niwejela akuno ilimelemeta kwa kaje. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Shangupe bhandunji bhabhili a Musha na a Eliya gubhabhonekenje bhalikunguluka nabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Bhashinkubhonekanga bhalinginji na Ukonjelo, gubhakungulukenje ga nnganya ja bhulagwa kwabho shijipinga malila ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>A Petili na ashaajabhonji bhashinkugonanga lugono lwa tapatapa, ikabheje bhakajumukanjeje, gubhashibhweninji shilangaya sha Ukonjelo Gwapuya gwa a Yeshu na bhandunji bhabhili bhali bhajimi nabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Bhai a Musha na a Eliya bhalijabhulangana kwaaleka a Yeshu, a Petili gubhaalugulile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, shiipwae uwe tubhe apano! Bhai tushenje mishati jitatu, gumo gwenu, gumo gwa a Musha na gumo gwa a Eliya.” Ikabheje a Petili bhakaimanyaga ibhabheleketaga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>A Petili bhali nkubheleketa genego, gulikoposhele liunde nikwaunishilanga, lyene liundelyo pulyaunishilangaga nigubhajogopenje kaje. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Lilobhe likupilikanikaga kukoposhela nniunde mula. “Jweneju ni Mwanangu juninng'agwile, mumpilikanishiyanje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Likapilikanisheje lyene lilobhelyo, a Yeshu gubhabhoneshe bhali jikape. Bhaajiganywa gwaatemingene ilili. Na gene mobha gala bhangannugulilanga mundu indu yoyowe ibhaibhwenenje ila.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Mwana Aakwete Lioka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matei 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Pamalabhi gakwe, bhalielelanga kukopoka kushitumbi na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhatatu bhala, gubhaimikene na likundi likulungwa lya bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Penepo mundu jumo nnikundi mula, gwakweshiye lilobhe alinkuti, “Mmaajiganya, shonde munjangutile mwanangu jwa jikaju! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Anashikilwa lioka, nikuntenda ajobhele na kunngwiya shialala, akuno shiulo shilikunkopoka nkang'wa. Alipunda kumpoteka kwa kaje na wala akakunneka shangu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Naajujilenje bhaajiganywa bhenu bhanshoyanje, ikabheje bhangakombolanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Mmanganya lubheleko lwangali ngulupai na lwa puganika! Shiniipililile kutama na mmanganya mpaka shakani?” Kungai gubhaabhalanjile bhandu bhala, “Munnjienajo mwana jwenujo apano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Mwana jula alikwiya kwa a Yeshu, lioka akunngwiyaga shialala. Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhankalipile lioka jula anshoshe, mwana jula gwalamiywe, gubhankamwiye kwa ainagwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Bhandu bhowe gubhakanganigwenje, kwa ukulungwa gwa mashili ga a Nnungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">A Yeshu Bhanalondola Kabhili ga Shiwo Shabho</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matei 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bhandunji bhala bhalinginji nkukanganigwa kwa yowe ibhaaitendile a ila, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Mpilikanishiyanje gegano. Mwana juka Mundu apinga kamuywa mmakono ga bhandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Ikabheje bhalabhonji bhangagamanyanga malombolelo ga shene shibheleketosho. Pabha shashinkuiywa kupinga bhanashimanyanje, na bhalabhonji gubhajogopenje kwaabhuya malombolelo ga shene shibheleketosho.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gani Nkulungwa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:23">Matei 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Gujikoposhele mitau munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa, kuti gani jwankulungwa kupunda bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>A Yeshu bhashinkwiimanya ng'aniyo yaliji mmitima jabhonji, bhai gubhantolile mwana jwanshoko, gubhannjimishe tome na bhayene, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>gubhaalugulilenje, “Mundu jojowe akumposhela jwene mwana jwa nshokoju kwa lina lyangu, anamboshela nne na jojowe amboshela nne anakwaposhela bhandumile bhala. Pabha ali jwanshoko munkumbi gwenunji, jwenejo jwankulungwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akakuntaukangajo Nnjenunji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>A Yowana gubhabhelekete, “Mmakulungwa, tushikwaabhona bhandu bhamo bhalishoya maoka kwa lina lyenu, gutulinjile kwaibhilila, pabha nngabha alongani ajetu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnang'ibhililanje pabha akakuntaukangajo nnjenunji.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhashamalia Bhanakwaakananga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Mobha ga tolwa a Yeshu kwenda kunani kunnungu gakabhandishileje, gubhatumbilile kwenda ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Bhai gubhaatumilenje mitume bhalongolelanje, na bhalabhonji gwaapitengene kushilambo shimo sha Bhashamalia nkupinga bhakaalashiyanje paishila. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ikabheje bhashilambo bha pepala gubhakanilenje kwaaposhela, pabha a Yeshu bhaliji mmwanja kwenda ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhabho, a Yowana na a Yakobho, bhakabhonanjeje nneila, nigubhashitenje, “Mmakulungwa, nnipinga tusheme moto kunnungu kugwatiniyanje?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaatendeushilenje nikwaakalipilanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>A Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhapitengenenje shilambo shina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaapinjikwanga Kubha Bhaakagula bha a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matei 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Bhalikwendangana mumpanda, mundu jumo gwabhabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Shininkagule kokowe kushinnjende.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Nansheto akwete lishembo, na ijuni ikwete maui, ikabheje Mwana juka Mundu jwangali nkali pa pumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Kungai gubhannugulile mundu juna, “Ngagula.” Ikabheje jwenejo gwashite, “Mmakulungwa, nneshe oti ngaashishe atati.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhammalanjile, “Gwalekanje bhawilenje bhashikane ashaayene, ugwe ujende ukalunguye Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Na mundu juna gwabhabhalanjile, “Mmakulungwa shininkagule, ikabheje nneshe oti ngalajile kumui.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Jojowe akamwile lijela nitandubha kulima, atendebhukaga kulola nnyuma, jwenejo akapwaa mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaatumanga Makumi Shabha na Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Gakapiteje genego Bhakulungwa gubhaagwilenje bhananji makumi shabha na bhabhili gubhaatumilenje bhabhili bhabhili, bhaalongolelanje kila shijiji na kila mmbali jibhatumbilile bhayene kwenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Maneng'eno gamagwinji, ikabheje bhaaneng'ena bhashokope. Kwa nneyo, mwaajuganje Bhakulungwa bha maneng'eneno bhatume bhaaneng'ena munngunda gwabho.” <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Nnaino nnjendangane, mmumanyanje kuti ngunakuntumanga, malinga bhana ngondolo pakati maogo. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Nnajigalaganje mpatila gwa ela, wala nkobha, wala ilatu, mumpanda nnammuyanje abhali mundu jojowe.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Nnjinjilanganaga nnyumba jojowe jila, ntandubhanje kujumushila nnei. Ulele ubhe na mmanganya ajino nyumba jino. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Monaga shapagwe mundu jwa ulele mwenemo, shatame nago, akapagwe shigummujilanje mwaashayene. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Ntamangane jene nyumbajo, nnilyanganga na papila ishibhampanganjeyo, pabha ntumishi anapinjikwa apegwe nshaala gwakwe. Nnaamanje kushoka aji nyumbaji kwenda ajila.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Ibhaga nng'ikanganaga pa shilambo shoshowe na bhamposhelangaga, nniyanganje ishimpegwanjeyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Mwaalamyanje bhalwelenji bha kweneko, na mwaalungushiyanje bhandunji kuti, Upalume gwa a Nnungu ummandishilenje. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ikabheje nnjinjilangaga shilambo shoshowe, bhakamposhelanje, nnjabhulanje, pushimpitangane mmipanda jabhonji mmeleketanje nnei. <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>Nkali ndutuli ja nshilambo shenunji jili mmakongono getu tunakunkung'undilanga. Ikabheje mmumanyanje kuti Upalume gwa a Nnungu ubhandishile. <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga, lyubha lya ukumu ja a Nnungu kwa shene shilambosho, shiibhe mbaya bhandunji bha shilambo sha Shodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ole Ilambo Yangaipeta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matei 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Ole mmwe a Kolashini! Ole mmwe a Bhetishaida! Pabha ilapo itendeshe kungwenunji, ikatendeshe ku Tilo na ku Shidoni, bhandunji bha yene ilambo ila, bhakaipetilenje bhukalape, kwa wala nngubho ya magunia na kwiitutulila liu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Nkali nneyo lyubha lya ukumu mmanganya shimpatanje mboteko kupunda bhandu bha ku Tilo na ku Shidoni <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Numbe mmwe a Kapalanaumu, bhuli nkupinga kwikweya kuishila kunnungu? Ninkupinga gwiywa kuishila kundamo ja bhawilenje.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhashite, “Akumpilikanishiyanga mmanganya, anambilikanishiya nne, na akumposhelenga anamboshela nne. Na jojowe akaamboshela nne, akakwaaposhela bhandumile bhala.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa Makumi Shabha na Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Kungai, makumi shabha na bhabhili bhala gubhabhujilengene bhalikwiinonyelanga, bhalinkutinji, “Mmakulungwa nkali maoka ganakutupilikana kwa lina lyenu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nammweni Lishetani aligwa mbuti kumeta, kopoka kunnungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Mpilikananje, njikumpanganga amuli ja libhata majoka na ibhalabhala, na mashili gowe gaka mmagongo, wala shakwa shoshowe shishimmenganje. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ikabheje, nnainonyelanje ligongo maoka kumpilikananga, ikabhe mwiinonyelanje pabha mena genunji gashijandikwa kunnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaangalila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matei 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Pala pepala, a Yeshu gubhangalile Mmbumu jwa Ukonjelo bhalinkuti, “Ngunakuntendala eja mmwe Atati, Mmakulungwa bha kunnungu na pa shilambolyo, pabha yene indui nshikwaiyanga bhakwetenje lunda na lumanyiyo, nikwaalangulanga bhana bhashoko. Elo Atati, pabha yenei ni ikunnonyela.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Kungai gubhashite, “Atati bhashingamuya indu yowe. Jwakwa akummanya Mwana ikabhe Atati, na wala akwaamanya Atati ikabhe Mwana na jojowe jwapinjile Mwana kunnangula yeneyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalolilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhaabhalanjilenje kujika. “Mbaya meyo gakwiibhona yene inkwibhonangai! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Nguti, ashinkulondola bhabhagwinji na bhapalume, bhalokolilenje kwiibhona yene inkubhonangai, ikabheje bhangaibhonanga, na kupilikana inkugapilikanangai ikabheje bhangaipilikananga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nshamalia Nnguja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Bhaajiganya bhamo bha shalia gubhajimi nikwaabhuya, nkupinga kwaalinga, “Mmaajiganya, ndende bhuli mbate gumi gwa pitipiti?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Ijandikwe nndi nshalia?” Nkushoma nndi mwenemo?<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Gubhajangwile, “Mwaapinje Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu, kwa ntima gwenu gowe, na kwa mbumu yenu yowe, na kwa lunda lwenu lowe, na kwa mashili genu gowe. Na kabhili mumpinje nntami nnjenu malinga shinkwiipinga mmayene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Elo, nnjangwile ukoto! Ntende nneyo shinname.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Ikabheje nabhalabho nkupinga kwilanguya kuti bhaimanyi ibhabhushiye, gubhaabhushiye a Yeshu, “Igala ntami nnjangujo ni gani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Mundu jumo kukopoka ku Yelushalemu atendaga elela kwenda ku Yeliko. Ali mumpanda, gwaimene na bhaapokonyola, gubhanng'ulilenje nngubho yakwe, na kunkoma nikunneka agonile pa mpanda pala, tome nawa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Bhabhishila bhamo gubhapitile mpanda gula, bhakammoneje gubhammembele. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Na nneyo peyo Bhalawi bhamo gubhapitile, bhakaisheje pepala, gubhammweni, na bhalabho gubhammembele. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Ikabheje Nshamalia jumo aliji mmwanja gwakwe kupitila mpanda gogo, akammoneje gwammonele shiya. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Gwanng'egejele, nikunng'uka ilonda kwa mauta na divai nigwaitabhiile, kungai gwankweshiye mmbunda jwakwe nikumpeleka ku nyumba jimo ja bhajeninji nikunnwaya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Malabhi gakwe gwatolile mmbiya, dinali ibhili gwabhapele bhayene nyumba bhala, alinkuti, ‘Munnwaye jwene munduju, na shoshowe shishimpundesho, pushimujepo shininnipe’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhabhushiye, “Penepo bhene bhatatu bhala jwei ailangwile kuti ntami nnjakwe mundu akamwilwe na bhaapokonyola bhala?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Bhaajiganya bha shalia bhala gubhaajangwile, “Ammonele shiya jula.” A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nnjende nkatende nneyo peyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaowelanga a Malata na a Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>A Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhalikwendangana ku Yelushalemu, gubhaikengenenje shijiji shimo, penepo bhakongwe bhamo bhashemwaga a Malata, gubhaaposhele kunngwabho. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>A Malata bhashinkukola apwabho bhashemwaga a Malia, bhenebho bhashinkutama pa makongono ga a Yeshu bhalipilikanishiya majiganyo gabho. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Ikabheje a Malata bhatendaga kamula indu yaigwinji. Bhai gubhaajendele a Yeshu, gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, igala nkalola kuti apwangabha bhashineshela maengo gowe? Bhai mwaabhalanjile bhanyangute.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Ikabheje Bhakulungwa gubhaajangwile, “A Malata, a Malata, nnakwiibhuka na kwiiabhuya nng'indu yaigwinji. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Ikabheje shiipinjikwa shindu shimope. A Malia bhashiagula shindu sha mmbone kaje, wala mundu ngaapokonyola.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaajiganya Kwaajuga a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matei 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu bhashinkutama pa jika bhalikwaajuga a Nnungu, bhakamaliyeje, nkujiganywa jwabho jumo gwabhalugulile, “Mmakulungwa ntujing'anye kwaajuga a Nnungu malinga a Yowana Bhabhatisha shibhajigenye bhaajiganywa bhabho.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Punkwaajuganga a Nnungu, mmeleketanje nnei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Atati nni kunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">lina lyenu likuywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Upalume gwenu uishe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Ntupe shalya shetu mobha gowe.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Ntuleshelele yambi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Pabha numbe uwe tunakwaaleshelelanga bhowe bhakutulebhanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Nnatubhishe mmalinjilo, ikabhe ntutapule na jwangali jwa mmbone jula.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje, Gani akwete mbwiga nnjakwe, nikunnjendela pakati shilo, nikummalanjila, shonde mbwiga nnjangu unyaime mikate jitatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>pabha mmbwiga nnjangu ashiika kukopoka mmwanja, na nne nangali sha kumpa. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Na jwalakwe ali nnyumba pemo akajangwile, unang'abhuye! Nne nnaino ng'ugele nnango. Nne na ashibhanangu tugonile, ngakombola jumuka kukuupa! <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nkali anajumushe nikumpa kwa ligongo lyabha mmbwiga mwine, ikabheje, kwa ligongo lya punda juga, shajumushe nikumpa shoshowe shaajuga.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Kwa nneyo, mmanganya nnjuganje, shimpegwanje, nnoleyanje, shimpatanje, nng'olishiyanje, shinng'ugulilwanje. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Pabha jojowe ajuga anapegwa, aloleya anapata, na aolishiya anaugulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Igala nng'inamundu jwashi mwanagwe anjugaga shamaki, shampe lijoka paala pa shamaki? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Eu ajugaga liji, bhampe shibhalabhala?<verse eid="LUK 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nkali mmanganya, nninginji mmangalinginji bha mmbone, nnakwaapanganga ashibhana bhenu indu ya mmbone. Bhuli, Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu bhakapunda kwaapanganga Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, bhene bhakwaajuganga bhala?<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Naka Bheelishebhuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matei 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Lyubha limo a Yeshu bhatendaga kunshoya lioka antendaga mundu jumo abhe bhubhu. Bhai lioka jula akanshosheje, mundu jula gwakombwele kubheleketa, lugwinjili lwa bhandu lukukanganigwaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Ikabheje bhandunji bhana gubhashitenje, “Bhanashoya maoka kwa mashili gaka Bhelishebhuli nkulungwa jwa maoka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Bhananji nkwaalinga, gubhapinjilenje bhatende ilapo, imanyishe kuti mashili gabho, gaakopoka kwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhaalugulilenje, “Upalume gogowe ugabhanikaga ukalonjeya, likaja lyolyowe lilekanaga shilipalaganishe. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Monaga Lishetani anakwikana nnyene, upalume gwakwe shuulonjeye bhuli? Bhai ngunabheleketa nnei pabha nnanugulanga kuti, ngunashoya maoka kwa mashili gaka Bhelishebhuli? <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Monaga nne ngushoya maoka kwa mashili gaka Bhelishebhuli, bhaakagula bhenunji bhashoyanga maoka kwa mashili gaka gani? Kwa nneyo, bhanganyabho shibhanng'ukumulanje. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Monaga ngushoya maoka kwa mashili ga a Nnungu, bhai mmumanyanje kuti Upalume gwa a Nnungu unng'ishilenje.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Mundu akwete mashili ali na ikomanilo yakwe, atamaga muulinda gwa nyumba jakwe, indu yakwe yowe shiilame. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Ikabheje aikaga akwete mashili ga kumpunda nikunkombola, jwenejo shampokonyole ikomanilo yakwe yowe yaikulupalilaga na kumpokonyola indu yakwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Jojowe akakwiilunda na nne, anaangana na jojowe akalopola na nne, anajaanga.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa Lioka Jwangali jwa Mmbone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matei 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Lioka jwangali jwa mmbone abhingwaga kukamundu, anapita jimajima nng'anga kuloleya pa pumulila. Akapabhone anakwibhalanjila, ‘Shimuje kundamo jangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Abhujaga nikujiimana nyumba jila jipajilwe na jikonjeleywe, <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>bhai, anakwenda kwaatolanga ashimaoka bhana shabha, bhangalinginji bha mmbone kupunda jwenejo, na bhowe bhanakunnjinjilanga mundu jula. Kwa nneyo mundu jula, ali jakwe ja kumpelo, jinabha mbaya ja kundandubho jila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupoka kwa Kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Bhalibheleketa genego, bhakongwe bhamo nnugwinjili lwa bhandunji lula, kwa lilobhe lya utiya gubhashite, “Mbaya bhakongwe bhankwete na libhele linnjonjile.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhashite, “Mbaya kaje bhene bhakulipilikananga lilobhe lya a Nnungu nikunda.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilangulo sha a Yona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matei 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandu lukajenjeshesheje, a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Alu lubheleko lwa lebha, lunapinga shilangulo. Ikabheje lukapegwa shilangulo shoshowe ikabhe shilangulo sha a Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>A Yona bhaliji shilangulo sha bhandunji bha ku Ninawi, nneyo peyo Mwana juka Mundu shapingabha shilangulo kwa lwene lubhelekolu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Lyubha lya ukumu, a Malikia bha ku Shebha shibhakoposhele kukulukana lwene lubhelekolu. Pabha bhenebho bhashinkukoposhela kwaataliya, kwiya pilikanishiya malobhe ga lunda ga a Shelemani, ikabheje apano apali ali jwankulungwa kupunda a Shelemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Bhandunji bha ku Ninawi shibhakoposhelanje lyubha lya ukumu, kukulukana lwene lubhelekolu. Pabha bhandunji bha ku Ninawi bhaipetilenje kwa ligongo lya ntenga gwa a Yona, ikabheje apano apali ali nkulungwa kupunda a Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilangaya sha Nshiilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matei 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Jwakwa mundu akoleya kandilili nikujiunishila eu nikujiiya, ikabhe pakujibhika panani itengu nkupinga bhandunji bhaajinjilangana bhashibhonanje shilangaya. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Liyo lyenu ni kandili ja shiilu shenu, libhaga lyalikoto, shiilu showe shishibhe nshilangaya. Liyo lyenu likalole, shiilu shenu shishibhe nnubhindu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Bhai mwiiteije, shilangaya shinkwetesho shinatendebhushe kubha lubhindu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Bhai monaga shiilu shenu showe shikolaga shilangaya gwangali pakwete lubhindu, shene shiilusho shishibhe na shilangaya kwa kaje, malinga kandili shijikuti kummulishila kwa shilangaya shakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwagambanga Mapalishayo na Bhaajiganya bha Shalia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>A Yeshu bhakabheleketeje genego, Apalishayo bhamo gubhaashemele shalya kunngwabho, gubhapite tama kulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Apalishayo bhala gubhakanganigwe bhakabhoneje kuti bhanalya gwangali kunabha. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Bhakulungwa gubhaabhalanjile, “Mmanganya Ashimapalishayo nnaukanganga shikombe na shaani kua, ikabheje nkati nngumbelenje kukwetela indu na yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Mmanganya mmagulumba! Bhuli, aeleye kua nngati jojo aeleye na nkati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Bhai nshoyanje mbepei kwa indu inkwetenje, na yowe shiinkonjelanje.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Ikabheje ole, Mapalishayo, pabha nnakwaapanganga a Nnungu lipungu lya kumi nkali lya maamba ga liponda, ikabheje nkakwaatendelanga bhandu ipinjikwa na ibhapinga a Nnungu. Punkupinjikwanga nshoyanje yeneyo, gwangali kuleka gana gala.”<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Ole Ashimapalishayo, pabha nnapinganga kutama itengu ya mmujo mmashinagogi, na komaywa pa lugwinjili. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Ole, pabha nshibhanganga mbuti makabhuli gangabhikwa shilangulo, bhandunji bhalilibhatanga pantundu jakwe gwangali kumumanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Bhaajiganya bhamo bha shalia, gubhaalugulile, “Mmaajiganya, malobhe genu ganakutupetekuya nkali uwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Na mmanganya mmaajiganya bha shalia ole, pabha nnakwaatwikanga bhandunji mishigo jatopa jikajigalika, akuno mwaashayene nkaakwayanga nkali kwa lukowe lumo kwaajangutanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Ole, pabha nnashenjelanga makabhuli ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhabhulegwenje na bhanangulungwa bhenunji. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Kwa nneyo nnakong'ondelanga itendi ya bhanangulungwa bhenunji, pabha bhashikwabhulaganga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, na mmanganya nnashenjelanga makabhuli gabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Kwa nneyo, kwa Lumanyiyo lwa a Nnungu gubhashite, ‘Shinaapeleshelanje ashinkulondola na mitume, ikabheje bhananji shibhaabhulaganje, na bhananji shibhaapotekanje.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Kwa nneyo lwene lubhelekolu lupingagambwa kwa ligongo lya minyai ja ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhowe, bhabhulegwenje kuumila ku ndandubho ja shilambolyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Kutandubhila kubhulagwa kwa a Abheli mpaka a Shakalia bhabhulegwe pakati pakati shitala na pa ukonjelo. Elo, ngunakummalanjilanga lwene lubhelekolu shilugambwe kwa yene itendiyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Ole gwenunji mmanganya bhaajiganya bha shalia, pabha nshishoyanga nshungulo gwa nnango gwa lumanyiyo, mwaashayene mwangajinjilanga na bhajinjilanga bhala nshikwaibhililanga bhanajinjilanje.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>A Yeshu bhakakoposheje mwemula, ashimapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha shalia bhala gubhatandubhenje kwaashimanga na kwaatega kwa ibhuyo yaigwinji, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>nkupinga bhapatanje mwakwaakamulila kwa malobhe gabho.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kukalipila ga Ugulumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Gene malangago bhashinkuluimana lugwinjili lwa bhandu maelupu, mpaka kuishila kulibhatana, a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kwaalugulilanga bhaajiganywa bhabho, Mwiiteiganje na ngedule ya mapalishayo, yani ugulumba. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Shakwapi shoshowe shiunishilwe shikaapinga unukulwa, na shoshowe shiishiywe shipinga manyika. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Kwa nneyo, yowe immeleketenje palubhindu, bhandunji shibhaipilikananje pa shilangaya na yowe imwanyinyitangaga nnyumba nni nng'ugelenje milango, ipinga lunguywa pa shipagala sha nyumba.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apinjikwa Kujogopwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matei 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Ngunakunnugulilanga mwashaambwiga ajangu, nnaajogopanje bhabhulaganga shiilu bhala, ikabheje bhakaakombolanga kutenda shina kupunda shenesho. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Shininnangulanje gani apinjikwa kujogopwa. Munnjogopanje jwene akombola kubhulaga, na abhulagaga anakombola kunnjaa mundu ku moto gwa kujeanamu. Elo, ngunakummalanjilanga, munnjogopanje jwenejo.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Bhuli ndyondyo nng'ano ikaushwa kwa ela ishokope? Ikabheje nkali jumo akalibhalika na a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nkali umbo ya mmitwe jenunji a Nnungu bhaimanyi pwili ilingwa. Bhai, nnajogopanje, mmanganya mmambonenji kupunda ndyondyo yaigwinji!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaakunda eu Kwaakana a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matei 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mundu jojowe ashangunde palugwinjili, Mwana juka Mundu shankunde pa ashimalaika bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Ikabheje, mundu jojowe angana pa bhandu najwalakwe apinga kanwa pa ashimalaika bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Jojowe abheleketa malobhe ga nyata kuka Mwana juka Mundu shaleshelelwe, ikabheje akunkupulu Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo akaleshelelwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Mmanganya pushibhampelekanje mmashinagogi kuukumulwa na bhatagwala na bhakulungwanji, nnakolanje lipamba lya shana bhuli pushimwitapulanje eu muubheleketelo. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Pabha popo pepo Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo shannjiganyanje sha bheleketa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Tajili Nngumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mundu jumo nnugwinjili lwa bhandu lula gwabhalugulile a Yeshu, “Mmaajiganya, munnugulile nkulwangu tugabhane ulishi gubhatuleshele atati.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>A Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Ambwiga, gani amishile nne kubha akimu na nkugabhanya jwenunji?”<verse eid="LUK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhowenji, “Mwiiteiganje na shilokoli shoshowe, pabha gumi uka mundu ukatamila ga gwinji gwa indu yakwete.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kungai gubhaatanjilenje lutango, “Ashinkupagwa mundu jumo tajili, atungwile yalya munngunda gwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Jwene mundujo gwaganishiye muntima gwakwe, ‘Shindende bhuli na nne nangali pagosheya yalya yangu? <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Shindende nnei, shimomole nngokwe yangu na shinjenje jikulungwa, mwenemo shimishe yalya yowe na indu yangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Penepo shiniibheleketele shamuntima, nnaino ukwete shibhiko sha pwaa yaka ya igwinji. Bhai pumulila, gwiilile na gwiing'wele na kuangalila.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Ikabheje a Nnungu gubhannugulile, ‘Mmangumba mmwe, shilo sha lelo ntima gwenu upinga tolwa. Na indu yowe imwiibhishile ila shiibhe ikeni?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>A Yeshu gubhamalishiye kwa bheleketa, “Na malinga mundu akwiibhishila indu nnyene, ikabheje kwa a Nnungu jwangali shindu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaakulupalila a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matei 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Kwa nneyo a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Kwa lyene ligongolyo, nnakolanje lipamba ga shalya sha lamila, wala ga iwalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Pabha gumi ni gwa mmbone kupunda shalya, na shiilu ni sha mmbone kupunda iwalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Nngalolanje makungulu, gakapanda na gakaneng'ena na wala gangali nngokwe jojowe. Nkali nneyo a Nnungu bhanakugaliya. Mmanganya ni bhammbonenji kupunda ijuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Gani munkumbi gwenunji kwa lajilila kwakwe akombola kwiijenjesheya kapela lyubha limo lya gumi gwakwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Bhai, monaga nkakombolanga kutenda shindu shishoko malinga shenesho, kwa nndi nnajililanje na ganago? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Nnolanje malubha ga mukonde shigakuti bhulika. Gakapota wala gakaluka. Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga, nkali a Shelemani na shuma kwabho kowe bhangawashwa kwa konja malinga lilubha limo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Bhai ibhaga, a Nnungu bhanakuliwasha nneyo liamba lya mukonde linkulibhonanga lelo na malabhi linaleshelwa pamoto, bhuli, mmanganya bhakanng'washanga kupunda genego? Mmanganya bha ngulupai jishoko!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Bhai nnaabhushilanje ga shalya eu ga ya papila wala nnakolanje lipamba. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Pabha bhandu bhowe bhakakwaamanyanga a Nnungu, yeneyo peyo ni ibhaabhushilanga. Ikabheje Ainabhenunji bhamumanyi kuti mmanganya nnakwiipinganga yene induyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Ikabhe nng'abhushilanje oti Upalume gwa a Nnungu, na ina yowe shimpatanje.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utajili gwa ku Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matei 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Nnajogopanje, mmandunji bha likundi lishoko! Pabha Ainabhenunji bhashiengwa kumpanganga Upalume gwabho. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Nng'ushanje indu yenunji, mmbiyayo mwaapanganje bhaalaga. Mwialashiyanje mipatila jangalala nikwiibhishila shibhiko kunnungu kuikaamala. Kweneko bhagwii bhakajinjilanga, wala mang'ong'ota gakaalibhia. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Pabha pushili shibhiko shenu na ntima gwenu shigubhe popo.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nsheyanje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Mmanganje tayali kwa liengo, na kandili yenunji ilikolela, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>mmanganje malinga bhatumishi bhakwaalindililanga bhakulungwa bhabhonji bhabhuje kukopoka kundoa, nkupinga shangu bhaugulilanje pushibhaolishiyepo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Mbaya bhene bhatumishi bhakulungwa bhabhonji pushibhabhuje, shibhaaimananje bhalisheyanga! Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, bhene bhakulungwabho shibhaibhishe ukoto kwa liengo, nikwaatamikanga bhalyanganje shalya, akuno bhalikwaatumishilanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Nkali bhabhuje pakati shilo eu kumashelo, mbaya bhene bhatumishi bhushiaimananje bhalisheyanga! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Mmumanyanje kuti, kaliji nnyene nyumba akagamanyi malanga ga kwiya nngwii, akasheshiye, wala akanaleshe nyumba jakwe jibhomolwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Nneila peila numbe mmanganya mmanganje muulolelo, pabha Mwana juka Mundu anakwiya malanga gunkakugalolelanga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumishi Jwaakulupalika na Jwangakulupalika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matei 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>A Petili gubhaabhushiye a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, lwene lutangolu ntutanjile uwepe, eu bhandu bhowe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Bhakulungwa gubhajangwile, Bhai, igala gani ali nkulungwa jwa bhatumishi akwete lunda, lwa kwaatenda bhakulungwa bhakwe bhammishe kubha nkulungwa jwa bhatumishi bhabho, nkupinga abhapanganje shalya malanga ga pwaa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Shiibhe mbaya jwene nkulungwa jwa bhatumishijo, bhakulungwa bhakwe pushibhabhujepo bhanng'imane alitenda nneyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shibhantende nkulungwa jwa indu yabho yowe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Ikabheje jwene ntumishijo aibheleketelaga sha muntima, bhakulungwa bhangu bhanakabha kubhuja, nitandubha kwaakomanga bhatumishi ajakwe, bhanabhalume na bhanabhakongwe, nilya na ng'wa na kolelwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>bhakulungwa bhakwe shibhabhuje lyubha lyangalilolela na malanga gangagamanya, shibhanngabhanye ipande ibhili, nikummika pamo na bhangakulupalikanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Ntumishi akugamanya gubhapinga bhakulungwa bhakwe, ikabhe akaatenda ibhapinga, shapanyangulwe kaje. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Ikabheje akakumumanya jula, atendaga ya kummulaya apanyangulwe, shapanyangulwe kashoko. Jojowe apegwilwe yaigwinji, shalongwe yaigwinji, akulupalilwe kwa yaigwinji, shiipinjikwe yaigwinji.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ni Ligongo lya Malekano ga Bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matei 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Njikwiya koleya moto pa shilambolyo, mbaya ukaliji ukoleywe! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Ikabheje njikola ubhatisho gungupinjikwa matishwe, ngunapupa ntima mpaka gwene ubhatishogo umalile! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Punkuganishiyanga nyile peleka ulele pa shilambolyo? Wala kashoko, nngabha ulele ikabhe malekano. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Na kutandubhila nnaino, bhandunji nng'ano bha likaja limo bhapinga taukangana, bhatatu kwa bhabhili, na bhabhili kwa bhatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Ainamundu shibhantaushe mwanagwabho, na mwana shabhataushe ainagwe, anyinamundu shibhantaushe mwali jwabho, na jwalakwe mwali shabhataushe akwabhe, akwemundu shibhantaushe nkamwanagwabho na nkamwanamundu shabhataushe akwebhakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujimanya Miongwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matei 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>A Yeshu gubhabhekete kabhili na lugwinjili, “Punkugabhonanga maunde galikoposhela kulititimila lyubha, shangupe nnabheleketanga, ‘Shijinye ula,’ na jinanya. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Nnjibhonangaga mbungo ja kwibhanda jinipuga, nnabheleketanga, ‘Kupingabhala lyubha,’ na pwikubha nneyo peyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Mmanganya mmagulumba! Nnamanyanga kulondola kunya kwa ula eu kubhala kwa lyubha, kwa lola shilambo na kunani, bhai kwa nndi nkakujimanyanga jene miongwe jino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnundane na Mmagongo Nnjenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matei 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Kwa nndi mwaashayene nkaamuanga kutenda ya aki? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Monaga mmagongo nnjenu alikwenda kunshitakiya, mbaya kujuga kuleshelelwa nninginji mumpanda, nkupinga anampeleshe ku bhaukumula, na bhaukumula bhanakunkamuya kwa ashimanjola, na bhalakwe ashimanjola bhanakuntabha. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjila nkakopoka mwenemo, mpaka nnipe mmbiya ja malishiya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mwiipetanje Nnaatitimilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Gene malangago bhandunji bhana gubhaabhalanjilenje a Yeshu ga bhandunji bha ku Galilaya bhabhulegwenje na a Pilato na minyai jabhonji gujianganyishe na minyai ja bhannyama bhabhonji bha bhishila. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhaabhushienje, “Punkuganishiyanga bhene Bhagalilayabho bhashinkukolanga yambi kupunda Bhagalilaya bhananji, nkali bhaabhulagwanje shana nneyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Nngabha nneyo, ikabheje nkali mmanganya nkaipetanje, nneyo peyo shintitimilanje. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Bhuli, bhene kumi na nane bhagwililwenje na nnala ku Shiloamu niwanganga bhala, punkuganishiyanga kuti bhashinkukolanga yambi kupunda bhandunji bhowe bhatamanganaga ku Yelushalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga nngabha, ikabheje nkali mmanganya nkaipetanje, nneyo peyo mmowe shintitimilanje.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nkongo Ukaogola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaatanjilenje aluno lutango luno, “Bhandu bhamo bhashinkukola nkongo gwa ntini munngunda gwabho gwa mishabhibhu. Gubhapite kupinga bhakakabhe iepo yakwe, ikabheje kuguimana gwangaogola tini nkali jimo. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Bhai, gubhammalanjile ntumishi jwabho, ‘Lola! Kwa yaka itatu natendaga kwiya kabha iepo ya gwene nkongogu, nangapata shoshowe. Guushele! Kwa nndi unaangabhanya litaka gwayoyo?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Ikabheje ntumishi jula gwabhajangwile, ‘Mmakulungwa, namwaka tuuleshe, niguolele liimbo na niutajile mbolela. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Ibhaga pashaka uogolaga iepo, shammbone, ibhaga lepe, bhai shiguushele.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwalamya Bhakongwe Lyubha lya Pumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Lyubha limo lya Pumulila a Yeshu bhatendaga jiganya nshinagogi jimo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Penepo bhashinkupagwa bhakongwe bhamo bhaaliji na shigongo kwa yaka kumi na nane, pabha ashinkwaatama lioka jwangali jwa mmbone. Nngongo gwabho gwashinkupinda, bhakakombolaga kujinuka nkali kashoko. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhoneje gubhaashemile, gubhaabhalanjile, “A mama nnamile shilwele shenu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Gubhaabhishile makono bhakongwe bhala, shangupe nngongo gwabho guugolweshe, gubhainiye a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Ikabheje bhakulungwa bha shinagogi gubhatumbele pabhaa Yeshu bhashikunnamya mundu Lyubha lya Pumulila. Kwa nneyo gubhalubhalanjile lugwinjili lwa bhandunji lula, “Nkwetenje mobha shita ga kamula liengo. Bhai, nnjiyangane gene mobhago kunnamiywanje ilwele yenunji, ikabheje nnajiyangane lyubha lya Pumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Penepo Bhakulungwa gubhajangwile, “Mmanganya mmagulumba! Munkumbi gwenunji gani akananng'ugule ng'ombe eu mbunda jwakwe nshitundu ampeleshe kung'wa mashi, lyubha lya Pumulila? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Nnaino, apano apali jwankongwe jwa shipinga sha a Bhulaimu apotekwaga naka lishetani kwa yaka kumi na nane. Bhuli, nngabha sha mmbone kunngopola shitabho shakwe lyubha lya Pumulila?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>A Yeshu bhakabheleketeje genego, ashaamagongo ajabho bhowe gubhakwetenje oni ikabheje bhananji guyaanonyelenje kwa kaje kwa ligongo lya indu ibhatendile ila.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Mbeju ja Aladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matei 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>A Yeshu gubhabhushiye, “Upalume gwa a Nnungu ulandana na nndi? Shiniulandanye na nndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Malinga mbeju ja aladali jili jishoko kaje jatolile mundu jumo nipanda munngunda gwakwe, gujimelile nibha nkongo. Ijuni guishenjile maui nnyambi yakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ngedule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matei 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Kabhili gubhabhushiye, “Shiniulandanye na nndi Upalume gwa a Nnungu? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Malinga ngedule shibhatolile bhakongwe bhamo nianganya na utandi madebhe gabhili na nushu kungai utandi gowe guukwebhile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnango gwa Nshoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matei 7:13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>A Yeshu gubhapite na mwanja gwabho kuloya ku Yelushalemu bhalipita mwilambo na mwijiji, bhalipita jiganya. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Mundu jumo gwabhabhushiye, “Mmakulungwa, bhuli, bhandunji bhapinga tapulwanga ni bhashokope?”<verse eid="LUK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, Ntumbilanje kaje kujinjila kupitila nnango gwa nshoko, pabha ngunakummalanjilanga, bhandu bhabhagwinji shibhalinganje kujinjila ikabheje bhakakombolanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Shigaishe mobha bhayene nyumba shibhajime niugala nnango. Mmanganya nkupinga jimangana palanga nitandubha kuolishiya nninkutinji, Mmakulungwa ntuugulile nnango. Ikabheje bhenebho shibhannjangulanje, ngakummanyanga mmanganya wala kunkoposhelenje. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Numbe mmanganya shintandubhanje kwaalugulila, twatendaga kulya na ng'wa pamo na mmwe na mwatendaga jiganya mwilambo yetu. <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Ikabheje na bhalabho shibhaajangulanje, “Ngakummanyanga mmanganya wala kunkukoposhelanga, nshokangane mmanganya mmowe mmalebhanga.”<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Penepo ni pushipingapagwa shililo na kutauna meno, pushimwabhonanje a Bhulaimu na a Ishaka na a Yakobho na ashinkulondola bhowe bha a Nnungu bhalinginji mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu, ikabheje mmanganya nnokololwenje palanga! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Bhapinga kwiyangana bhandunji kukoposhela mmbali yowe ya shilambolyo nitama pa shalya shaabhishilwenje mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Nnole, bhapali bhalinginji bha kumpelo shibhabhanganje bha kundandubho na bha kundandubho shibhabhanganje bha kumpelo.<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakushigutila Shilambo sha Yelushalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matei 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Gene malangapego, Mapalishayo na bhandunji bhana gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnjabhule apano nnjende mmbali jina, pabha bhakulungwa a Elode bhanapinga kummulaga.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nnjendangane nkaalilugulilanje lyene lyananshetolyo nneino, ‘Lelo na malabhi shinjoye maoka na kwaalamyanga bhalwelenji na ntondo shimaliye liengo lyangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Nkali nneyo, lelo na malabhi na ntondo, ngunapinjikwa nyende mwanja gwangu, pabha ikapinjikwa ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhabhulagwe kunyenje shilambo sha Yelushalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Ugwe Yelushalemu! Yelushalemu! Unakwabhulaganga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu nikwaakomanga maganga bhatumilwenje kunngwako. Palingwa pumbinjile kwaagutamilanga bhana bhako pamo mbuti namwana jwa nnguku shakuti kwaagutamilanga bhana bhakwe mmapapiko gakwe, ikabheje gwangapinga. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Nnolanje! Shinneshelwanje ushubha nshilambo shenunji. Bhai, ngunakummalanjilanga, nkamonanga kabhili mpaka pushimmeleketanje kuti, ‘Bhakwete Mboka bhene bhakwiya kwa lina lya Bhakulungwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Nnwele Shitaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Lyubha limo lya Pumulila a Yeshu bhashinkwenda kulya shalya kumui kwa akalongolele bhamo bha Mapalishayo, bhandunji bhapalinji penepo gubhaalolesheyenje kwa kaje. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Mmujo jabho a Yeshu ashinkupagwa mundu nnwele shitaka. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje bhaajiganya bha shalia na Mapalishayo, “Ilipinjikwa eu ikapinjikwa kunnamya mundu Lyubha lya Pumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Ikabheje bhanganya bhala gubhatemingene ilili. A Yeshu gubhankamwile nnwele jula gubhannamiye, gubhanneshile aijabhulile. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Kungai gubhaabhushiye, “Munkumbi gwenunji gani mwanagwe eu ng'ombe jwakwe atumbushilaga nniiko, akananshoye pabha Lyubha lya Pumulila?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Ikabheje bhangakombolanga kwajaangula.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiitimalika na Mituka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhonanjeje bhashemilwenje bhala shibhatendaga kwiagulilanga itengu ya mmujo, gubhaalugulilenje. <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Ibhaga mundu anshemaga kundoa, nnatame pa shitengu sha mmujo, inabha apali juna ashemilwe jwa kupunda mmwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Bhanshemilenje bhala shibhajiye kummalanjila, ‘Mwaapiye abha.’ Penepo nkupinga kola oni pa bhandu bhowe nnikwendatama shitengu sha nnyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ikabhe nshemwaga ntame shitengu sha nnyuma, nkupinga nnyene nyumba ajiyaga annugulile, ‘Ambwiga, nnjiye mmujo muno.’ Penepo nkupinga ishimiywa na bhowe bhatemingene pamo na mmwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Pabha, jojowe akwiikweya apinga tuluywa, na akwiituluya apinga kweywa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Kungai gubhaabhalanjile na bhashemile bhala, “Punkuteleka kalamu ibhe mui eu shilo, nnaashemanje ashaambwiga ajenu eu ashaalongo ajenu eu ashaatami ajenu bhalinginji matajilipe, na bhalabhonji bhana kwiya kunshemanga nibha nnipilwe yumwaatendelenje ila. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ikabheje, punkuteleka kalamu, mwaashemanje bhaalaga, bhaalemalanga na ashinangwabha na ashinangalole, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>na mmwe shimpate mboka, pabha bhene bhanganyabho bhangalinginji sha kunnipa. A Nnungu shibhampe upo yenu lyubha lishibhayukanje bhandunji bhakwetenje aki.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Kalamu Jikulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matei 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Mundu jumo munkumbi gwa bhatemingene na a Yeshu pa shalya gwashite, “Mbaya jwene mundu shalye kalamu mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>A Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Bhandu bhamo bhashinkuteleka kalamu jikulungwa, gubhaashemilenje bhandunji bhabhagwinji. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Lyubha lya kalamu likaishileje gubhantumile ntumishi jwabho akaalugulilanje bhashemilwenje bhala kuti, ‘Nnjiyangane, indu yowe ili tayali.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Ikabheje bhowe, gubhatandwibhenje kwiilugula jumo jumo. Jwa ntai gwashite, ‘Njigombola nngunda, kwa nneyo ngunapinjikwa nyende ngaulole shonde bhai, uneshe nyende.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Na juna gwashite, ‘Njigombola ng'ombe ya lima, majela nng'ano, kwa nneyo ngunakwenda kwiilinga, shonde bhai uneshe nyende.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Na juna gwashite, ‘Njilomba, kwa nneyo ngaika.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Ntumishi jula gwabhujile nigwabhalugulile bhakulungwa bhakwe jene nganijo. Bhayene nyumba bhala gubhatumbele, gubhannugulile ntumishi jwabho, ‘Ujende shangu kumpanda njindo na mmipanda ja pa shilambo pano, ujiyenabhonji nnyumba muno bhalaga, na ashinangwabha, na ashinangalole, na bhaalemalanga.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Kungai ntumishi jula gwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa, innajile ila ndendile, ikabheje mwaatama mwatangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Bhakulungwa bhala gubhannugulile ntumishi jula, ‘Ujende mmipanda njindo na mipanda ja pa shilambo pano ukaashishilishiyanje bhandunji bhajiyangane, nyumba jangu jigumbale. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga mmowe kuti, jwakwapi nkali jumo munkumbi gwa bhunaashemilenje gwantai bhala shapaye shalya shangu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Galama Jabha Nkujiganywa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matei 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Penepo, likukute likulungwa lya bhandu gulilongene na a Yeshu. Bhai, gubhaatendebhushilenje bhandunji gubhaalugulilenje, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Mundu jojowe apinga kubha nkujiganywa jwangu ambinje, kupunda shakutikwaapinga ainagwe na akwabhe na akagwe na ashibhanagwe, na ashaapwakwe na ashaalumbugwe na nkali kupunda shakuti kwiipinga nnyene. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Mundu akaujigale nshalabha gwakwe ningagula akakombola kubha nkujiganywa jwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Pabha, gani munkumbi gwenunji apingaga kushenga nnala, akatandubha kutama nilola galama jakwe nkupinga amumanye ibhaga akwete mmbiyaya malila? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Inabha atandubhaga kushenga nshingi niilepela kumaliya, bhandunji shibhalolanjebho shibhanng'ekanje, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>bhalinkutinji. Aju munduju atandwibhe kushenga, ikabheje ashilepela malishiya.<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Eu mpalume jwashi apinga kwenda komana na upalume guna, anatandubhe kutama ni niganishiya ibhaga shakombole na ashimanjola bhakwe elupu likumi limo, kwenda komana na a mpalume bhakwete manjola elupu makumi gabhili? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Abhonaga akakombola, shatume ntenga kupinga ulele bhakanabhe bhandishila. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Bhai nneyo peyo, akapagwa nkali jumo munkumbi gwenunji apingabha nkujiganywa jwangu, akaleshe indu yowe yakwete.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnjete Janganong'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matei 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Nnjete ni ja mmbone, ibhaga jikanonye, jitagwe nndi jinonye kabhili? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Jikapwaa kwa litaka wala kwa tenda mbolela. Ikabheje pakujijaa kwa taliya. Akwete makutujo apilikane!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ngondolo Aobhile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matei 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Lyubha limo, bhakamula koli na bhaatendanga yambi bhabhagwinji bhashinkwiyangana kukwaapilikanishiya a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha shalia gubhatandubhenje kuinginika, “Mwalolanje abha bhandubha! Bhanakwaashemanga bhakwetenje yambi, na bhanalya nabhonji.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaatanjilenje lutango.<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Ibhaga, munkumbi gwenunji mundu akolaga ngondolo makumi kumi, jumo aobhaga, bhuli, akaalekanga makumi tisha na tisha bhala pakonde, nikwenda kunnoleya aobhile jula mpaka ampate? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Ampataga, apinga kunnjigala pashilembele alikwiinonyela. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Aikaga kumui, apinga kwaashemanga ashaambwiga ajakwe nikwaalugulilanga, ‘Twinonyele tubhowe, pabha nimpatile ngondolo jwangu aobhile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Nneyo peyo ngunakummalanjilanga, pwiipingabha kwiinonyela kunnungu, kwa ligongo lya kwiipeta mundu jumo akwete yambi, kupunda bhandu makumi tisha na tisha bhakwetenje aki, bhakaapinjikwanga kwiipeta.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ela Jiobhile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Eu nkubhonanga bhuli? Tujile jwankongwe jumo akwete ela likumi limo, aobhyaga jimo, shatende nndi? Shakoleye kandili nipejila nyumba nisheimba kuloleya mpaka ajibhone. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Ajipataga, shabhashemanje ashaambwiga ajakwe na ashaatami ajakwe alinkuti, ‘Twinonyele, pabha ela jangu jaobhile jila nijibhweni.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Nneyo peyo ngunakunnugulilanga, shiikutibha a nng'angalo kwa ashimalaika bha a Nnungu, kwa ligongo lya mundu jumo akwete yambi akwiipeta.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Mwana Aobhile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>A Yeshu gubhapundile kubheleketa, Bhashinkupagwa bhandu bhamo bhaakwete bhashanda bhabhili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Jwannung'una jula akwaabhalanjilaga ainagwe. “Atati mmbe ulishi gwangu.” Na bhalabho gubhaagabhanishiyenje mali gabho.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Gakapiteje mobha gashoko, jwannung'una jula gwaushiye ulishi gwakwe, gwapite kushilambo sha talika na ela yakwe ila, gwajonenje nkulabhalabha. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Akamaliyeje indu yowe, gushikoposhele shibhanga shapunda nshilambo mula, gwatandwibhe kulaga. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Gwajujile liengo kukanshilambo jumo jwa kweneko, jwalakwe gwampeleshe kunngunda gwakwe kuliya ngulubhe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Atendaga lokolila shalya sha ngulubhe, ikabhe jwakwapi mundu ampele shindu. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Ikabheje akalumatileje muntima gwakwe gwashite, bhatumishi bhalingwa kwa atati kula, bhalyanganga nilepela, akuno nne niliwa shibhanga? <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Shimuje kwa atati ngaabhalanjile kuti, atati, njilebha Kunnungu na kwenu mmwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Ngapinjikwa kushemwa kabhili mwanagwenu. Nndende mbuti ntumishi jwenu. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Bhai gwajabhwile kubhuja kwa ainagwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Ikabheje ali kwaataliya, ainagwe gubhamweni, nikummonela shiya gubhammutushile kukunnyambatila akuno bhalikunnambanga. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwanamundu gwashite. Atati njikwaalebhela a Nnungu, na njikunnebhela na mmwe. Ngapinjikwa kabhili kushemwa namwanagwenu. <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Ikabheje ainagwe gubhaalugulilenje bhatumishi bhabho, ‘Shangu! Ntolanje nngubho ya mmbone munng'washanje! Munng'washanje lupete na ilatu! <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Munng'inganje ng'ombe jwa mmbone jwa jimbala, tulye na tuangalile! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Pabha kwangu nne mwananguju aawile, mbena jwankoto ashinkuobha, ikabheje nnaino abhoneshe.’ Gubhatandubhenje kuangalila.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Gene malangago nkulugwe jula, paliji akanabhebhuja kunngunda. Pabhujaga alibhandishila kumui, gwapilikene nyimbo na iindo ya ina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Gwanshemile ntumishi jumo, gwammushiye, ‘Shipali nndi?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Ntumishi jula gwannjangwile, ‘Mpwako abhujile, na ainago bhashikunng'injila ng'ombe jwa mmbone jwa jimbala, pabha bhampatile mwana gwabho ali jwankoto.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Nshanda jwankulu jula guinshimile, gwakanile kujinjila nnyumba. Ainagwe gubhakopweshe palanga kukunshondelesheya ajinjile. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Ikabheje jwalakwe gwabhajangwile, ‘Nnole! Yaka yowei nne njikuntumishila na nganabhekana amuli yenu wala lyubha limo. Ikabheje nkanabhemba nkali mwana jwa mmbui jumo, ng'angalale na ashaambwiga ajangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Ikabheje mwana gwenu ajonenje indu yenu na majajana, akabhujeje shangupe nshikunng'injila ng'ombe jwa mmbone jwa jimbala.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Ainagwe gubhannjangwile, ‘Mwanangu, ugwe puli na nne mobha gowega, na indu yowe ingwete nne yako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Ikabheje tushipinjikwa kuangalila nkwinonyela pabha mpwako awile jula, mbena jwankoto, ashinkuobha, nnaino abhoneshe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nyapala jwa Penyeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Ashinkupagwa tajili jumo na nyapala jwakwe. Tajili jula ashinkulugulilwa, kuti nyapala jwabho anatapanya indu yabho. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Tajili jula gwanshemile, nikummuya, ‘Indu yashi yako ugwe ingupilikanai? Utende malonda ga indu yangu yuposhele na yulile, pabha ukaapinjikwa kubha nyapala kabhili.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Nyapala jula gwaganishiye, ‘Bhakulungwa bhangu bhanaminga liengo lya unyapala, shindende bhuli? Nangali mashili ga lima, pita juga ngunakola oni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Elo, nishimanyi sha tenda nkupinga pushimingwe liengopo, bhandunji bhanjemelanje kunngwabhonji.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>“Bhai, gwabhashemilenje jumo jumo, bhakwetenje magambo bhowe kubhakulungwa bhakwe, gwammushiye jwa ntai jula, ‘Yukulongwa na bhakulungwa ilingwa?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Jwalakwe gwajangwile, ‘Nndobho 180 ya mauta ga sheituni.’ Nyapala jula gwannugulile, ‘Tola shipande sha ligambo lyako, shangu ujandishe nndobho makumi tisha.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Na gwammushiye akwete ligambo jwa bhili, ‘Ugwe ulongwa nndi?’ Jwalakwe gwajangwile, ‘Magunia 1,000 ga ngano.’ Nyapala jula gwannugulile, ‘Tola shipande sha ligambo lyako, shangu ujandishe magunia mia nane.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Bhai tajili jula gwannumbilile nyapala jula, kwa penya kwakwe. Pabha bhandunji bha pa shilambolyo pano bhanapenyanga pubhatendanga indu na ashaajabhonji, kupunda bhandunji bha Upalume gwa a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Na bhalabho a Yeshu gubhapundile kubheleketa, “Na nne ngunakummalanjilanga, mpanganje mbwiga na bhandunji kwa mali ga pa shilambolyo, nkupinga gamalaga, mposhelwanje kundamo ja pitipiti. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Jojowe shakulupalilwe kwa indu yaishoko, shakulupalilwe nkali kwa indu yaikulungwa, na jojowe akaakulupalika kwa indu yaishoko, akaakulupalika nkali kwa indu yaikulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Bhai ibhaga, mmanganya nkakulupalikanje kwa mali ga pa shilambolyo, gani shampanganje mali ga kweli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na nkakulupalikanje kwa mali gaka mundu juna, gani shankamuyanje mali genunji mwaashayene?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Jwakwapi ntumishi akombola kwaatumishilanga bhakulungwanji bhabhili, pabha shanshime jumo nikumpinga junajo, eu shanng'ishimiye jumo na junajo nikunnyegaya. Nkakombolanga kwaatumishila a Nnungu pamo na mali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ibheleketi Ina ya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matei 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Ashimapalishayo bhalinginji bhaapinganga mmbiya, bhakapilikananjeje genego, gubhaeshilenje nkwaanyegaya. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya nnakwitendanga nkwetenje aki pa bhandu, ikabheje a Nnungu bhajimanyi mitima jenunji, pabha shene shibhoneka sha mmbone kubhandu, a Nnungu pubhakushibhona sha bhiyabhiya.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Shalia na ashinkulondola, yaapali mpaka malanga ga a Yowana Bhabhatisha. Kutandubhila penepo, ngani ja mmbone ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu jinalunguywa, na kila mundu anakwiijinjiya kwa mashili. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Ikabheje ikakola ukomu kunnungu na shilambolyo kupita, kupunda nkali shipande shishoko sha Shalia kushoywa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Jojowe akunneka nkagwe nilomba juna, analabhalabha, na jojowe ankunnomba jwankongwe aleshilwe, analabhalabha.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Tajili nagwe Lashali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Ashinkupagwa mundu jumo tajili, awalaga nngubho ya mmbiya yaigwinji ya langi ja shambalau na ya kitani ja takata, alipoka mobha gowe. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Na pannango gwakwe atendaga tama nkulaga jumo, lina lyakwe Lashalo, akwete ilonda shiilu showe. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Lashalo atendaga lokolila malepei gaagwaga pa mesha jika tajili jula, nkali mbwa yatendaga kwiya kunnambanga ilonda yakwe!<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Bhai nkulaga jula akuwaga, ashimalaika bha kunnungu gubhantolilenje, nikwenda kummika pubhaliji a Bhulaimu. Na tajili na jwalakwe gwawile, nishikwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Tajili jula ali mmboteko ya punda kundamo ja bhawilenje, gwajinwile meyo, gwabhabhweni a Bhulaimu kwataliya bhali nagwe Lashalo, <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Bhai, gwabhashemile kwa utiya, “Ambuje a Bhulaimu, mmonele shiya, muntume Lashalojo kapela shikowe ashubhishe mmashi, andolishiye nnulimi lwangu, pabha ngunapotekwa kwa kaje pamoto pano.”<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Ikabheje a Bhulaimu gubhajangwile, “Kumbushila mwanangu, kuti ugwe ushinkupoka nndamo jako, na Lashaloju ashinkulaga. Ikabheje nnaino, jwalakwe anapoka na ugwe unapotekwa kwa kaje. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Kupunda genego, pakatipakati jetu uwe na mmanganya, lishibhikwa liimbo likulungwa, nkupinga bhapinganga kwiya kunngwenunji kukoposhela akuno bhanakombolanje, na bhapinganga kwiya kwetu uwe kukoposhela kweneko bhanakombolanje.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Tajili jula gwashite, “Bhai ambuje a Bhulaimu, shonde bhai muntume Lashalo ajende kulikaja lya atati, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>pabha njikola ashapwanga nng'ano, akaalungushiyanje nkupinga bhanaikangane kumboteko kuno.”<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Ikabheje a Bhulaimu gubhajangwile, “Ashapwako bhakwetenje a Musha na ashinkulondola, bhaapilikalanje bhanganyabho.” <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Ikabheje na jwalakwe gwashite kabhili, “Nngabha nneyo ambuje a Bhulaimu, ikabhe mundu ayukaga nikwaajendelanga, shibhaipetanje.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Na bhalabho a Bhulaimu gubhajangwile, “Ibhaga bhakaapilikanilanje a Musha na ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, bhakakundanga nkali mundu akayushile.”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yambi na Ngulupai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matei 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Indu ikwaatendanga bhandu bhatendanje yambi shiikoposhelepe. Ikabheje ole gwakwe jwene mundu akwiitenda ikoposhele jula. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ikaliji mbaya atabhilwe liganga likulungwa lya yajila nnukoi nitumbushiywa mmashi, nngabha kunnebhya jumo bhene bhabhashokobha <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Mwiiteiganje!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Monaga mpwenu annebhelaga, munneye, aipetaga, munneshelele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Na nkali annebhelaga mala shabha kwa lyubha limo, na kila mwanja alikunjiila akuno alinkuti, ‘Ngunakwiipeta nneshelele’ munneshelele.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngulupai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Mitume gubhaabhalanjilenje Bhakulungwa a Yeshu, “Ntujenjesheye ngulupai.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje. “Nkakwetenje ngulupai jishoko kapela ja malinga mmbeju ja aladali, nkakombolenje kuubhalanjila agu nkujugu, ‘Tutumbuka ukaipandishile mbhaali,’ ukampilikenenje.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liengo lika Ntumishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Ibhaga mundu jumo munkumbi gwenunjimo akwete ntumishi, analima eu anashunga ngondolo. Bhuli, pabhuja kukoposhela kunngunda, shammalanjile ntumishijo. ‘Tenda shangu kuulye shalya’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Nng'oo! Shammalanjile, ‘Ndeleshela shalya, gwilume undumishile mpaka maliye kulya na ng'wa, penepo numbe ugwe shulye na ng'wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Bhuli, mundujo shantendele eja jwene ntumishijo kwa ligongo lya maliya yowe yalajilwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Bhai na mmanganya nneyo peyo nkamulangaga yowe innajilwenje, mmeleketanje kuti, ‘Uwe tubhatumishi twangali mbwaiko, tushikamulape maengo getu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwalamyanga Bhamangundula Kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>A Yeshu bhali mumpanda kwenda ku Yelushalemu bhashinkupita mumpika gwa ku Shamalia na ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Bhalijinjila nshilambo shimo, bhandunji kumi bhamangundula bhashinkwajiilanga a Yeshu, gubhajimingene kwa taliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Gubhautiyenje lilobhe bhalinkutinji, “Mmakulungwa a Yeshu, ntubhonele shiya!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhonanjeje gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnjendangane nkailangulanje kubhaabhishila.” Bhai, akuno bhalikwendangana, gubhalamilenje. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Jumo jula akabhoneje kuti alamile, gwabhujile alikwaakuya a Nnungu kwa lilobhe lya utiya. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Gwatindibhele pa makongono ga a Yeshu nkutenda eja. Jwenejo paaliji Nshamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhabhushiye, “Bhuli, nngabha bhandu kumi bhalamiywenje? Tisha bhala bhalinginji kwei? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Bhakwapinji bhandu bhananji bhabhujilengene kukwaakuya a Nnungu, ikabhe nnjenipeju?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Kungai gubhammalanjile mundu jula, “Jinuka gwiijendele, ngulupai jako jikulamiye.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiya kwa Upalume gwa a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matei 24:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Lyubha limo, Ashimapalishayo bhashinkwaabhuyanga a Yeshu, “Upalume gwa a Nnungu puukwiya shakani?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Upalume gwa a Nnungu ukaika kwa bhoneka. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Wala bhakabheleketanga, ‘Aguno apano’ eu ‘Agula akula.’ Pabha Upalume gwa a Nnungu muuli munkumbi gwenunji.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Shigaishe mobha gushinnokolilanje kapela nkalibhweninji lyubha limo lika Mwana juka Mundu, ikabheje nkalibhonanga. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Na bhandunji shibhammalanjilanje, ‘Nnolanje abhala akula eu, Abhano apano!’ Nnaakagulanje. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Pabha shiibhe malinga kumeta kwa nnjai, jinabhalula shangupe nilangaya mmbali yowe, nneyo peyo shiipingabha lyubha lya kwiya Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Ikabheje gakanabhe koposhela genego, anapinjikwa apotekwe kwa kaje na kanwa na bhandunji bha luluno lubheleko luno.”<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Na malinga shiyaliji mobha ga a Nuu, shiipinga kubha gene mobha gaka Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Bhandunji bhatendaga lyanganga na ng'wa, bhatendaga lombanga na lombwa, mpaka lyubha libhajinjile a Nuu shapina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumanya ukoto ga shapina, nshome nshitabhu sha Ndandubho shula ja 6 na 7.</char></note>. Nduluko gujiishe nikwaanititimiyanga bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Nneyo peyo shiibhe malinga puyakoposhele mobha ga a Lutu. Bhandunji bhatendaga lyanganga na ng'wa, bhaliumanga na pinda, bhalilimanga na shenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Ikabheje lyubha libhajawile a Lutu ku Shodoma, moto na bhonga yashinkunya mbuti ula kukopoka kunnungu, nikwaatitimiyanga bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Na malinga pushiibhe lyubha lya kwiya Mwana juka Mundu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Lyene lyubhalyo, jojowe shabhe pashitubhili na indu ili nnyumba, anatulushe kutola indu yakwe. Nneyo peyo ali kunngunda anabhuji kumui kutola shindu shoshowe. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Nkumbushilanje gaaimene akongobhabho a Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Jojowe shapinje kwiitapula nnyene shaiobhye, na shaiobhyejo shaitapule. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga, shene shilosho bhandunji bhabhili bhagonilenje pamo, jumo shotolwe na juna shalekwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Bhanabhakongwe bhabhili bhaliyaganga pamo, jumo shatolwe na juna shalekwe.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Bhandunji bhabhili shibhabhanganje mungunda, jumo shatolwe na juna shalekwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gamagwinji ga bhukala gangali nshitali gwa 36.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Penepo gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kwei Mmakulungwa?” A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Puugonile ntui ni pugaimana matumbui.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhakongwe Bhashitenga na Bhaukumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Bhai a Yeshu gubhatagulile lutango lwa kuti, inaapinjikwa kwaajuga a Nnungu mobha gowe, gwangali kuwa ntima. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Gubhashite, “Nshilambo shimo bhashinkupagwa bhaukumula bhamo bhakaajogopaga a Nnungu na wala kujali bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Na nshilambo shosho, bhashinkupagwa bhakongwe bhamo bhashitenga bhatendaga kwaajendela bhene bhaukumula bhala bhalinkuti, ‘Nng'ukumule mbate aki jangu kuka mmagongo nnjangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Gakupitaga mobha gamagwinji bhaukumula bhala bhalikana, ikabheje, kungai gubhailugulile bhayene. ‘Nkali ngakwaajogopa a Nnungu na wala ngajali bhandu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>ikabheje pabha abha bhashitengabha bhanangoya ukomu, shinaukumulile bhapate aki jabho, bhanapunde kwiya ndotoya!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Bhai Bhakulungwa a Yeshu gubhashite, “Mpilikananje shibhashite bheleketa bhene bhaukumula bhangali bha mmbone bhala. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Bhuli, a Nnungu bhakaatendelanga aki bhaagulwenje na bhayene, bhakwaagutilanga shilo na mui? Bhuli shibhakabhe kwaajangutilanga? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ngunakunnugulilanga shibhaajangutilanje shangupe. Ikabheje, bhuli pa shilambolyo shipabhe na ngulupai mobha gashaishe Mwana juka Mundu?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Mpalishayo na Nkamula Koli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>A Yeshu gubhaatanjilenje aluno lutango luno, bhene bhaibhonangaga kuti bhakwetenje aki, nikwaanyegayanga bhananji bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Bhandunji bhabhili bhashinkujombokanga kwenda kwaajuga a Nnungu Kuliekalu, jumo paaliji Mpalishayo, na juna nkamula koli.”<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>“Mpalishayo jula gwajimi, nikwaajuga a Nnungu shamuntima nnei, ‘Mmwe a Nnungu ngunakuntendela eja pabha nne nngabha malinga bhananji, bhadokanga na bhalambilanga eu bha labhalabha. Ngunakuntendela eja pabha nne nngabha malinga aju nkamula koliju. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Ngunatabha pabhili kwa juma jimo, ngunashoya mbepei ya lipungu lya kumi lya indu yangu yowe ingupata.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Ikabheje nkamula koli jula, ali ajimi kwataliya alijogopa nkali kujinula meyo gakwe kunnungu, ikabhe alikwiikoma pantima kwa kwibhonela shiya, gwashite, ‘Mmwe a Nnungu mmonele shiya nne ngwete yambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga, Nkamula koli jula pabhujile kunngwakwe ali abhalanganishiywe aki na a Nnungu kupunda Palishayo jula. Pabha jojowe akwiikweya shaatuluywe, na jojowe akwiituluya shaakweywe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaajujilanga Mboka Bhana Bhashoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matei 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Bhandunji gubhaapeleshelenje a Yeshu bhana bhashoko nkupinga bhaabhishilanje makono na bhaajujilanje mboka. Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakaabhonanjeje, gubhaakalipilenje. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaashemilenje bhalinkuti, “Mwaalekanje bhana bhashoko bhanyiilanje, wala nnaaibhililanje, pabha Upalume gwa a Nnungu ni gwa bhandunji malinga bhanganyabha. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mundu jojowe akauposhele Upalume gwa a Nnungu malinga mwana jwanshoko, akajinjila Muupalumemo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tajili Jumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matei 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Akalongolele bhamo bha Shiyaudi bhashinkwabhuya a Yeshu, “Mmajiganya mmambone, ndende bhuli mbate gumi gwa pitipiti?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Pakuti nnaanjema najwa mmbone? Jwakwa ali jwa mmbone ikabhe a Nnungu jikape. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Gwimanyi shalia. ‘Unalabhelabhe, unabhulaje, unajibhe, unakong'ondele ya unami na gwaaishimie ainago na akwenu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Nshanda jula gwabhalugulile, “Gene gowego nigakamwile tandubhila kuuungwendo gwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje genego, gubhammalanjile, “Ushitubhilwa shindu shimo, ukaushe indu yako yowe yuukwete, na mmbiyayo gwaagabhilanje bhalaga, na ugwe shiukole shibhiko shako kunnungu, kungai ujie kuungagule.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ikabheje mundu jula akapilikaneje genego, gwainginishe kwa kaje, pabha ashinkukola mali gamagwinji.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>A Yeshu gubhannolile gubhashite, “Shiibhe ukomu kuka tajili kujinjila Muupalume gwa a Nnungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kweli, shiikomboleshe ngamia kupeleta palilanga lya ingano, kupunda tajili kujinjila Muupalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Bhandunji bhala bhakapilikananjeje genego, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai igala gani shakombole tapulwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Gakaakomboleka na bhandunji, kwa a Nnungu ganakomboleka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>A Petili gubhashite “Nnole uwe tushileka indu yetu yowe itukwete nikunkagula!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, mundu jojowe aleshile nyumba eu akagwe eu akulugwe eu bhankwetenje eu bhana kwa ligongo lya Upalume gwa a Nnungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>Shaposhele yaigwinji kwa kaje agano mobha gano, na gumi gwa pitipiti mobha gakwiyago.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalugula Gwatatu Gawa na Yuka Kwabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matei 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>A Yeshu gubhaatolilenje likumi limo na bhabhili bhala kunyenje, nigubhaabhalanjilenje, “Mpilikananje! Tunajomboka kuloya ku Yelushalemu, kweneko gowe gajandikwe na ashinkulondola gaka Mwana juka Mundu shigatimilile. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Pabha shakamuywe kubhandu bha ilambo ina, na bhene bhanganyabho shibhampetekuyanje, shibhantukananje na kunng'unila mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Shibhankomanje na mishapilo nikummulaga, ikabheje lyubha lya tatu shayushe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Ikabheje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhangagamanyanga gene malobhego, pabha bhashinkuiywanga malombolelo gakwe, kwa nneyo bhangagamanyanga gubhabheleketaga.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Nangalole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matei 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>A Yeshu bhakabhandishileje ku Yeliko, mundu jumo nangalole nkujuga ashinkupagwa nnyenje mpanda alijuga. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Akapilikaneje lugwinjili lwa bhandu lulipita gwabhushiye, “Shipali nndi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Gubhammalanjilenje, “A Yeshu Bhanashaleti bhanapita.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Jwalakwe gwakweshiye lilobhe alinkuti, “A Yeshu, bhanabhabho a Daudi, mmonele shiya!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Bhandunji bhalongolelenje bhala gubhankalipilenje nkupinga apumule, ikabheje jwalakwe gwapundile kweya lilobhe, “A Yeshu bhanabhabho a Daudi mmonele shiya!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>A Yeshu gubhajimi, gubhatumile bhannjiyenabhonji pubhaliji pala. Nangalole jula akabhandishileje, a Yeshu gubhammushiye, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Upinga nikutendele nndi?” Gwashite, “Mmakulungwa, ngunapinga nole.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>A Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Bhai lola! Ngulupai jako jikulamiye.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Na shangupe nangalole jula gwakombwele kulola, gwabhakagwile a Yeshu alipita kwaakuya a Nnungu. Bhandunji bhowe bhakagabhonanjeje genego gubhainiyenje a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na a Shakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>A Yeshu gubhajinjile nshilambo sha ku Yeliko, nipita pakatipakati ja shene shilambosho. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Bhashinkupagwa bhandu bhamo pashilambopo bhashemwaga a Shakayo, bhakulungwa bha bhaakamula bhaaliji tajili. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Bhatendaga pinga bhaabhone a Yeshu shibhali, ikabheje kwa ligongo lya lugwinjili lwa bhandu na pabha bhashinkubha bhabhaupi, bhangakombola kwaabhona. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Kwa nneyo, kwa lubhilo, gubhalongolele, gubhakwelile munkongo gwankulungwa nkupinga bhaabhone a Yeshu, pabha shibhapite mpanda gogo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Bhai a Yeshu bhakaisheje penepo, gubhalolile kunani gubhashite, “A Shakayo, ntulushe shangu, pabha lelo shindame kunngwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>A Shakayo shangupe gubhatulwishe, gubhaaposhele kunngwabho akuno bhalikwinonyela kaje. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Bhandu bhowe bhakagabhonanjeje genego, gubhatandubhenje kuinginika bhalinkutinji, “Bhashikwenda tama kuka mundu akwete yambi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Ikabheje a Shakayo gubhajimi mmujo, gubhaabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa nnole! Nne shing'abhanye mali gangu pakatipakati naapanganje bhaalaga, na ibhaga nintolele mundu shindu shoshowe kwa unami, shinimmujishiye pasheshe.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Lelo ntapulo ujinjile nnyumba muno, pabha jweneju nneila peila ni jwa shipinga sha a Bhulaimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Pabha Mwana juka Mundu kwaishe kuloleya na tapula bhaobhilenje.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ela Likumi Limo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matei 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Bhandu bhatendaga kwaapilikanishiyanga a Yeshu, kwa nneyo gubhaatanjilenje lutango luna, bhashinkutenda nneyo pabha bhatendaga bhandishila ku Yelushalemu na bhandunji pubhaganishiyangaga kuti Upalume gwa a Nnungu unakwiya malanga gogo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhashinkupagwa bhandu bhamo bha shipinga sha upalume, bhashinkwenda kushilambo sha talika nkupinga bhakapegwe ukulungwa bhabhe a mpalume na bhabhuje. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Bhai, bhakanabhe jabhula bhashinkwaashemanga bhatumishi bhabho kumi, nikwapanganga kila mundu lipungu lya ela, bhalinkuti, ‘Ntendelanje upindi mpaka pushimuje.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Ikabheje bhashilambo ajabhonji bhatendaga kwaapatanga, gubhaatumilenje mitume bhakagulanje, bhakalugulanje kuti, ‘Tukakwaapinga abha bhatutagwale.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Bhakapateje upalume gubhabhujile kumui, na shangupe gubhalajile bhatumishi bhala bhashemwanje, nkupinga bhamumanye kila mundu shapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Ntumishi jwa ntai gwaishe nigwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa ela imwambele ila, ipatikene pwaida likumi limo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Na bhalabho gubhammalanjile, ‘Utendile ukoto, ugwe ntumishi nnguja. Pabha ushikulupalika pa shindu shishoko, shinikupe ukulungwa gwa ilambo kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Ntumishi jwa bhili gwaishe, nigwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa ela imwambele ila, mbatile pwaida paano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Bhakulungwa gubhammalanjile, ‘Numbe ugwe shubhe nkulungwa jwa ilambo nng'ano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>“Ntumishi juna gwaishe, nigwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa ajino ela jenu, nashinkuiya ukoto nshigubho, <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>pabha nashinkunnjogopa mmwe mmandu mmanonopa ntima. Mmwe nnatola yangali yenu, nnaneng'ena munkapandileje.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Na bhalabho gubhammalanjile, ‘Ngunakuukumula kwa ligongo lya malobhe gako, ugwe ntumishi ujwangali gwa mmbone! Ibhaga gwamumanyi kuti nne namundu jwa nonopa ntima, ngunatola yangali yanngu na ngunaneng'ena mungapandileje. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Bhai kwa nndi unabhishe ela jangu kubhenki, na nne ngatolile na pwaida nkubhuja mwanja gwangu?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Penepo gubhaalugulilenje bhalinginji pepala bhala, “Mumpokonyolanje elajo, nkampanganje apatile pwaida ja likumi limo jula.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmakulungwa, pakubha tayali apatile likumi limo!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Na bhalabho gubhaajangwilenje, “Jojowe akwete shindu shaajenjeshewe. Ikabheje jwangali shindu jula, nkali shakwete shila shaapokonyolwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>‘Nnaino, ga ashaamagongo ajangu bhakaapinganga nne kubha mpalume jwabhonji, mwajiyenabhonji apano, mwaabhulaganje pa meyo gangu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanajinjila ku Yelushalemu kwa Nng'angalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yowana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>A Yeshu bhakabheleketeje genego, gubhalongolele mmujo kuloya ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Bhakabhandishileje ku Bhetipage na ku Bhetania, tome na shitumbi sha Misheituni, gubhaatumilenje bhabhili munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa bhabho, <figure style="fig" alt="Colt" file="NT-15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:29">Mwana jwa Mbunda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnjendangane kushijiji shili mmujo jenunji. Pushinnjinjilangane, shimunng'imananje mwana jwa mbunda akanabhe jigala mundu, atabhilwe. Munngopolanje munnjiyenajonji apano. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ibhaga mundu shammuyanje, nkunngopolelanga nndi, mummalanjilanje, ‘Bhakulungwa bhanakumpinga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Bhai, gubhapitengene, niimana malinga shibhabhalanjilwenje. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Bhalikunngopolanga mwana jwa mbunda jula, bhayene gubhaabhushiyenje, “Nkunngopolelanga nndi mwana jwa mbundajo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhajangwilenje, “Bhakulungwa bhanakumpinga.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Bhai gubhaapeleshelenje Yeshu mwana jwa mbunda jula. Gubhatandikenje nngubho yabhonji panngongo gwakwe, gubhaakweshiyenje a Yeshu panani jakwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>A Yeshu pubhapitaga mumpanda, bhandunji gubhatandikenje nngubho yabhonji.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Bhakaisheje tome na ku Yelushalemu, bhalielela shitumbi sha Misheituni, lugwinjili lowe na bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhatandubhenje kuangalila na kwainiya a Nnungu kwa utiya, kwa ligongo lya ilapo yaigwinji ibhaibhweninji, <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>bhalinkutinji, “Bhakwete mboka A mpalume bhakwiya kwa lina lya Bhakulungwa. Ulele kunnungu na Ukonjelo kunani kajeko!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Penepo Ashimapalishayo bhana bhalinginji nnikundi mula gubhaabhalanjilenje a Yeshu, “Mmajiganya, mwalimbiyanje bhaajiganywa bhenu!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Ngunakummalanjilanga, bhanganyabha bhapumulangaga, maganga shigajobhele.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakushigutila Shilambo sha Yelushalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>A Yeshu bhakabhandishileje na kushibhona shilambo sha Yelushalemu shila, gubhashigutile <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>bhalinkuti, “Kaliji ukaimanyi ata ugwe lelo ipeleshela ulele! Ikabheje nnaino ishiiywa unaibhone. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Pabha ganakwiya mobha bhamagongo ajako, shibhakutimbililanje nikuibhilila mmbali yowe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Shibhakukandaganye ugwe na ashibhanago nkati pemo. Na bhakalekanga nkali liganga limo lijimi pa liganga lina, pabha gwangagamanya malanga ga ntapulo gwako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalangaya Liekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matei 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yowana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhapite ku Liekalu, gubhatandwibhe kwaabhinganjilanga palanga bhatendangaga upindi <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>bhalinkuti, “Ishijandikwa, ‘Nyumba jangu shijibhe nyumba ja kwaajujila a Nnungu,’ ikabheje mmanganya nshitendanga lishembo lya bhaapokonyola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Mobha gowe a Yeshu bhatendaga jiganya Nniekalu. Ikabheje ashikalongolele bha ashinkulondola, na bhaajiganya bha shalia na ashikalongolele bha bhandunji bhatendaga loleyanga namuna ja kwaabhulaga. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Ikabheje bhakamumanyangaga muutendelo, pabha bhandu bhowe bhatendaga kwaakagulilanga na kwaapilikanishiya.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Kubhuya ga Mashili ga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matei 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Lyubha limo, a Yeshu pubhaliji bhalijiganya bhandu Nniekalu na lunguya Ngani ja Mmbone, ashikalongolele bha bhakulungwanji bha bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha shalia na bhanangulungwa gubhaikengene, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>nigubhaabhushiyenje, “Ntubhalanjile! Genega punkutenda kwa mashili gashi na gani ampele?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Numbe nne shinimmuyanje, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>mashili ga a Yowana ga bhatisha kugakopweshele kwa a Nnungu eu kubhandu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ikabheje bhalabhonji gubhabhalanjilenenje, “Tutendaga kugakoposhele kwa a Nnungu, bhalabho shibhatubhuye, ‘Pakuti mmangaakulupalilanga?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Na tulugulaga kugakoposhele kubhandu, bhandunji bhowe shibhatukomanje na maganga, pabha bhowe bhanakulupalilanga kuti a Yowana pubhaaliji ankulondola.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Bhai, gubhajangulenje, “Tukakukumanya kugakoposhele kwei?”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nkali nne ngammalanjilanga ingutenda ino ngutenda kwa mashili gakeni?”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhaalima Bhangali bha Mmbone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matei 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>A Yeshu gubhaatanjilenje bhandunji aluno lutango luno, “Bhandu bhamo bhashinkulima nngunda gwa mishabhibhu, nikwaapolekanga nngunda gula bhaalimanga, kungai gubhajabhwile mwanja kwenda kushilambo sha taliya, gubhalonjeye kweneko. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Mobha ga maneng'eno, gubhantumile ntumishi jwabho ajende kubhaalimanga bhala, akatole ndalo ya maneng'eno ga nngunda gwa mishabhibhu. Ikabheje bhaalimanga bhala gubhankomilenje ntumishi jula, gubhamminjilenje gwabhujile gwaayoyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Bhayene nngunda bhala bhakuntumaga ntumishi juna, ikabheje nneila peila gubhankomilenje na kuntokomaya, gubhamminjilenje gwaayoyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Gubhantumile kabhili ntumishi jwatatu, najwalakwe, gubhanng'uleyenje, gubhamminjilenje munngunda mula.”<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Bhai bhayene nngunda bhala gubhaganishiye, “Shindende bhuli? ‘Shinintume mwanangu jwa jika jungumpinga peju, pana shibhanng'ishimunji.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Bhaalimanga bhala bhakammonanjepe, gubhabhalanjilenenje, ‘Jweneju ni apinga tola ulishi. Bhai tummulaje, ulishi shigubhe gwetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Bhai, gubhankwakwatilenje palanga nngunda gwa mishabhibhu gula, gubhammulegenje.” A Yeshu gubhabhushiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Bhai penepo bhayene nngunda bhala shibhaatendanje nndi bhene bhaalimangabho? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Shibhajiye nikwaabhulaganga bhaalimangabho na nngunda gwa mishabhibhugo shibhaapanganje bhaalimanga bhananji.” Bhandunji bhakapilikananjeje gene malobhego, gubhashitenje. “Nngabha, Inakoposhele nneyo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaalolinje, gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhai, gene Majandiko ga malombolelo gakwe nndi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Liganga libhakanilenje bhaashenganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Nnaino lishibha liganga likulu lya pa ndumba!’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Mundu jojowe agwilaga pantundu lyene ligangalyo apinga temekanga na linngwilaga mundu jojowe, lipinga kunkandaganya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuya ga Lipa Koli kwa a Kaishali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15">Matei 22:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Bhaajiganya bha Shalia na ashikalongolele bha bhakulungwanji bha bhaabhishila gwaapinjilenje kwaakamula palapepala, pabha bhamumanyinji kuti lwene lutangolo bhatanjilwenje ni bhobho pebho. Ikabheje bhatendaga kubhajogopanga bhandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Bhai, gubhaatumilenje bhandunji bhaitembilenje bhanguja, bhakaabhuyanje a Yeshu ibhuyo ya kwaatanjiya kwa malobhe gabho, nkupinga bhaakamulanje bhaapelekanje kwa ashikalongolele bha ukulungwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Bhai, bhatumilwenje bhala gubhaabhushiyenje a Yeshu, “Mmajiganya, tumumanyi mmwe nnabheleketa na kujiganya indu ya uguja na mwangali luagu, mmwe nnajiganya indu ya a Nnungu ipinjikwa bhandu bhatendanje. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Bhuli, ni alali uwe kulipa koli kwa a Kaishali eu nngabha?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhang'amwile kuti bhanakwaatejelanga, nigubhaabhalanjilenje, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Nnangulanje dinali. Bhuli, aji pishaji na gajandikwe pantundu jakwega ni ga keni?” Nigubhaajangwilenje, “Ga a Kaishali.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>A Yeshu nigubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhai, ili ya a Kaishali mwaapanganje a Kaishali na ya a Nnungu mwaapanganje a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Bhangakombolanga kwaakamula kwa gene gaabhelekete palugwinjili gala. Nigubhakanganigwenje majangulo gabho, gubhatemingenenje ilili.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Ngani ja Yuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matei 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Kungai Ashimashadukayo bhalugulanga kuti bhawilenje bhakayukanga, gubhaaishilenje a Yeshu nikwaabhuya, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>bhalinkutinji, “Mmajiganya, a Musha bhashinkutujandishila kuti nkulu mundu awaga nikunneka jwankongwe nshitenga gwangali kunkolela bhana, inapinjikwa mpwakwe ajinjile majumba, kupinga ankolele bhana nkulugwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Bhai, gene mobhago bhashinkupagwanga bhangwendo shabha bha nyumba jimo. Jwa lielo jula gwalombile na gwawile gwangali kuleka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Jwabhili jula gwajinjile majumba, na jwalakwe gwawile gwangali kukola mwana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>na jwatatu ni nneila peila. Nkubho gula nibha gula mpaka bhowe shabha bhala gubhawilenje gwangali kukolela bhana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Kungai na jwankongwe jula gwawile. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Bhuli, pushibhayukanje, jwankongwejo shabhe nkagwe gani? Pabha ashinkulombwa na bhowe shabha bhala.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhandunji bha gegano mobha gano bhanalombanga na lombwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Ikabheje bhene shibhayukanje nibhalanganishiwa nndamo ja gene mobhago, bhakalombanga wala bhakalombwanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Na shibhabhanganje mbuti ashimalaika bha a Nnungu na bhana bha a Nnungu bhakawanganga kabhili, pabha bhashiyuywanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Ikabheje, ga yuywa bhawilenje, nkali a Musha nneila peila bhakong'ondele Mmajandiko. Ga shitekete shakolelaga moto shila, bhanakwaashema Bhakulungwa kuti a Nnungu bha a Bhulaimu na bha a Ishaka na bha a Yakobho. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Bhai, bhenebho nngabha a Nnungu bha bhawilenje, ikabhe a Nnungu bha bhakotonji, pabha kwa bhenebho bhowe bhakotonji.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Bhaajiganya bhananji bha Shalia gubhashitenje, “Mmajiganya nshijangula ukoto kaje.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Na bhandunji bhala bhangalinganga kwaabhuya kabhili.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Kilishitu ni Mwana Juka Gani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matei 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Ni kwa bhuli bhanabheleketanga kuti a Kilishitu ni bha shipinga sha a Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Pabha bhayene a Daudi bhanabheleketa nshitabhu sha Mbeembela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘BHAKULUNGWA bhashinkwaalugulila Bhakulungwa bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Ntame kunkono gwangu gwa nnilo<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>Mpaka pushinaabhikanje ashaamagongo ajenunji palibhatila makongono genu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Ibhaga a Daudi bhakwaashema bhenebho, Bhakulungwa bhai, shibhabhe bhuli bhana bhabho?<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaabheleketa ga Bhaajiganya bha Shalia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Akuno bhandu bhowe bhalikwapilikanishiyanga a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Mwiiteiganje na bhaajiganya bha Shalia inakwaanonyelanga pita jimajima akuno bhali bhawalilenje majoo. Inakwaanonyelanga kukomaywa mummbala ya ushiya indu na tama mwiitengu ya mmujo mmashinagogi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Kwa ugulumba, bhanakwaatolelanga bhanabhakongwe bha shitenga indu yabhonji, bhalikwiitembanganga kuti bhanguja, bhalikwaajuganga a Nnungu kwa leupya. Bhene bhanganyabho shibhaukumulwanje kupunda bhananji.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Mbepei ya Bhakongwe bha Shitenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maliko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>A Yeshu bhatendaga kwalolesheyanga matajili bhalitaganga mbepei yabhonji nshibhiko sha ekalu, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>gubhaaweni bhakongwe bhamo bhashitenga na bhaalaga bhalitumbushiya shenti ibhili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Bhai, gubhashite, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, bhene bhakongwe bha shitenga bhaalagabha bhashitaga yaigwinji kupunda bhowenji. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Pabha bhananji bhowe bhashishoyanga mbepei ya indu ipundile pa indu yabhonji ila, ikabheje abha na kulaga kwabho, bhashishoya yowe ibhakulupalilaga nkulamila.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilangulo ya Mobha ga Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matei 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhatendaga kungulushilanga ga Liekalu shilishite kelengelelwa kwa maganga ga konja na indu ishoshiywe mbepei kwa a Nnungu. Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhashite, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Gene gowe gunkugabhonangaga shigaishe mobha nkali liganga limo likalepeka pantundu liganga lina, gwangali kubhomolwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilaje na Mboteko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matei 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bhai, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmajiganya, genego shigakoposhele shakani? Na ilangulo yashi shiikoposhele kulangula genego gali tome na koposhela?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Mwiiteiganje nnatembwanga. Pabha bhabhagwinji shibhaikangane bhalikwitembanga kuti nne a Kilishitu Bhaatapula na malanga gala gabhandishile. Ikabheje mmanganya nnaakagulanje! <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Bhai, pushimpilikananje ga ngondo na tendebhukana, nnajogopanje, pabha yeneyo inapinjikwa ikoposhele oti, ikabheje mpelo gwa gowe, ukanabhe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Bhai gubhapundile bheleketa. “Shilambo shimo shishikomane na shilambo shina, na upalume gumo shiukomane na upalume guna. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kupinga koposhela kuungumila kwa litaka kwa punda, na limbukute lya shibhanga na ilwele ya jambushiya mmbali yaigwinji. Kupingabha na indu ya jogoya na ilangulo yaikuluikulu kunnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>“Ikabheje yene yoweyo ikanabhe koposhela shibhankamulanje nikumpotekanga na shibhampelekanje Mmashinagogi na kuntabhanga mmagelesha na shimpelekwanje kwa bhakulungwa na kubhakulungwanji kwa ligongo lyangu, <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>yeneyo shiikoposhele nkupinga mwaakong'ondelanje ngani jangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Ikabheje nnakolanje lipamba mmitima jenunji kuti shimmeleketanje nndi sha kuitapula, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>pabha shinimpanganje malobhe na lunda, gaatenda ashaamagongo ajenunji bhakakombolanga kunkananga wala kuntaukanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Bhankwetenje na ashapwenu na ashalongo ajenunji na ashambwiga ajenunji shibhankananje na mmananji shimmulagwanje. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Bhandu bhowe shibhampatanje, kwa ligongo lya lina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ikabheje, nkali luumbo lumo lwa mmitwe jwenunji lukaobha. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Kwa kwiikakatimila kwenunji shimwitapulanje.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalondola Kubhomolwa kwa Shilambo sha Yelushalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matei 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maliko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Pushinshibhonanje shilambo sha Yelushalemu shitimbililwe na makuga ga ashimanjola, bhai mmumanyanje kuti gabhandishile malanga ga shene shilambosho kuangabhanywa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Penepo bhalinginji ku Yudea bhabhutushilanje mwitumbi, bhalinginji kunnjini bhashokangane, na bhalinginji mmigunda bhanabhujangane kunnjini. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Pabha gene mobhago shigabhe ga mboteko ya a Nnungu kubhandu bhabho, nkupinga gowe gajandikwe Mmajandiko gamalile. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Ole gwabhonji bhakwetenje ndumbo na bhajonjeyanga gene mobhago! Pabha shipingapagwa shilaje shapunda nshilambo, na nnjimwa ya a Nnungu shiyajiilanje bhene bhandunjibha. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Bhana shibhabhulagwanje kwa upanga, bhana shibhatolwe ubhanda mwiilambo yowe na shilambo sha Yelushalemu shipinga libhatwa na bhandunji bha ilambo inape mpaka mobha gabhonji pushigatimilile.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiya kwa Mwana juka Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matei 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Kupingabha na ilangulo kulyubha, kumwei, na kundondwa. Ilambo ya pashilambolyo ni ipingabha nshilaje kwa ligongo lya lipamba ga nng'indo gwa mabhimbili ga bhaali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Bhandunji shibhaondokanje kwa ligongo lya bhoga, bhalilolelanga indu ipinga koposhela nshilambolyo, pabha mashili ga kunnungu gapinga tikinywa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Kungai, shibhammonanje Mwana juka Mundu alikwiya mmaunde, ali na mashili na ukonjelo nkulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Malanga gushigatandubhe genego kukoposhela, nnjimangane, nnjinulanje meyo genunji kunani, pabha kugombolwa kwenunji kubhandishile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ntini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-34">Matei 24:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kungai gubhaabhalanjilenje lutango, “Nnolanje ntini na mikongo jina jowe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Punkubhonanga jiliipuka maamba, nnakumumanyanga kuti shuku shibhandishile. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Nneyo peyo, pushimmonanje genego galikoposhela, shimmumanyanje kuti Upalume gwa a Nnungu ubhandishile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, alu lubheleko lwa nnainolu lukapita mpaka gene gowega gamalile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Kunnungu na shilambolyo shiipite, ikabheje malobhe gangu gakapita.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusheya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Mwiiteiganje, mitima jenunji jinakwiibhuka nkupoka na kolelwa na kuabhushila ya nndamo jino. Lyene lyubhalyo linakunng'imananga shiimushila mbuti kutanjila kwa nnukonji. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Nneyo ni shiipinga koposhela, kubhandu bhowe bhaatamangana pa shilambolyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Bhai nsheyanje, nkwaajuga a Nnungu mobha gowe, kupinga mpatanje mashili ga kwiitapula pushigakoposhele genego na jima mmujo jika Mwana juka Mundu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Kila mui a Yeshu bhatendaga jiganya Nniekalu, ikabheje shilo bhatendaga tama kushitumbi sha Misheituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Bhandu bhowe bhatendaga labhanga lyamba, kwenda ku Liekalu kukwaapilikanishiya.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa Kwaabhulaga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Shikukuu sha mikate jangatagwa ngedule, shishemwa pashaka, shatendaga bhandishila. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha shalia, bhatendaga loleyanga mwa kwabhulajila a Yeshu, ikabhe bhatendaga kwaajogopanga bhandunji.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yuda Bhanakwaatendebhuka a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:14-16">Matei 24:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Bhai, Lishetani akwaajinjilaga a Yuda Ishikaliote, bhaliji munkumbi gwa mitume kumi na bhabhili bhala. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>A Yuda gubhapite kunguluka na ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na bhakulungwanji bha manjola, shibhapinga kwaendebhuka a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Nabhalabhonji guyaanonyelenje nigubhalegenenje kwaapa mmbiya. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>A Yuda gubhakundile, gubhatemi nkuloleya malanga ga mmbone ga kwaatendebhuka a Yeshu gwangali kumumanya bhandu bhabhagwinji.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukolokoya Shalya sha Pashaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matei 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yowana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Bhai, lyubha lya mikate jangatagwa ngedule guliishile. Lyubhalyo lya ingwa mwana jwa ngondolo jwa pashaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Kwa nneyo a Yeshu gubhaatumilenje a Petili na a Yowana, gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnjendangane nkakolokoyanje shalya tulye pashaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Gubhaabhushiyenje, “Punkupinga tukakolokoye kwei?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Mpilikananje! Pushinnjendangane kunnjini, shinng'imikananje na jwannume jumo ajigele lulo lwa mashi. Munkagulanje mpaka nnyumba jashaajinjile. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Mwaalugulilanje bhayene nyumba, ‘Bhaajiganya bhanakummuya, jili kwei kati jibhapinga lila pashaka na bhaajiganywa bhabho?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Na bhenebho shibhannangulanje kati jikulungwa kugolopa jikonjeleywe, nnkolokoyanje mwenemo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Bhai, gubhapitengene, gubhaimenenje indu yowe malinga shibhabhalanjilwenje na a Yeshu, gubhakolokoyenje shalya sha pashaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalamu ja Bhakulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matei 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bhakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Malanga gakatimilileje, a Yeshu gubhatemi pamo na mitume bhabho nkulya shalya. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Njilokolila kaje kulya pashakaji pamo na mmanganya nganabhe potekwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Pabha ngajilya kabhili mpaka penepo pushijimalile mu Upalume gwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Kungai gubhatolile shikombe sha divai, gubhatendile eja, gubhashite, “Ntolanje nnepesheyane mmowe. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Pabha ngunakummalanjilanga, ngang'wa kabhili divai ja shabhibhu mpaka Upalume gwa a Nnungu pushuishe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Kungai, gubhatolile nkate, gubhatendile eja, gubhaugebhenye, gubhaapelenje bhalinkuti, “Sheshino shiilu shangu shipinga shoywa kwa ligongo lyenunji. Ntendanje nnei kwa ngumbushila nne.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Nneyo peyo bhakalyanganjeje gubhatolile shikombe, gubhashite, “Ashino shikombe shino, sha malagano ga ambi gakong'ondelwa na minyai jangu jijitika kwa ligongo lyenunji.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Ikabheje, nnolanje! Andendebhuka jula pali na nne pamesha pepano. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Kweli Mwana juka Mundu anakwenda bhulagwa malinga shiipanjilwe, ikabheje ole, mundu andendebhuka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Penepo gubhatandubhenje kubhuyana ashaayene, gani shatende yeneyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mitau ja Gani Shabhe Nkulungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Na kabhili nikoposhela mitau munkumbi gwabonji, kuti gani shabhe nkulungwa kupunda bhananji. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhapalume bha ilambo bhanakwaatagwalanga bhandu bhabhonji kwa mashili, ikabhe pubhaashemwanga ‘Bhamituka.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Ikabheje mmanganya, inabhe nneyo, ali nkulungwa jwenunji anapinjikwa abhe nshoko jwa bhowe, na ali kalongolele abhe malinga ntumishi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Igala jwei ali nkulungwa, atama kulya shalya, eu akolokoya jula? Penepo nkulungwa ni atama kulya! Ikabheje nne munkumbi gwetu muno, ni malinga ntumishi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Mmanganya ntemingene na nne mobha ga lingwa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>na malinga atati shibhangamwiye upalume, nneyo peyo numbe nne ngunakunkamuyanga mmanganya. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Nkupinga nniyanganje na papila pamesha jangu, muupalume gwangu, na shintamangane mwiitengu ya ukulungwa kugaukumula makabhila kumi na gabhili ga Ishilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalondola Kuti a Petili Shibhaakane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31">Matei 26:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>A Yeshu gubhashite “A Shimoni, a Shimoni! Mpilikane! Lishetani anapinga ampembulanje mmanganya mbuti ngano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Ikabheje nne ninnjujile mmwe a Shimoni, nkupinga ngulupai jenu jinapungushe. Na mmwe pushimmujilepo mwaataganje ntima ashaapwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Na a Petili gubhaajangwile, “Mmakulungwa, nne apano nili tayali kwenda tabhwa kumagelesha, nkali kuwa na mmwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Ngunakummalanjila mmwe a Petili, lelo lipongo likanabhe kongobhela shinngane patatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nng'uko, Nkobha na Upanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Punantumilenje gwangali nng'uko gwa ela, wala nkobha gwa ilatu, mwatubhilwenje shoshowe?” Gubhajangwilenje, “Nng'oo twanngatubhilwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Ikabheje nnaino, jwene akwete nng'uko gwa ela jula ajigale, na akwete nkobha, nneyo peyo. Na jojowe jwangali upanga, aushe likoti lyakwe aume gumo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga, ganapinjikwa gatimilile majandiko gaanugula nne kuti, ‘Bhashinkubhikwa likundi limo na bhaalebhanga,’ elo, gowe gajandikwe kunugula nne ganapinjikwa gamalile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhashitenje, “Mmakulungwa, nnole, apano jipali mipanga jibhili.” Na bhalabho gubhashite, “Bhai shijipwae.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaajuga a Nnungu Kushitumbi sha Misheituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matei 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Na malinga shibhayobhelele, a Yeshu gubhapite kushitumbi sha Misheituni, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaakagwilenje. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Bhakaikanganeje kweneko gubhaalugulilenje, “Mwaajuganje a Nnungu nnajinjilanga mmalinjilo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Kungai gubhaaleshilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhapite kwa taliya kashoko kwa leshela mundu liganga kuika, gubhatindibhele nkwaajuga a Nnungu <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>bhalinkuti, “Atati, ibhaga nkupinga, nnjosheye shikombe sha mbotekoshi, nkali nneyo, itendeshe malinga shinkupinga mmwe, na wala nngabha malinga shingupinga nne.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Malaika kukopoka kunnungu akwaakoposhelega kukwaataga ntima. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Bhali mmboteko ya kaje, gubhamindile kwaajuga a Nnungu, na matukuta gabho nibha mbuti mandondo ga minyai, galindolishila pai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana gangali nshitali gwa 43 na 44</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Bhakaajuganjeje a Nnungu, gubhabhujile kubhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhaaimenenje bhagonilenje lugono kwa totoshela nkuinjika. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pakubha nnagonanga? Nnjumukanje maajuganje a Nnungu, nnajinjilanga mmalinjilo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaakamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yowana 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>A Yeshu bhakanabhe peya kubheleketa, likundi lya bhandunji guliishe lililongoywa na Yuda, bha munkumbi gwa kumi na bhabhili bhala. A Yuda gubhaabhandishile a Yeshu nkupinga kwaalamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “A Yuda! Bhuli, nnakuntendebhuka Mwana juka Mundu kwa kunnamba?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakabhonanjeje nneila gubhashitenje, “Mmakulungwa, tutole mipanga jetu twaakapanje?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Na jumo gwaleshele upanga mukantumishi jwa bhakulungwa bha bhaabhishila, gwankatile likutu lya kunnilo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhashite, “Bhai nnekanje!” Gubhalikwashiye likutu lila, gubhannamiye.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila, na ashikalongolele bha bhalinda bha liekalu, na bhanangulungwa bhajilengene kukwakamula, “Bhuli, nnshikwiyangana kungamula na mipanga na ndonga mbuti nne nankupokonyola? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Mobha gowe gunaliji na mmanganya nniekalu nkangamulanga nkangamulangaga. Ikabheje gegano ni malanga genunji, malanga ga upalume gwa lubhindu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakwaakana a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matei 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliko 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yowana 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Bhai, gubhaakamulenje, gubhaatolilenje kwendanabhonji kwa akalongolele bha bhaabhishila. A Petili gubhakagwile nnyuma kwa kwaataliya. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Moto gwashinkukumbanywa pakati lugwani, gwaatemingene penepo pamo, na a Petili pubhaaliji popo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Ntumishi jumo jwankongwe gwabhabhwene a Petili bhatemi tome pamoto, gwabhakolondolesheye meyo, nigwashite, “Abha bhandubha nnepeila pubhaliji na a Yeshu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Ikabheje a Petili gubhakanile bhalinkuti, “Gwee! Nne ngakwaamanya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Kashokope, mundu juna akwaabhonaga a Petili, nigwashite, “Numbe mmwe ni nkumbi gula.” Ikabheje a Petili gubhajangwile “Ika mmwe, nngabha nne!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ikapiteje malanga ga shaa jimo, mundu juna gwakomelesheye, “Kweli abha bhandubha pubhaliji na a Yeshu, pabha na bhalabho Bhagalilaya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Ikabheje a Petili gubhashite, “Ika mmwe, ngakwiimanya inkubheleketayo!” Na popo pepo, bhakanabhe maliya kubheleketa, lipongo gulikongobhele.<verse eid="LUK 22:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Bhakulungwa gubhatendebhwishe nikwaalola a Petili, na bhalabho a Petili gubhakumbushile gubhabhalanjilwe na Bhakulungwa, “Lipongo likanabhe kongobhela lelo, shinngane patatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Penepo gubhakopweshe palanga gubhagutile kwa kaje.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalembulwa na Komwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matei 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maliko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Bhandunji bhaabhikaangaga a Yeshu muulinda, gubhaakomilenje na kwaalembula. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Gubhaatabhilenje shimbala kumeyo, nikwabhuyanga, “Nnondole! Ntulugulile gani ankomile.” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Gubhaabheleketelenje malobhe gamagwinji ga matukano.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ku Lukumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yowana 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Kukasheje, bhanangulungwa gubhaimenenje yani, ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha shalia. A Yeshu gubhapelekwe kulukumbilo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Nigubhashitenje, “Ibhaga mmwe a Kilishitu ntubhalanjile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Nkali nimmalanjilangaga, nkakulupalilanga, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>nkali nimmuyanje nkanyangulanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ikabheje kutandubhila nnaino, Mwana juka Mundu shatame kunkono nnilo gwa Bhakulungwa a Nnungu Bhakwete Mashili.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Penepo bhowenji nigubhashitenje “Igala tutende mmwe bhanabhabho a Nnungu?” Na bhalabho gubhashite, “Mmanganya ninkutinji Nne ni Jwenejo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Na bhalabhonji nigubhashitenje, “Bhuli, tupinga ukong'ondelo guna? Twaashayene tupilikene bhalibheleketa pa kang'wa jabho bhayene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu kwa a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yowana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Bhai likundi lyowe, gubhajimingene, nikwaapeleka a Yeshu kwa a Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Gubhatandubhenje kwaashitakiya bhalinkutinji, “Bhene bhandubha bhatendaga kwaapuganyanga bhandunji bhetu, bhalikwalimbiyanga kulipa koli kwa a Kaishali na bhalikwiishema a Kilishitu na a mpalume.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>A Pilato gubhaabhushiye a Yeshu, “Mmwe a mpalume bha Bhayaudi?” A Yeshu gubhaajangwile “Mmwe ni nkubheleketa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>A Pilato gubhaabhalanjilenje ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na lugwinjili lwa bhandu, “Ngakushibhona shibhalebhile abha bhandubha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Ikabheje na bhalabhonji gubhapundilenje kukwiya bhalinkutinji, “Bhanakwiya nnjasha kwa majiganyo gabho nshilambo showe sha ku Yudea, kundubhila ku Galilaya, mpaka apano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu kwa a Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>A Pilato bhakapilikaneje genego gubhabhushiye, “Bhuli, abha bhandubha bha ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Bhakamumanyeje kuti a Yeshu bhaliji mu Ukulungwa gwa a Elode, gubhaapeleshe kwa a Elode, pabha gene mobhago pubhaliji pa Yelushalemu pepala.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>A Elode guyaanonyele bhakaabhoneje a Yeshu. Pabha bhapilikene ngani jabho, kwa nneyo kwa mobha gamagwinji bhatendaga loleya kwaabhona. Na kabhili bhatendaga pinga bhaabhone bhalitenda ilangulo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Bhai, a Elode gubhakabhile nkwabhuya, ikabheje a Yeshu bhangaajangula shoshowe. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na bhaajandika bha shalia, gubhajimingene nkukong'ondela mashitaka gabhonji kwa kakati. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Bhai, a Elode na ashimanjola bhabho, gubhaalembulenje a Yeshu nikwatendela mbenji, kungai gubhaawashiyenje lijoo lya Upalume, gubhabhujilenabhonji kwa a Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>A Elode na a Pilato bhukala pubhalinginji bhamagongo, kutandubhila lyene lyubhalyo gubhalinginji bhambwiga.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaukumulwa Kubhulagwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matei 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yowana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Bhai, a Pilato gubhashemile shitamo sha ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na ashikalongolele bhana bha bhandunji, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nshimbeleshelanga abha bhandubha kuti, bhanaapuganya bhandu. Ngakagulileje lyene lilobheli pameyo genunji, nangashibhona shibhalebhile shilingana na mashitaka genunji. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Numbe nngabha nne jikape, ikabhe nkali a Elode bhangashibhona shoshowe shibhalebhile, nigubhamujishiye. Pabha abha bhandubha shakwapi shibhatendile shapinjikwa bhaukumulwe kubhulagwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Kwa nneyo shinajile bhakomwe ibhoko, kungai shinaaleshelele.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Pabha bhashinkupinjikwa kwaagopolelanga nkutabhwa jumo lyubha lya shikukuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana gangali nshitali gwa 17</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ikabheje bhowe gwaajobhelenje gwanakamo, “Mwaabhulaje abho, ntugopolele a Bhalabha!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>A Bhalabha bhashinkutabhwa kwa ligongo lya nnjasha yatendeshe pa shilambo na ligongo lya bhulaga bhandu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>A Pilato bhapinjile kwaaleshelela a Yeshu, bhai gubhakungulwishe kabhili na bhandunji, <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>ikabheje bhalabhonji gubhapundilenje jobhela, “Mwaakomele munshalabha, mwaakomele munshalabha!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>A Pilato gubhaabhalanjilenje gwatatu, “Bhalebhile nndi? Ngakushibhona shoshowe shibhalebhile shapinjikwa bhabhulagwe, kwa nneyo shindume bhakomwe ibhoko, naaleshelele.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Ikabheje bhalabhonji gubhapundilenje kujobhela, kuti a Yeshu bhanapinjikwa bhakomelwe munshalabha. Kungai, malobhe gabhonji gugapilikanishe. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Bhai a Pilato gubhaukumwile kuti, itendeshe malinga shibhapinjilenje. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Gubhaaleshelele a Bhalabha bhatabhilwe kwa ligongo lya nnjasha na bhulaga bhandu. Gubhaakamwiye a Yeshu kwa ashimanjola, bhaatendelanje malinga shibhapingangaga.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakomelwa Munshalabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:27-37">Yowana 19:27-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Bhalinginji nkwaapeleka, gubhaimikenenje naka mundu jumo ashemwaga Shimoni jwa ku Kilene, alikopoka kunngunda. Bhai, gubhankamwilenje, gubhantwishilenje nshalabha gula aujigale nnyuma ja a Yeshu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Bhandunji, makundi kwa makundi gubhaakagulenje, munkumbimo bhapalinji bhanabhakongwe bhaagutilangaga ililo. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>A Yeshu gubhaatendebhushilenje, gubhashite, “Mmanganya ashinabhiti bha pa Yelushalemu! Nnang'utilanje nne, ikabhe mwiigutilanje mwaashayene na ashibhana bhenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Pabha, shigaishe mobha pushimmeleketanje, mbaya ashinannii na bhakanabhe kolanga wala kujonjeya! <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Penepo, bhandunji shibhailugululanje itumbi, ‘Ntugwilanje!’ Na ijomboya, ‘Ntuunishilanje’! <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Ibhaga bhandunji bhakuutendelanga nnei nkongo gwa mmii, shiibhe bhuli kwa nkongo gwa nnjumu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Bhandunji bhana bhabhili bhaalebhanga, bhashinkupelekwanga bhabhulagwanje pamo na a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Bhakaikanganeje pashemwaga, Shibhanga sha Ntwe, penepo gubhaakomelenje munshalabha a Yeshu na bhandunji bhabhili bhaalebhanga bhala, jumo kunkono nnilo, na juna kunkono nshinda. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Atati mwaaleshelelanje, pabha bhakakwimanyanga ibhatendanga.” Gubhagebhenenje nngubho yabho kwa tendela shikoma.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Bhandunji gubhajimingene bhalilosheyanga. Na bhalabhonji ashikalongolele bha Shiyaudi gubhaatendelenje mbenji bhalinkutinji, “Bhashikwatapulanga bhananji, nnaino bhaitapule bhayene, monaga bhenebha bhali a Kilishitu bha a Nnungu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Ashimanjola nneyo peyo gubhaatendelenje mbenji a Yeshu, gubhaajendelenje nikwaapa divai ja shashama bhapapile, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>bhalinkutinji, “Monaga mmwe nni A mpalume bha Bhayaudi, mwiitapule mmayene.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Na pantundu nshalabha gwabho pashinkujandikwa mmbila “BHENEBHA A MPALUME BHA BHAYAUDI.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Na nkulebha jumo akomelwe munshalabha jula, gwabhatukene alinkuti, “Bhuli, igala mmwe nngati a Kilishitu? Bhai mwiitapule mmayene, ntutapule na uwe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Ikabheje nkulebha juna jula gwankalipile mwine alinkuti, “Ugwe ukakwaajogopa a Nnungu? Numbe uli na ukumu jojo. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Uwe tushiukumulwa kwa aki, kwa itendi yetu. Ikabheje abha bhandubha shakwapi shoshowe shibhalebhile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Kungai nigwashite, “Mmwe a Yeshu! Nngumbushile pushinnjinjile mu Upalume gwenupo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>A Yeshu gubhannjangwile, “Kweli ngunakuubhalanjila, lelope shuubhe na nne kupaladisho.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanawa Munshalabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:38-41">Maliko 15:38-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Yowana 19:25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Puyaaliji malanga ga shaa shita ja mui, lubhindu lukutabhaga shilambo showe mpaka shaa tisha, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>na lukulungushi lwa Nniekalu lukupapukaga ipande ibhili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>A Yeshu gubhagutile kwa utiya, “Atati, mmakono genu ngunabhika mbumu yangu.” Bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa genego gubhamalile.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Penepo, bhakulungwa bha ashimanjola bhala bhakagabhoneje gatendeshe gala, gubhaaniye a Nnungu bhalinkuti, “Kweli abha bhandubha pubhaliji bha aki.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Bhandu bhowe bhaikengene pepala kulolesheya genego, bhakagabhonanjeje gene gatendeshe gala, gubhabhujilengene kunngwabhonji, bhalikwikomanga pantima nkuinjika. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Ashambwiga ajabho a Yeshu, na bhanabhakongwe bhakagulangaga kukopoka ku Galilaya, gubhajimingene kwa talika bhalilolesheyanga genego.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanashikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Bhai bhashinkupagwa bhandu bhamo lina lyabho a Yoshepu, bhaliji bhanguja na bha aki. Pubhaliji bha lukumbi lukulu lwa Bhayaudi, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>ikabheje bhenebho bhanganonyelwa na ukumu na itendi ya ashikalongolele ajabho. Bhenebha pubhaliji bhashilambo bha ku Alimataya shilambo sha Bhayaudi. Na bhatendaga lindilila kuika kwa Upalume gwa a Nnungu kwa nnolelo nkulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>A Yoshepu gubhaajendele a Pilato, gubhajujile bhapegwe shiilu sha a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Kungai gubhatulwiye shiilu munshalabha, gubhailijilile shanda ja kitani ja mmbone, gubhabhishile nnikabhuli lyaolilwe nnindandawe likulungwa, lyaliji likanabhe shikwa mundu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Pulyaaliji lyubha lya kolokoya indu ya Lyubha lya Pumulila, na pulyaaliji tome na tandubha.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Bhanabhakongwe bhajilengene pamo na a Yeshu kukopoka ku Galilaya, gubhaakagwilenje a Yoshepu, gubhaliweninji likabhuli na shibhashite kwaashika a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Kungai, gubhabhujengene kumui, gubhajenjilenje mauta ga nunjila ga kwenda pakaya shiilu sha a Yeshu. Lyubha lya Pumulila, gubhapumulilenje malinga shiyalajilwe na shalia.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyuka kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Lyambape lyubha lya Jumapili, gubhapitengenenje kulikabhuli bhali bhajigelenje mauta ga nunjila gubhajenjilenje gala.<figure style="fig" alt="Tomb" file="NT-16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:1">Likabhuli lya a Yeshu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Gubhaimenenje liganga lya ibhila palikabhuli pala linokolelwe kunyenje likabhuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bhakajinjilanjeje nkati, bhangashiimananga shiilu sha Bhakulungwa a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Bhalinginji nkukanganigwanga ga genego, shangupe bhandunji bhabhli bhawetenje nngubho ya ng'anyima mbuti kumeta kwa nnjai, bhajimingene pa tome.<verse eid="LUK 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Bhanabhakongwe bhala gubhajogopenje, gubhatindibhekelenje mpaka shenyi pantaka. Penepo bhandunji bhala gubhaalugulilenje, “Kwa nndi nkwaaloleyanga bhabhakoto munkumbi gwa bhawilenje? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Bhakwapi apano, bhayushile. Nkumbushilanje shibhammalanjilenje pubhaliji ku Galilaya kuti, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>inapinjikwa Mwana juka Mundu akamuywe mmakono ga bhandunji bhakwetenje yambi, bhankomelanje munshalabha na lyubha lya tatu shayushe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Penepo bhanabhakongwe bhala, gubhakumbushilenje malobhe ga a Yeshu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Bhakabhujanganeje kukopoka kumakabhuli, gubhapite kwaalugulilanga ashimitume kumi na jumo bhala, na bhananji gene gowego. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Bhene bhapelekenje jene nganijo kwa ashimitume pubhalinginji, a Malia Magidalena, a Yowana na a Malia anyinabhabho a Yakobho, na bhanabhakongwe bhana bhubhalongenabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Ikabheje bhapilikenenje bhala, bhangakulupalilanga pabha malobhe gala bhashinkubhoneka mbuti gangali mana. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Nkali nneyo, a Petili gubhajabhwile shibhutuka mpaka kulikabhuli. Bhakatepeje kuulumila nkati, gubhajibhwene shanda bhangashibhona shindu shina. Gubhaijabhulile akuno bhalipita kanganigwa ga yowe ikoposhele.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja gwa ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliko 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Lyubha lyolyo, bhandunji bhabhili munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa bha a Yeshu, bhatendaga kwendangana kushijiji shimo shishemwa Emau, mwanja gwa maili shabha kukoposhela ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Bhatendaga kungulushilanga gowe gakoposhele gala. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Bhalinginji nkukunguluka a Yeshu bhayene gubhakoposhele, gubhailundile. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Ikabheje meyo gabhonji gashinkugubhikwa bhanaamanyanje.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Gubhaabhushiyenje, “Nkukungulushilanga nndi akuno nnikwendangana?” Gubhajimingene akuno bhainjikenje kumeyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Jumo ashemwa Kileopashi gwabhajangwile, “Bhuli, pa Yelushalemu mmwe jikape mmajeni nkagugamanya gakoposhele kweneko agano mobha gano?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Na bhalabho gubhabhushiye, “Gei genego?” Bhalabhonji gubhaajangulenje, “Ngani ja a Yeshu Bhanashaleti. Bhenebho pubhaliji ankulondola, bhakwete mashili gamakulungwa, kwa malobhe gabho na itendi yabho pa meyo ga a Nnungu na pabhandu bhowe. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Ashikalongolele bha bhaabhishila na ashikalongolele bhetu bhashinkwaakamulanga nikwaukumula bhabhulagwe, gubhaakomelelenje munshalabha <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ikabheje twakulupalile kuti bhenebho shibhajigombole Ishilaeli. Kupunda gene gowego, lelo lyubha lya tatu tandubhila pugatendeshe. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Na kabhili bhanabhakongwe bhana bha munkumbi gwetu bhashikutuimuyanga. Bhashinkwendangana kulikabhuli lyambape, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>bhangashiimananga shiilu shabho. Gubhabhujengene gubhashitenje kuti bhashinkukoposhelwanga na ashimalaika bha kunnungu bhalugulenje kuti a Yeshu bhabhakoto. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>A Shaajetunji bhapitengene kulikabhuli gubhakong'ondelenje ibhalugulenje bhanabhakongwe ila, ikabheje bhangaabhonanga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Pakubha mmanganya mmangumba nneyo na mitima jenunji jinatopa kukulupalila gowe galugwilwe na ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Bhuli, a Kilishitu bhakapinjikweje kupotekwa, na kwa nneyo bhajinjile muukonjelo gwabho?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Gubhaatalashiyenje gowe gaatayaga bhenebho, Mmajandiko kutandubhila a Musha mpaka ashinkulondola bhowe bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Bhakabhandishilanjeje shijiji shibhajendanganaga shila, a Yeshu gubhatendile mbuti bhanapunda kwenda mmujo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Ikabheje bhanganya bhala gubhaashondelesheyenje bhalinkutinji, “Ntame pano na uwe, pabha kunapilila, na shilo shinabhandishila.” Bhai, gubhajinjile nnyumba, gubhateminabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Bhakatameje kulya nabhonji, gubhatolile nkate, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu, gubhaugebhenye, gubhaapelenje. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Shangu meyo gabhonji gakutandanukaga, gubhaamanyinji, ikabheje bhenebho gubhaobhile pa meyo gabhonji. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Bhai, gubhabhalanjilenenje, “Bhuli mitima jetu jikakolelaga nkwiinonyela, pubhatutalashiyaga Majandiko mumpanda mula?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Gubhajabhulengenenje gene malanga pegala, gubhabhujengene ku Yelushalemu. Gubhaaimenenje bhaajiganywa kumi na jumo bhala, na bhandunji bhatemingene pamo <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>bhalibheleketanga, “Kweli bhakulungwa bhayushile, bhaakoposhele a Shimoni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Bhai, bhene bhaajiganywa bhabhili bhala gubhaalugulilenje gowe gaaimenenje mumpanda, na shibhashite kwaamanyanga a Yeshu nkugabhanya nkate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaakoposhelanga Bhaajiganywa Bhabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yowana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6-8">Matei 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Bhalinginji nkutalashiya genego a Yeshu bhayene gubhajimi pakati jabhonji, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Ulele ubhe na mmanganya.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Gubhaimukenje na jogopa kujila bhakulibhonanga lioka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Kwa nndi nnajogopanga? Kwa nndi nnakolanga lipamba mmitima jenunji? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Nnolanje makono na makongono gangu, kuti ni nne namwene. Mmbapayanje mmonanje, pabha lioka lyangali shiilu na maupa malinga shinkumonanga shino.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Bhakabheleketeje genego, Gubhaalangulenje makono na makongono gabho. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bhangakulupalilanga kwa ligongo lya kwiinonyela na kanganigwa, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pepano nkwetenje shalya shoshowe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Gubhaapelenje shipande sha shamaki jwa joka. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Gubhatolile, nigubhatawine bhowe bhalikwaalolanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje, “Gegano ni gunamalanjilenje punaliji pamo na mmanganya, kuti gowe gajandikwe ga nugula nne, Nshalia ja a Musha, na Ashinkulondola, na Shabhuli ganapinjikwa gatimilile.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Penepo, gubhaapelenje lunda lwa kugamanya Majandiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Ishijandikwa, kuti a Kilishitu shibhapotekwe na lyubha lya tatu shibhayushe. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Na kuti, kwiipeta na kuleshelelwa kwa yambi shikulunguywe kupitila lina lyabho, kuumila ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Mmanganya ni mmaakong'ondela bha genega. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Nnolanje, shinimpeleshelanje miadi ja Atati, ikabheje ntamangane pano, mpaka pushinimpeleshelanje mashili ga kopoka kunnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatolwa Kunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:9-11">Matei 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Kungai gubhalongoyenje mpaka ku Bhetania, gubhajinwile makono gabho kunani, nigubhaajujilenje mboka. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Akuno bhalikwaajujilanga mboka, gubhaaleshilenje, gubhatolilwe kunani kunnungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Gubhaatindibhalilenje, nigubhabhujilengene ku Yelushalemu bhalikwinonyelanga kwa kaje. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Gubhatemingenenje mobha gowe Nniekalu bhalikwainiyanga a Nnungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
